","Leader"],["color","Blue"],["Special Trait","Saiyan"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","Future Trunks Saga"],["Character","Son Goku/Vegeta/Vegito"],["BANDAI Disclaimer","This promotional card is marked “Not For Sale” by BANDAI, as the manufacturer prefers that Stores do not sell these cards."]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Permanent] If your life is at 4 or less, this card gets +5000 power during your opponent's turn.\r\n\n[Auto] When this card attacks, draw 1 card.\r\n\n[Activate:Main] If you have 4 or more energy : Choose up to 1 blue \"Son Goku\" and 1 yellow \"Vegeta\" card in your hand with energy costs of 2 or less and play them, you can only play \"Trunks: Future\" and \"Vegito\" cards for the duration of the turn, and you can't activate this skill for the duration of the game.\r\n\n[Awaken] When your life is at 4 or less : You may draw 1 card and flip this card over.\r\n\n\r\n\nSSB Vegito, Energy Eruption\r\n\n[Auto] When this card attacks, draw 1 card.\r\n\n[Auto] [Once per turn] When you combo with 1 or more Battle Cards with a combo cost of 1 in your Energy Area using a skill, choose up to 1 of those Battle Cards, and when the battle ends the chosen card is returned to its owner's hand instead of being placed in its owner's Drop Area."}],"prices":[],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/201874/dragon-ball-super-ccg-tournament-promotion-cards-son-goku-and-vegeta-ssb-vegito-energy-eruption-championship-final-2019-gold-metal-foil"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Son%20Goku%20%26%20Vegeta%20%2F%2F%20SSB%20Vegito%2C%20Energy%20Eruption%20(Championship%20Final%202019)%20(Gold%20Metal%20Foil)"}]},{"id":"201877","name":"Son Goku & Vegeta // SSB Vegito, Energy Eruption (Championship Final 2019) (1st Place)","number":"BT7-025_PR","subtitle":"Promo","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/201877_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer