ked “Not For Sale” by BANDAI, as the manufacturer prefers that Stores do not sell these cards."]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Activate:Battle] When this card is in a battle, choose 1 Extra Card in your hand and place it in your Drop Area : Choose up to 1 card in your life and add it to your hand, draw 1 card, then this card gets +5000 power and this skill is negated for the duration of the battle.\r\n\n[Awaken:Surge] Choose 1 red card and 1 blue card in your hand and place them under this card : You may draw 3 cards, then choose up to 1 of your energy, switch it to Active Mode, and flip this card over.\r\n\n\r\n\nUltra Instinct Son Goku, Limits Surpassed\r\n\n[Activate:Main/Battle] [Once per turn] If your life is at 5 or less and you choose 1 card under this card and place it in its owner's Drop Area : Choose one —\r\n\n• If you have a \"Universe 7\" card in play, draw 1 card, then your opponent reveals their hand. Choose up to 1 Extra Card or Battle Card with 35000 power or less from it and place it in their Drop Area.\r\n\n• Choose up to 3 multicolor Extra Cards with different names in your Drop Area and/or Warp and add them to your hand."}],"prices":[],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/501604/dragon-ball-super-ccg-tournament-promotion-cards-son-goku-ultra-instinct-son-goku-limits-surpassed-championship-2023-golden-card-vol2-version-1"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Son%20Goku%20%2F%2F%20Ultra%20Instinct%20Son%20Goku%2C%20Limits%20Surpassed%20(Championship%202023%20Golden%20Card%20Vol.2%2C%20Version%201)"}]},{"id":"501605","name":"Son Goku // Ultra Instinct Son Goku, Limits Surpassed (Championship 2023 Golden Card Vol.2, Version 2)","number":"BT9-100","subtitle":"Promo","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/501605_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/501605_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Tournament