 by BANDAI, as the manufacturer prefers that Stores do not sell these cards."]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Deflect] [Revenge]\r\n\n[Permanent] While this card is in Rest mode, your opponent can't attack your Leader Card unless they choose 2 cards in their hand and discard them each time. \r\n\n[Auto] When this card is played from your hand, choose all other non-token cards in all Battle Areas and all Unison Cards, ignoring [Barrier], negate their skills, and place them in their owner's Drop Areas. Your opponent chooses 2 cards in their hand and discards them, and if your Leader Card is a mono-green \"Majin\" card, place those cards under your Leader Card.\r\n\n[Auto] If you have 5 or more energy: If this card is placed in your Drop Area from your Battle Area by an opponent's skill, play this card from your Drop Area."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"foil","value":4.75,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":1.47,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":4.75,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/517009/dragon-ball-super-ccg-tournament-promotion-cards-majin-buu-unadulterated-destruction-championship-selection-pack-2023-vol3"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/517009/dragon-ball-super-ccg-tournament-promotion-cards-majin-buu-unadulterated-destruction-championship-selection-pack-2023-vol3"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Majin%20Buu%2C%20Unadulterated%20Destruction%20(Championship%20Selection%20Pack%202023%20Vol.3)"}]},{"id":"501557","name":"Majin Buu, Ultimate Despair (Championship Selection Pack 2023 Vol.2) (Silver Foil)","number":"BT14-077","subtitle":"Promo","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/501557_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/501557_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Tournament Promotion Cards"],["number","BT14-077"],["