1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/261689_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Tournament Promotion Cards"],["number","BT16-002"],["rarity","Uncommon"],["type","Leader"],["color","Red"],["Special Trait","God/Universe"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","Universe Survival Saga"],["Character","Great Priest"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Permanent] You can't include non-\"God\" Battle Cards in your deck, and negate the [Energy-Exhaust] skill of \"God\" cards in all of your areas.\r\n\n[Activate:Main] Switch this card to Rest Mode : Draw 1 card.\r\n\n[Awaken] When there are 4 or more colors in your energy : You may switch this card and up to 2 of your energy to Active Mode, add cards from your life to your hand until you have 6 life left, then flip this card over.\r\n\n\nGreat Priest, Commander of Angels\r\n\n[Permanent] Negate the [Energy-Exhaust] skill of \"God\" cards in all of your areas.\r\n\n[Activated: Battle] [Once per turn] Switch this card to Rest Mode : Draw 1 card, then choose up to 1 multicolor \"God\" card in your hand and use it in a combo."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":299,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":null,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/261689/dragon-ball-super-ccg-tournament-promotion-cards-great-priest-great-priest-commander-of-angels-world-championship-2021"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/261689/dragon-ball-super-ccg-tournament-promotion-cards-great-priest-great-priest-commander-of-angels-world-championship-2021"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Great%20Priest%20%2F%2F%20Great%20Priest%2C%20Commander%20of%20Angels%20(World%20Championship%202021)"}]},{"id":"266671","name":"SSB Vegeta, for the Universe's Survival (Event Pack 09) (Alternate Foil)","number":"BT16-012","subtitle":"Promo","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/266671_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/266671_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Tournament Promotion Cards"],["number","BT16-012"],["rarity","Promo"],["type","Battle"],["color","Red"],["Energy(Color Cost)","4 (RR)"],["Special Trait","Saiyan/Universe 7"],["power","20000"],["Combo Power","5000"],["Combo Energy","0"],["Era","Universe Survival Saga"],["Character","Vegeta"],["BANDAI Disclaimer","This promotional card is marked “Not For Sale” by BANDAI, as the manufacturer prefers that Stores do not sell these cards."]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Deflect] [Critical]\r\n\n[Auto] When this card is played, draw 1 card, then choose up to 2 of your opponent's Battle Cards, ignoring [Barrier], and they get -15000 power for the turn.\r\n\n[Activate: Main] [Sparking 10] 2, if your Leader Card is a mono-color \"Universe 7\" card: Play this card from your hand."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"foil","value":2.73,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":2.54,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":2.73,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/266671/dragon-ball-super-ccg-tournament-promotion-cards-ssb-vegeta-for-the-universes-survival-event-pack-09-alternate-foil"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/266671/dragon-ball-super-ccg-tournament-promotion-cards-ssb-vegeta-for-the-universes-survival-event-pack-09-alternate-foil"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=SSB%20Vegeta%2C%20for%20the%20Universe's%20Survival%20(Event%20Pack%2009)%20(Alternate%20Foil)"}]},{"id":"261690","name":"Son Goku // SSG Son Goku, Crimson Warrior (World Championship 2021)","number":"BT16-020","subtitle":"Uncommon","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/261690_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/261690_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Tournament Promotion Cards"],["number","BT16-020"],["rarity","Uncommon"],["type","Leader"],["color","Blue"],["Special Trait","Saiyan"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","Battle of Gods Saga"],["Character","Son Goku"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Activate:Battle] If this card is in a battle and you choose 1 \"Saiyan\" card in your hand and discard it : Draw 1 card, then add up to 1 card from your life to your hand and negate this skill for the battle.\r\n\n[Awaken] When your life is at 2 or less or you place 5 \"Saiyan\" cards under this card from your Drop Area : You may draw 3 cards, switch up to 1 of your energy to Active Mode, and flip this card over.\r\n\n\nSSG Son Goku, Crimson Warrior\r\n\n[Auto] When this card attacks, draw 1 card, then switch up to 1 of your mono-blue energy to Active Mode.\r\n\n[Activate:Battle] [Once per turn] Place X cards from under this card in their owner's Drop Areas : This card gets +2000 power for the battle for each card placed in a Drop Area using this skill. Additionally, if you placed 3 or more cards in Drop Areas using this skill, draw 1 card, then switch up to 1 of your mono-blue energy to Active Mode."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":699,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":null,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/261690/dragon-ball-super-ccg-tournament-promotion-cards-son-goku-ssg-son-goku-crimson-warrior-world-championship-2021"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/261690/dragon-ball-super-ccg-tournament-promotion-cards-son-goku-ssg-son-goku-crimson-warrior-world-championship-2021"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Son%20Goku%20%2F%2F%20SSG%20Son%20Goku%2C%20Crimson%20Warrior%20(World%20Championship%202021)"}]},{"id":"261694","name":"Whis // Whis, Invitation to Battle (World Championship 2021)","number":"BT16-021","subtitle":"Uncommon","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/261694_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/261694_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Tournament Promotion Cards"],["number","BT16-021"],["rarity","Uncommon"],["type","Leader"],["color","Blue"],["Special Trait","God"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","Battle of Gods Saga"],["Character","Whis"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Activate:Main] Switch this card to Rest Mode : Draw 1 card, then play up to 1 blue or yellow skill-less Battle Card with 15000 power from your deck or Drop Area in your opponent's Battle Area in Rest Mode. Shuffle your deck if you looked through it.\r\n\n[Awaken] When your life is at 3 or less or your opponent's Leader Card's back is facing up : You may draw 2 cards, then flip this card over.\r\n\n\nWhis, Invitation to Battle\r\n\n[Auto] [Once per turn] When one of your \"Beerus\" cards attacks and KOs an opponent's Battle Card, switch up to 1 blue \"Beerus\" card in your energy to Active Mode.\r\n\n[Activate:Main] Switch this card to Rest Mode : Draw 1 card, then play up to 1 blue or yellow skill-less Battle Card with 15000 power from your Drop Area in your opponent's Battle Area in Rest Mode."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":299,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":null,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/261694/dragon-ball-super-ccg-tournament-promotion-cards-whis-whis-invitation-to-battle-world-championship-2021"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/261694/dragon-ball-super-ccg-tournament-promotion-cards-whis-whis-invitation-to-battle-world-championship-2021"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Whis%20%2F%2F%20Whis%2C%20Invitation%20to%20Battle%20(World%20Championship%202021)"}]},{"id":"266598","name":"Great Priest, Invitation to Battle (Card Game Fest 2022)","number":"BT16-023","subtitle":"Promo","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/266598_in_1000x1000.jpg","