S4 Son Goku & SS4 Vegeta, In It Together (World Championship 2022 Alternate Art)","number":"BT18-001","subtitle":"Uncommon","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/477539_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/477539_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Tournament Promotion Cards"],["number","BT18-001"],["rarity","Uncommon"],["type","Leader"],["color","Red"],["Special Trait","Saiyan"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","Shadow Dragon Saga"],["Character","Son Goku: GT/Vegeta: GT"],["BANDAI Disclaimer","This promotional card is marked “Not For Sale” by BANDAI, as the manufacturer prefers that Stores do not sell these cards."]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Permanent] You can use your mono-red Rest Mode \"Saiyan\" cards in combos.\r\n\n[Auto][Once per turn] When you use a card in a combo, look at up to 3 cards from the top of your deck, add up to 1 red \"Saiyan\" card or 1 red Unison with a specified cost of 2 among them to your hand, and place the remaining cards at the bottom of your deck in any order.\r\n\n[Awaken] When your life is at 4 or less or you have 2 or more energy and both \"Son Goku : GT\" and \"Vegeta : GT\" cards in your Z-Energy : You may draw 1 card, switch up to 1 of your energy to Active Mode, and add cards from your life to your hand until you have 6 life left.\r\n\n\nSS4 Son Goku & SS4 Vegeta, In It Together\r\n\n[Permanent] You can use your mono-red Rest Mode \"Saiyan\" cards in combos.\r\n\n[Permanent] Your \"Gogeta : GT\" cards can attack your opponent's Battle Cards in Active Mode, and when your \"Gogeta : GT\" cards attack your opponent's Battle Cards, your opponent skips their Defense Step.\r\n\n[Auto][Once per turn] When you activate [Union-Fusion], this card gains \"Gogeta : GT\" for the turn.\r\n\n[Auto] When this card attacks, draw 1 card, then play up to 1 red \"Saiyan\" card with an energy cost of 1 from your hand in Rest Mode."}],"prices":[],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/477539/dragon-ball-super-ccg-tournament-promotion-cards-son-goku-and-vegeta-ss4-son-goku-and-ss4-vegeta-in-it-together-world-championship-2022-alternate-art"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Son%20Goku%20%26%20Vegeta%20%2F%2F%20SS4%20Son%20Goku%20%26%20SS4%20Vegeta%2C%20In%20It%20Together%20(World%20Championship%202022%20Alternate%20Art)"}]},{"id":"477540","name":"Son Goku & Vegeta // SS4 Son Goku & SS4 Vegeta, In It Together (World Championship 2022 Alternate Art) (Metal)","number":"BT18-001","subtitle":"Uncommon","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/477540_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/477540_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Tournament Promotion Cards"],["number","BT18-001"],["rarity","Uncommon"],["type","Leader"],["color","Red"],["Special Trait","Saiyan"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","Shadow Dragon Saga"],["Character","Son Goku: GT/Vegeta: GT"],["BANDAI Disclaimer","This promotional card is marked “Not For Sale” by BANDAI, as the manufacturer prefers that Stores do not sell these cards."]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Permanent] You can use your mono-red Rest Mode \"Saiyan\" cards in combos.\r\n\n[Auto][Once per turn] When you use a card in a combo, look at up to 3 cards from the top of your deck, add up to 1 red \"Saiyan\" card or 1 red Unison with a specified cost of 2 among them to your hand, and place the remaining cards at the bottom of your deck in any order.\r\n\n[Awaken] When your life is at 4 or less or you have 2 or more energy and both \"Son Goku : GT\" and \"Vegeta : GT\" cards in your Z-Energy : You may draw 1 card, switch up to 1 of your energy to Active Mode, and add cards from your life to your hand until you have 6 life left.\r\n\n\nSS4 Son Goku & SS4 Vegeta, In It Together\r\n\n[Permanent] You can use your mono-red Rest Mode \"Saiyan\" cards in combos.\r\n\n[Permanent] Your \"Gogeta : GT\" ca