a & Trunks // SS Son Goku, SS Vegeta, & SS Trunks, the Ultimate Team (Fighter's Ambition Holiday Pack)","number":"BT19-001","subtitle":"Promo","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/454486_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/454486_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Tournament Promotion Cards"],["number","BT19-001"],["rarity","Promo"],["type","Leader"],["color","Red"],["Special Trait","Saiyan/Earthling"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","Android 13 Saga"],["Character","Son Goku/Vegeta/Trunks: Future"],["BANDAI Disclaimer","This promotional card is marked “Not For Sale” by BANDAI, as the manufacturer prefers that Stores do not sell these cards."]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Auto] When this card attacks, draw 1 card.\r\n\n[Awaken] When your life is at 4 or less, or you have 2 or more energy and a \"Son Goku\", \"Vegeta\", or \"Trunks : Future\" card—all red and with [EX-Evolve]—in play : You may draw 1 card, switch up to 1 of your energy to Active Mode, and add cards from your life to your hand until you have 6 life left.\r\n\n\nSS Son Goku, SS Vegeta, & SS Trunks, the Ultimate Team\r\n\n[Auto] Discard 1 red \"Saiyan\" card from your hand : When this card attacks, draw 2 cards.\r\n\n[Activate : Main] [Once per turn] If you have 3 or more mono-red energy : Play up to 1 \"Son Goku\", \"Vegeta\", or \"Trunks : Future\" card—all red and with an energy cost of 1—from your Drop with its skills negated for the turn in Rest Mode, and at end of turn, place that card in your Drop."}],"prices":[],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/454486/dragon-ball-super-ccg-tournament-promotion-cards-son-goku-and-vegeta-and-trunks-ss-son-goku-ss-vegeta-and-ss-trunks-the-ultimate-team-fighters-ambition-holiday-pack"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Son%20Goku%20%26%20Vegeta%20%26%20Trunks%20%2F%2F%20SS%20Son%20Goku%2C%20SS%20Vegeta%2C%20%26%20SS%20Trunks%2C%20the%20Ultimate%20Team%20(Fighter's%20Ambition%20Holiday%20Pack)"}]},{"id":"454487","name":"Gero's Supercomputer // Android 13, Terror's Inception (Fighter's Ambition Holiday Pack)","number":"BT19-002","subtitle":"Promo","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/454487_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/454487_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Tournament Promotion Cards"],["number","BT19-002"],["rarity","Promo"],["type","Leader"],["color","Red"],["Special Trait","Android"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","Android 13 Saga"],["Character","Gero's Supercomputer/Android 13"],["BANDAI Disclaimer","This promotional card is marked “Not For Sale” by BANDAI, as the manufacturer prefers that Stores do not sell these cards."]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"Gero's Supercomputer\r\n\n\r\n[Permanent] This card can't attack.\r\n\n\r\n[Activate:Main] Switch this card to Rest Mode : Look at up to 5 cards from the top of your deck, add up to 1 red \"Android\" card among them to your hand, then shuffle your deck.\r\n\n\r\n[Awaken] When your life as at 4 or less, or you have 2 or more energy and 1 or more \"Android 14\" and \"Android 15\" cards—both red and with an energy cost of 1—in your Battle Area and/or Drop : You may switch this card and up to 1 of your energy to Active Mode, and add cards from your life to your hand until you have 6 life left.\r\n\n\n\r\nAndroid 13, Terror's Inception\r\n\n\r\n[Auto] When this card attacks, choose one—\r\n\n\r\n• Play up to 1 \"Android 14\" or \"Android 15\" card—both red and with an energy cost of 1—from your hand.\r\n\n\r\n• Draw 1 card.\r\n\n\r\n[Auto] Place 1 \"Android\" card from your Z-Energy in its owner's Drop : When you play a red \"Android\" card, add up to 1 red \"Android\" card from your Drop to your Z-Energy."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"normal","value":0.66,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"normal","value":0.