hters-ambition-holiday-pack"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/454490/dragon-ball-super-ccg-tournament-promotion-cards-son-gohan-son-gohan-former-glory-regained-fighters-ambition-holiday-pack"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Son%20Gohan%20%2F%2F%20Son%20Gohan%2C%20Former%20Glory%20Regained%20(Fighter's%20Ambition%20Holiday%20Pack)"}]},{"id":"454491","name":"Son Goten & Trunks // Gotenks, Fusion Hiccup (Fighter's Ambition Holiday Pack)","number":"BT19-035","subtitle":"Promo","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/454491_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/454491_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Tournament Promotion Cards"],["number","BT19-035"],["rarity","Promo"],["type","Leader"],["color","Blue"],["Special Trait","Saiyan/Earthling"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","DBS : SUPER HERO Saga"],["Character","Son Goten : SH/Trunks : SH/ Gotenks : SH"],["BANDAI Disclaimer","This promotional card is marked “Not For Sale” by BANDAI, as the manufacturer prefers that Stores do not sell these cards."]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"Son Goten & Trunks\r\n\n\r\n[Auto] [Once per turn] When you use a blue card from your hand in a combo, draw 1 card.\r\n\n\r\n[Awaken] When your life is at 4 or less, or you have 2 or more energy and there 1 or more \"Son Goten : SH\" and \"Trunnks : SH\" cards in your Z-Energy and/or Drop : You may draw 1 card, switch up to 1 of your. energy to Active Mode, and add cards from your life to your hand until you have 6 life left.\r\n\n\n\r\nGotenks, Fusion Hiccup\r\n\n\r\n[Auto] When this card attacks, draw 1 card, and this card gets +5000 power for the turn.\r\n\n\r\n[Auto] When this card attacks a Battle Card with an energy cost of 8 or more, the card this card attacked can't attack during your opponent's next turn, and negate this skill for the game.\r\n\n\r\n[Activate:Battle] [Once per turn] (U), if your opponent has 3 or more energy and there are 1 or more \"Son Goten : SH\" and \"Trunks : SH\" cards in your Combo Area : Draw 1 card, switch up to 1 of your blue \"Gotenks : SH\" cards to Active Mode, and at end of turn switch up to 1 of your energy to Active Mode."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"normal","value":0.41,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"normal","value":0.39,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":0.41,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/454491/dragon-ball-super-ccg-tournament-promotion-cards-son-goten-and-trunks-gotenks-fusion-hiccup-fighters-ambition-holiday-pack"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/454491/dragon-ball-super-ccg-tournament-promotion-cards-son-goten-and-trunks-gotenks-fusion-hiccup-fighters-ambition-holiday-pack"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Son%20Goten%20%26%20Trunks%20%2F%2F%20Gotenks%2C%20Fusion%20Hiccup%20(Fighter's%20Ambition%20Holiday%20Pack)"}]},{"id":"475826","name":"Beerus, Airy Annihilator (Championship 2022 Zenkai Selection Pack)","number":"BT19-036","subtitle":"Promo","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/475826_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/475826_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Tournament Promotion Cards"],["number","BT19-036"],["rarity","Promo"],["type","Z-Battle"],["color","Blue"],["Energy(Color Cost)","2(UU)"],["Z-Energy Cost","2"],["Special Trait","God"],["power","10000"],["Era","Battle of Gods Saga"],["Character","Beerus"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Barrier]\r\n\n\r\n[Auto] When this card attacks, choose up to 1 of your opponent's Battle Cards with an energy cost greater than their current energy and place it at the bottom of its owner's deck, and this card gets +5000 power for the turn.\r\n[Activate:Main] [Once per turn] (U)(U), if your opponent has 3 or more e