 to 5 cards from the top of your deck, add up to 1 \"Son Goku : Br\", \"Vegeta : Br\", or \"Gogeta : Br\" card?all green and with an energy cost of 6 or less?among them to your hand, shuffle your deck, and this card gets +5000 power for the battle.\r\n\n[Auto] If you have 2 or more energy : When one of your Z-Energy cards activates [EX-Evolve], you may flip this card to its back. If you do, draw 1 card, switch up to 1 of your energy to Active Mode, and add cards from your life to your hand until you have 6 life left.\r\n\n[Awaken] When your life is at 4 or less : You may draw 1 card and switch up to 1 of your energy to Active Mode.\r\n\n\nGogeta, Fusion Complete\r\n\n[Auto] [Once per turn] When you play a green Battle Card with [EX-Evolve] from your Z-Energy or a green \"Gogeta : Br\" card with a [Union] skill from your hand, draw 1 card.\r\n\n[Auto] When this card attacks, draw 1 card, and this card gets +5000 power for the battle."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"normal","value":4.33,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"normal","value":4.69,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":4.33,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/454494/dragon-ball-super-ccg-tournament-promotion-cards-veku-gogeta-fusion-complete-fighters-ambition-holiday-pack"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/454494/dragon-ball-super-ccg-tournament-promotion-cards-veku-gogeta-fusion-complete-fighters-ambition-holiday-pack"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Veku%20%2F%2F%20Gogeta%2C%20Fusion%20Complete%20(Fighter's%20Ambition%20Holiday%20Pack)"}]},{"id":"454495","name":"Broly // Broly, the Ultimate Saiyan (Fighter's Ambition Holiday Pack)","number":"BT19-068","subtitle":"Promo","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/454495_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/454495_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Tournament Promotion Cards"],["number","BT19-068"],["rarity","Promo"],["type","Leader"],["color","Green"],["Special Trait","Saiyan/Frieza's Army"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","DBS : Broly Saga"],["Character","Broly : Br"],["BANDAI Disclaimer","This promotional card is marked “Not For Sale” by BANDAI, as the manufacturer prefers that Stores do not sell these cards."]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"Broly\r\n\n\r\n[Activate:Main] [Once per turn] Discard 1 card from your hand : Look at up to 7 cards from the top of your deck, choose up to 2 green Extras among them, place them under this card, and shuffle your deck.\r\n\n\r\n[Awaken] When your life is at 4 or less or you have 2 or more energy and there are 5 or more Extras under this card : You may draw 1 card and switch up to 1 of your energy to Active Mode.\r\n\n\n\r\nBroly, the Ultimate Saiyan\r\n\n\r\n[Auto] When this card attacks, draw 1 card, place up to 1 green Extra from your Drop to your Z-Energy.\r\n\n\r\n[Activate:Main] [Once per turn] Place 1 green Extra from your hand under this card : Your opponent discards 1 card from their hand.\r\n\n\r\n[Activate:Battle] Place1 green Extra from under one of your \"Broly : Br\" cards in its owner's Drop : Choose up to 1 of your \"Broly : Br\" cards and it gets +5000 power for the battle."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"normal","value":1.81,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"normal","value":3,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":1.81,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/454495/dragon-ball-super-ccg-tournament-promotion-cards-broly-broly-the-ultimate-saiyan-fighters-ambition-holiday-pack"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/454495/dragon-ball-super-ccg-tournament-promotion-cards-broly-broly-the-ultimate-saiyan-fighters-ambition-holiday-pack"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Broly%20%2F%2F%20Broly%2C%20the%20Ultimate%20Saiyan%20(Fighter's%20Ambition%20Holiday%20Pack)"}]},{"id":"454496","name":"SS Broly, Awakened Might (Fighter's Ambition Holiday Pack)","number":"BT19-070","subtitle":"Promo","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/454496_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/454496_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Tournament Promotion Cards"],["number","BT19-070"],["rarity","Promo"],["type","Z-Battle"],["color","Green"],["Z-Energy Cost","2"],["Special Trait","Saiyan/Frieza's Army"],["power","15000"],["Era","DBS : Broly Saga"],["Character","Broly : Br"],["BANDAI Disclaimer","This promotional card is marked “Not For Sale” by BANDAI, as the manufacturer prefers that Stores do not sell these cards."]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Z-Awaken] (G), when your life is at 4 or less : Green \"Broly : Br\".\r\n\n\r\n[Auto] When this card attacks, look at up to 7 cards from the top of your deck, place up to 2 green Extras among them under one of your \"Broly : Br\" cards, and this card gets +10000 power for the battle.\r\n\n\r\n[Activate:Battle] Place 1 green Extra from under one of your \"Broly : Br\" cards in its owner's Drop : Choose up to 1 of your cards and it gets +5000 power for the battle."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"normal","value":0.73,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"normal","value":4,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":0.73,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/454496/dragon-ball-super-ccg-tournament-promotion-cards-ss-broly-awakened-might-fighters-ambition-holiday-pack"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/454496/dragon-ball-super-ccg-tournament-promotion-cards-ss-broly-awakened-might-fighters-ambition-holiday-pack"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=SS%20Broly%2C%20Awakened%20Might%20(Fighter's%20Ambition%20Holiday%20Pack)"}]},{"id":"477472","name":"Jiren, the Immovable (Championship 2022 Zenkai Selection Pack)","number":"BT19-071","subtitle":"Promo","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/477472_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/477472_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Tournament Promotion Cards"],["number","BT19-071"],["rarity","Promo"],["type","Z-Battle"],["color","Green"],["Energy(Color Cost)","2(GG)"],["Z-Energy Cost","2"],["Special Trait","Alien/Pride Troopers/Universe 11"],["power","15000"],["Era","Universe Survival Saga"],["Character","Jiren"],["BANDAI Disclaimer","This promotional card is marked “Not For Sale” by BANDAI, as the manufacturer prefers that Stores do not sell these cards."]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Deflect]\r\n\n[Auto] When this card is played, choose up to 1 of your green Battle Cards with an energy cost of 5 or less, and it can't be removed from Battle Areas by your opponent's skills until the end of their next turn.\r\n\n[Activate:Main] [Limit 1] Place any number of your Z-Energy cards in their owners' Drops : Choose up to 1 of your opponent's Unisons and remove a marker from it for each Z-Energy placed in a Drop by this skill. Additionally, if you placed 2 or more Z-Energy in Drops by this skill, this card gets +10000 power and [Double Strike] for the turn."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"foil","value":1.7,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":1.5,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":1.7,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/477472/dragon-ball-super-ccg-tournament-promotion-cards-jiren-the-immovable-championship-2022-zenkai-selection-pack"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/477472/dragon-ball-super-ccg-tournament-promotion-cards-jiren-the-immovable-championship-2022-zenkai-selection-pack"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search