liday Pack)","number":"BT19-100","subtitle":"Promo","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/454498_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/454498_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Tournament Promotion Cards"],["number","BT19-100"],["rarity","Promo"],["type","Leader"],["color","Yellow"],["Special Trait","Namekian/Slug's Army"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","Lord Slug Saga"],["Character","Lord Slug"],["BANDAI Disclaimer","This promotional card is marked “Not For Sale” by BANDAI, as the manufacturer prefers that Stores do not sell these cards."]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"Lord Slug\r\n\n\r\n[Permanent] You start the game with 6 life.\r\n\n\r\n[Permanent] When a \"Slug's Army\" card with a combo cost of 1 would leave your Battle Area, you may place it in your Z-Energy instead. If you do, place 1 of your Z-Energy in its owner's Drop.\r\n\n\r\n[Auto] Discard 1 \"Slug's Army\" card from your hand : When this card attacks, draw 2 cards.\r\n\n\r\n[Awaken] When your life is at 2 or less, or your opponent has 2 or more energy and 2 or more \"Slug's Army\" cards are in your Z-Energy : You may draw 2 cards, switch up to 1 of your energy to Active Mode, and add the top card of your deck to your life.\r\n\n\n\r\nLord Slug, in His Prime\r\n\n\r\n[Permanent] When a \"Slug's Army\" card with a combo cost of 1 would leave your Battle Area, you may place it in your Z-Energy instead. If you do, place 1 of your Z-Energy in its owner's Drop.\r\n\n\r\n[Auto] Discard 1 \"Slug's Army\" card from your hand : When this card attacks, draw 2 cards.\r\n\n\r\n[Activate:Battle] [Once per turn] (Y) : Use up to 1 mono-yellow \"Slug's Army\" card with a combo cost of 1 from your Drop in a combo with its skills negated for the turn."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"low","variant":"normal","value":0.1,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":null,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/454498/dragon-ball-super-ccg-tournament-promotion-cards-lord-slug-lord-slug-in-his-prime-fighters-ambition-holiday-pack"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/454498/dragon-ball-super-ccg-tournament-promotion-cards-lord-slug-lord-slug-in-his-prime-fighters-ambition-holiday-pack"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Lord%20Slug%20%2F%2F%20Lord%20Slug%2C%20in%20His%20Prime%20(Fighter's%20Ambition%20Holiday%20Pack)"}]},{"id":"454499","name":"Piccolo // Piccolo, Yet Unseen Power (Fighter's Ambition Holiday Pack)","number":"BT19-101","subtitle":"Promo","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/454499_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/454499_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Tournament Promotion Cards"],["number","BT19-101"],["rarity","Promo"],["type","Leader"],["color","Yellow"],["Special Trait","Namekian/God/Master's Teachings"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","DBS : SUPER HERO Saga"],["Character","Piccolo : SH"],["BANDAI Disclaimer","This promotional card is marked “Not For Sale” by BANDAI, as the manufacturer prefers that Stores do not sell these cards."]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"Piccolo\r\n[Auto] When this card attacks, draw 1 card.\r\n\n\r\n[Activate:Main] Place up to 1 yellow \"Pan : SH\" card with an energy cost of 2 or less from your deck under this card, shuffle your deck, and negate this skill for the game.\r\n\n\r\n[Awaken] When your life is at 4 or less, or you have a \"Shenron : SH\" Z-Battle Card in play : You may draw 1 card, switch up to 1 of your energy to Active Mode, and add cards from your life to your hand until you have 6 life left.\r\n\n\n\r\nPiccolo, Yet Unseen Power\r\n\n\r\n[Blocker]\r\n\n\r\n[Auto] When this card attacks, draw 1 card.\r\n\n\r\n[Auto] When this card activates [Blocker], it gets +10000 power for the battle.\r\n\n\r\n[Auto] At the end of your turn, switch this card to Active Mode."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"