-as-one-2023-worlds-zenkai-03-leader-set"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/488121/dragon-ball-super-ccg-tournament-promotion-cards-android-17-warriors-of-universe-7-united-as-one-2023-worlds-zenkai-03-leader-set"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Android%2017%20%2F%2F%20Warriors%20of%20Universe%207%2C%20United%20as%20One%20(2023%20Worlds%20ZENKAI%2003%20Leader%20Set)"}]},{"id":"533367","name":"Android 17 // Warriors of Universe 7, United as One (2023 Championship Finals Top 16) (Silver Metal Foil)","number":"BT20-001","subtitle":"Promo","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/533367_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/533367_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Tournament Promotion Cards"],["number","BT20-001"],["rarity","Promo"],["type","Leader"],["color","Red"],["Special Trait","Android/Universe 7"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","Universe Survival Saga"],["Character","Android 17/Warriors of Universe 7"],["BANDAI Disclaimer","This promotional card is marked “Not For Sale” by BANDAI, as the manufacturer prefers that Stores do not sell these cards."]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"Android 17\r\n\n[Warrior of Universe 7]\r\n\n[Auto] When this card attacks, draw 1 card.\r\n\n[Auto] When you add a Red/Blue multicolor card to your energy, switch up to 1 of your energy to Active Mode and negate this skill for the game.\r\n\n[Awaken] When your life is at 4 or less or you have a \"Universe 7\" Z-Battle Card with an energy cost of 2 or more in play : Draw 1 card, switch up to 1 of your energy to Active Mode, and add cards from your life to your hand until you have 6 life left.\r\n\n\n\r\nWarriors of Universe 7, United as One\r\n\n[Warrior of Universe 7]\r\n\n[Auto] [Once per turn] When you play, attack with, or activate the [Blocker] of a \"Universe 7\" Z-Battle Card, draw 1 card.\r\n\n[Auto] [Once per turn] Discard 1 \"Deadly Clash\" from your hand : When you use [Arrival] to play a Red/Blue multicolor Battle Card, choose up to 1 of your \"Universe 7\" cards with [Arrival] and it gains [Barrier] for the turn."}],"prices":[],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/533367/dragon-ball-super-ccg-tournament-promotion-cards-android-17-warriors-of-universe-7-united-as-one-2023-championship-finals-top-16-silver-metal-foil"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Android%2017%20%2F%2F%20Warriors%20of%20Universe%207%2C%20United%20as%20One%20(2023%20Championship%20Finals%20Top%2016)%20(Silver%20Metal%20Foil)"}]},{"id":"533368","name":"Android 17 // Warriors of Universe 7, United as One (2023 Championship Finals Top 16)","number":"BT20-001","subtitle":"Promo","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/533368_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/533368_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Tournament Promotion Cards"],["number","BT20-001"],["rarity","Promo"],["type","Leader"],["color","Red"],["Special Trait","Android/Universe 7"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","Universe Survival Saga"],["Character","Android 17/Warriors of Universe 7"],["BANDAI Disclaimer","This promotional card is marked “Not For Sale” by BANDAI, as the manufacturer prefers that Stores do not sell these cards."]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"Android 17\r\n\n[Warrior of Universe 7]\r\n\n[Auto] When this card attacks, draw 1 card.\r\n\n[Auto] When you add a Red/Blue multicolor card to your energy, switch up to 1 of your energy to Active Mode and negate this skill for the game.\r\n\n[Awaken] When your life is at 4 or less or you have a \"Universe 7\" Z-Battle Card with an energy cost of 2 or more in play : Draw 1 card, switch up to 1 of your energy to Active Mode, and add cards from your life to your hand until you have 6 life left.\r\n\n\n\r\nWarriors of Universe 7, United as One\r\n\n[Warrior of Universe 7]\r\n\n[Auto] [Once per turn] When you play, attack with, or activate the [Blocker] of a \"Universe 7\" Z-Battle Card, draw 1 card.\r\n\n[Auto] [Once per turn] Discard 1 \"Deadly Clash\" from your hand : When you use [Arrival] to play a Red/Blue multicolor Battle Card, choose up to 1 of your \"Universe 7\" cards with [Arrival] and it gains [Barrier] for the turn."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":2999,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":null,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/533368/dragon-ball-super-ccg-tournament-promotion-cards-android-17-warriors-of-universe-7-united-as-one-2023-championship-finals-top-16"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/533368/dragon-ball-super-ccg-tournament-promotion-cards-android-17-warriors-of-universe-7-united-as-one-2023-championship-finals-top-16"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Android%2017%20%2F%2F%20Warriors%20of%20Universe%207%2C%20United%20as%20One%20(2023%20Championship%20Finals%20Top%2016)"}]},{"id":"488122","name":"Paparoni // Warriors of Universe 3, United as One (2023 Worlds ZENKAI 03 Leader Set)","number":"BT20-002","subtitle":"Uncommon","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/488122_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/488122_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Tournament Promotion Cards"],["number","BT20-002"],["rarity","Uncommon"],["type","Leader"],["color","Red"],["Special Trait","Universe 3"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","Universe Survival Saga"],["Character","Paparoni/Warriors of Universe 3"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"Paparoni\r\n\n[Auto] When this card attacks, draw 1 card.\r\n\n[Awaken] When your life is at 4 or less or 1 or more \"Koitsukai\", \"Panchia\", and \"Bollarator\" cards—all red—are in your energy, Z-Energy, Battle Area, and/or Drop : Draw 1 card, switch up to 1 of your energy to Active Mode, and add cards from your life to your hand until you have 6 life left.\r\n\n\n\r\nWarriors of Universe 3, United as One\r\n\n[Auto] When this card attacks, look at up to 5 cards from the top of your deck, add up to 1 red \"Universe 3\" card among them to your hand, and shuffle your deck. \r\n\n[Activate:Main] R, if your life is at 3 or less, you have 4 or more energy, and you send 1 \"Koitsukai\" card, 1 \"Panchia\" card, and 1 \"Bollarator\" card—all red—from your Drop to your Warp : Play up to 1 red \"Koichiarator\" card with an energy cost of 4 from your deck or Drop, shuffle your deck if you looked through it, and negate this skill for the game."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":93.6,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":null,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/488122/dragon-ball-super-ccg-tournament-promotion-cards-paparoni-warriors-of-universe-3-united-as-one-2023-worlds-zenkai-03-leader-set"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/488122/dragon-ball-super-ccg-tournament-promotion-cards-paparoni-warriors-of-universe-3-united-as-one-2023-worlds-zenkai-03-leader-set"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Paparoni%20%2F%2F%20Warriors%20of%20Universe%203%2C%20United%20as%20One%20(2023%20Worlds%20ZENKAI%2003%20Leader%20Set)"}]},{"id":"488123","name":"Android 18 // Android 18, Impenetrable Rushdown (2023 Worlds ZENKAI 03 Leader Set)","number":"BT20-023","subtitle":"Uncommon","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/488123_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/488123_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Tournament Promotion Cards"],["number","BT20-023"],["rarity","Uncommon"],["type","Leader"],["color","Blue"],["Special Trait","Android"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","Special"],["Character","Android 18"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"Android 18\r\n\n[Auto] When this card attacks, draw 1 card, and place up to 1 blue card from your Drop under this card.\r\n\n[Awaken] When your life is at 4 or less or there are 3 or more cards under this card : Draw 1 card, switch up to 1 of your energy to Active Mode, and add cards from your life to your hand until you have 6 life left.\r\n\n\n\r\nAndroid 18, Impenetrable Rushdown\r\n\n[Auto] When this card attacks, draw 1 card, and place up to 1 blue card from your Drop under this card.\r\n\n[Auto] [Once per turn] When you add a card from your life to your hand, place up to 1 blue card from your Drop under this card.\r\n\n[Activate:Battle] [Once per turn] Add 1 card from your life to your hand : This card gets +5000 power for the battle."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"foil","value":99.99,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":82.99,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":99.99,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/488123/dragon-ball-super-ccg-tournament-promotion-cards-android-18-android-18-impenetrable-rushdown-2023-worlds-zenkai-03-leader-set"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/488123/dragon-ball-super-ccg-tournament-promotion-cards-android-18-android-18-impenetrable-rushdown-2023-worlds-zenkai-03-leader-set"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Android%2018%20%2F%2F%20Android%2018%2C%20Impenetrable%20Rushdown%20(2023%20Worlds%20ZENKAI%2003%20Leader%20Set)"}]},{"id":"488124","name":"Android 21 // Android 21, the Nature of Evil (2023 Worlds ZENKAI 03 Leader Set)","number":"BT20-024","subtitle":"Uncommon","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/488124_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/488124_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Tournament Promotion Cards"],["number","BT20-024"],["rarity","Uncommon"],["type","Leader"],["color","Blue"],["Special Trait","Android/Scientist"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","Special"],["Character","Android 21"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"Android 21\r\n\n[Permanent] You can't activate Extras, and during your turn, you can't play battle cards by skills.\r\n\n[Auto] If you have an \"Android 21\" Z-Battle Card in play : At the end of your turn, switch up to 1 of your blue energy to Active Mode.\r\n\n[Activate:Main] [Once per turn] Add 1 card from your life to your hand : Look at up to 5 cards from the top of your deck, add up to 1 blue \"Android\" card among them to your hand, shuffle your deck, and this card gets +5000 power for the turn.\r\n\n[Awaken] When your life is at 4 or less : Draw 1 card, and switch up to 1 of your energy to Active Mode.\r\n\n\n\r\nAndroid 21, the Nature of Evil\r\n\n[Permanent] During your turn, you can't play battle cards by skills.\r\n\n[Permanent] When paying energy costs for your \"Android 21\" cards, you can use your \"Android 21\" Z-Battle Cards and your opponent's Battle Cards and\r\nUnisons as energy.\r\n\n[Activate:Main] [Once per turn] Draw 1 card, and choose up to 3 of your opponent's Battle Cards and/or Unisons, ignoring [Barrier], and switch them to Active Mode."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"foil","value":199.99,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":199,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":199.99,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/488124/dragon-ball-super-ccg-tournament-promotion-cards-android-21-android-21-the-nature-of-evil-2023-worlds-zenkai-03-leader-set"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/488124/dragon-ball-super-ccg-tournament-promotion-cards-android-21-android-21-the-nature-of-evil-2023-worlds-zenkai-03-leader-set"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Android%2021%20%2F%2F%20Android%2021%2C%20the%20Nature%20of%20Evil%20(2023%20Worlds%20ZENKAI%2003%20Leader%20Set)"}]},{"id":"488125","name":"Son Goku // SS4 Son Goku, Betting It All (2023 Worlds ZENKAI 03 Leader Set)","number":"BT20-054","subtitle":"Uncommon","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/488125_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/488125_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Tournament Promotion Cards"],["number","BT20-054"],["rarity","Uncommon"],["type","Leader"],["color","Green"],["Special Trait","Saiyan"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","Super 17 Saga"],["Character","Son Goku : GT"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"Son Goku\r\n\n\r\n[Auto] When this card is placed in your Leader Area, send up to 1 [Android 20, Vengeful Alliance] and 1 [Dr. Myuu, Vengeful Alliance] from your deck to your Warp.\r\n\n\r\n[Auto] When this card attacks, look at up to 5 cards from the top of your deck, add up to 1 green \"Saiyan\" card among them to your hand, and shuffle your deck.\r\n\n\r\n[Awaken] When your life is at 4 or less, or when you have 2 or more energy while there are 2 or more \"Son Goku : GT\" cards in your Warp : Draw 1 card, switch up to 1 of your energy to Active Mode, and add cards from your life to your hand until you have 6 life left.\r\n\n\n\r\nSS4 Son Goku, Betting It All\r\n\n\r\n[Auto] [Once per turn] When a \"Pan\" card or a card with \"GT\" in its character name—both green and without \"Son Goku : GT\"—is placed from your Battle Area in your Drop, add it to your Z-Energy from your Drop.\r\n\n\r\n[Auto] When this card attacks, draw 1 card.\r\n\n\r\n[Auto] At the end of your turn, choose up to 1 of your green \"Android 18\" Z-Battle Cards and switch it to Active Mode."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"foil","value":95.68,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":95.68,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":95.68,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/488125/dragon-ball-super-ccg-tournament-promotion-cards-son-goku-ss4-son-goku-betting-it-all-2023-worlds-zenkai-03-leader-set"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/488125/dragon-ball-super-ccg-tournament-promotion-cards-son-goku-ss4-son-goku-betting-it-all-2023-worlds-zenkai-03-leader-set"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Son%20Goku%20%2F%2F%20SS4%20Son%20Goku%2C%20Betting%20It%20All%20(2023%20Worlds%20ZENKAI%2003%20Leader%20Set)"}]},{"id":"488132","name":"Android 20 & Dr. Myuu // Hell Fighter 17, Plans in Motion (2023 Worlds ZENKAI 03 Leader Set)","number":"BT20-055","subtitle":"Uncommon","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/488132_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/488132_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Tournament Promotion Cards"],["number","BT20-055"],["rarity","Uncommon"],["type","Leader"],["color","Green"],["Special Trait","Android/Machine Mutant"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","Super 17 Saga"],["Character","Android 20/Dr. Myuu/ Hell Fighter 17"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"Android 20 & Dr. Myuu\r\n\n[Auto] When this card attacks, look at up to 5 cards from the top of your deck, add up to 1 \"Android\" or \"Machine Mutant\" card—both green and with an energy cost of 6 or less—among them to your hand, and shuffle your deck.\r\n\n[Awaken] When your life is at 4 or less, or when you have 2 or more energy while 1 or more \"Android 17\" and \"Hell Fighter 17\" cards are in your Z-Energy and Battle Area : Draw 2 cards and add cards from your life to your hand until you have 6 life left.\r\n\n\n\r\nHell Fighter 17, Plans in Motion\r\n\n[Auto] When this card attacks, draw 1 card.\r\n\n[Activate:Main] [Once per turn] Add up to 1 card from your life to your hand, and choose up to 1 of your opponent's Unisons and remove a marker from it. \r\n\n[Activate:Main] [Once per turn] Place 1 card from under one of your \"Super 17\" cards under this card : For the turn, reduce the skill cost of [Z-Awaken] on \"Super 17, Ready to Absorb\" in your Z-Deck by G."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"foil","value":97.7,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":98.69,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":97.7,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/488132/dragon-ball-super-ccg-tournament-promotion-cards-android-20-and-dr-myuu-hell-fighter-17-plans-in-motion-2023-worlds-zenkai-03-leader-set"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/488132/dragon-ball-super-ccg-tournament-promotion-cards-android-20-and-dr-myuu-hell-fighter-17-plans-in-motion-2023-worlds-zenkai-03-leader-set"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Android%2020%20%26%20Dr.%20Myuu%20%2F%2F%20Hell%20Fighter%2017%2C%20Plans%20in%20Motion%20(2023%20Worlds%20ZENKAI%2003%20Leader%20Set)"}]},{"id":"488130","name":"SS Vegito // Son Goku & Vegeta, Path to Victory (2023 Worlds ZENKAI 03 Leader Set)","number":"BT20-084","subtitle":"Uncommon","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/488130_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/488130_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Tournament Promotion Cards"],["number","BT20-084"],["rarity","Uncommon"],["type","Leader"],["color","Yellow"],["Special Trait","Saiyan"],["power","20000/15000"],["Era","Majin Buu Saga"],["Character","Vegito/Son Goku/Vegeta"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"SS Vegito\r\n\n[Auto] When this card attacks, draw 1 card.\r\n\n[Auto] If you have 2 or more energy : At the start of any Main Phase, draw 2 cards, add card's from your life to your hand until you have 6 life left, and flip this card to its back.\r\n\n\n\r\nSon Goku & Vegeta, Path to Victory\r\n\n[Auto] When this card attacks, draw 1 card.\r\n\n[Auto] [Once per turn] When a card is placed under a \"Spirit Bomb\" in your Battle Area, choose up to 1 of your opponent's Battle Cards and switch it to Rest Mode.\r\n\n[Activate:Main] Activate up to 1 \"Spirit Bomb\" from your deck, shuffle your deck, and negate this skill for the game."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":239.98,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":null,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/488130/dragon-ball-super-ccg-tournament-promotion-cards-ss-vegito-son-goku-and-vegeta-path-to-victory-2023-worlds-zenkai-03-leader-set"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/488130/dragon-ball-super-ccg-tournament-promotion-cards-ss-vegito-son-goku-and-vegeta-path-to-victory-2023-worlds-zenkai-03-leader-set"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=SS%20Vegito%20%2F%2F%20Son%20Goku%20%26%20Vegeta%2C%20Path%20to%20Victory%20(2023%20Worlds%20ZENKAI%2003%20Leader%20Set)"}]},{"id":"488128","name":"Majin Buu // Majin Buu, Absorption Complete (2023 Worlds ZENKAI 03 Leader Set)","number":"BT20-085","subtitle":"Uncommon","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/488128_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/488128_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Tournament Promotion Cards"],["number","BT20-085"],["rarity","Uncommon"],["type","Leader"],["color","Yellow"],["Special Trait","Majin"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","Majin Buu Saga"],["Character","Majin Buu"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"Majin Buu\r\n\n[Auto] When this card attacks, draw 1 card.\r\n\n[Activate:Main] [Once per turn] Look at up to 5 cards from the top of your deck, add up to 1 yellow \"Majin\" card with an energy cost of 6 or less among them to your hand, shuffle your deck, and if you added a card to your hand, discard 1 card from your hand.\r\n\n[Awaken] When your life is at 4 or less or you have a yellow \"Majin\" Z-Battle Card with an energy cost of 2 or more in play : Draw 1 card, switch up to 1 of your energy to Active Mode, and add cards from your life to your hand until you have 6 life left