mium-pack"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Whis%2C%20Time%20Regression%20(2023%20Championship%20Finals%20Zenkai%20Premium%20Pack)"}]},{"id":"606345","name":"SSG Trunks, Guiding Light (Championship 2024 Finals Zenkai Pack)","number":"BT21-133","subtitle":"Promo","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/606345_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/606345_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Tournament Promotion Cards"],["number","BT21-133"],["rarity","Promo"],["type","Z-Leader"],["color","Black"],["Z-Energy Cost","2"],["Special Trait","Saiyan/Earthling"],["power","20000"],["Era","Dark Empire Saga"],["Character","Trunks: Xeno"],["BANDAI Disclaimer","This promotional card is marked “Not For Sale” by BANDAI, as the manufacturer prefers that Stores do not sell these cards."]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Z-Awaken] [Spirit Boost 1] Your life is at 3 or less : Black \"Trunks: Xeno\".\r\n\n[Auto] When this card attacks, draw 2 cards and send 1 card from your hand to your Warp.\r\n\n[Activate:Main] [Once per turn] [Spirit Boost 1] If you place 2 black Battle Cards from your Warp into your Drop : Choose up to 1 of your opponent's Battle Cards and send it to its owner's Warp. Additionally, if you have a \"Supreme Kai of Time, Opposing the Empire\" in play, this card gets +5000 power and [Double Strike] for the turn."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":120,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":null,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/606345/dragon-ball-super-ccg-tournament-promotion-cards-ssg-trunks-guiding-light-championship-2024-finals-zenkai-pack"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/606345/dragon-ball-super-ccg-tournament-promotion-cards-ssg-trunks-guiding-light-championship-2024-finals-zenkai-pack"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=SSG%20Trunks%2C%20Guiding%20Light%20(Championship%202024%20Finals%20Zenkai%20Pack)"}]},{"id":"533373","name":"Son Goku // Son Goku & Vegeta, Tag Team in Hell (2023 Championship Finals)","number":"BT22-031","subtitle":"Promo","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/533373_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/533373_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Tournament Promotion Cards"],["number","BT22-031"],["rarity","Promo"],["type","Leader"],["color","Blue"],["Special Trait","Saiyan"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","Janemba Saga"],["Character","Son Goku // Son Goku/Vegeta"],["BANDAI Disclaimer","This promotional card is marked “Not For Sale” by BANDAI, as the manufacturer prefers that Stores do not sell these cards."]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"Son Goku\r\n\n\r\n[Permanent] Negate the [Energy-Exhaust] skill of your Blue/Yellow multicolor \"Saiyan\" cards in all areas. \n\r\n[Activate Main] [Once per turn] Add up to 1 card from your life to your hand, look at up to 5 cards from the top of your deck, add up to 1 blue or yellow \"Saiyan\" card to your hand, then shuffle your deck. \n\r\n[Awaken] When your life is at 5 or less: Draw 2 cards, and you can't place cards in your Energy Area by your skills for the game.\r\n\n\nSon Goku & Vegeta, Tag Team in Hell\r\n\n[Permanent ]Negate the [Energy-Exhaust] skill of your Blue/Yellow multicolor \"Saiyan\" cards in all areas. \n\r\n[Auto] When this card attacks, draw 1 card, then add up to 1 card from your life to your hand. \n\r\n[Activate:Main] [Once per turn] U :Draw 1 card, then choose up to 1 of your opponent's Battle Cards with an energy cost of 4 or less and add it to its owner's hand."}],"prices":[],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/533373/dragon-ball-super-ccg-tournament-promotion-cards-son-goku-son-goku-and-vegeta-tag-team-in-hell-2023-championship-finals"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/