)","number":"BT22-117","subtitle":"Promo","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/606347_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/606347_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Tournament Promotion Cards"],["number","BT22-117"],["rarity","Promo"],["type","Z-Battle"],["color","Black"],["Energy(Color Cost)","1(-)"],["Z-Energy Cost","1"],["Special Trait","Scientist"],["power","5000"],["Era","Prison Planet Saga"],["Character","Fu"],["BANDAI Disclaimer","This promotional card is marked “Not For Sale” by BANDAI, as the manufacturer prefers that Stores do not sell these cards."]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Deflect] \n\r\n[Z-Stack 1] Black \"Cumber\" Battle Card. \n\r\n[Permanent] During your turn, once per turn, this card can't be removed from your Battle Area by your opponent's skills. \n\r\n[Activate:Main][Limit 1] If your Leader is a black \"Fu\" card : Look at up to 5 cards from the top of your deck, place up to 1 back \"Fu\" or \"Cumber\" card in your Z-Deck face up, then shuffle your deck."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"foil","value":5,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":3.75,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":5,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/606347/dragon-ball-super-ccg-tournament-promotion-cards-fu-fighting-enthusiast-treatment-championship-2024-finals-zenkai-pack"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/606347/dragon-ball-super-ccg-tournament-promotion-cards-fu-fighting-enthusiast-treatment-championship-2024-finals-zenkai-pack"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Fu%2C%20Fighting%20Enthusiast%20Treatment%20(Championship%202024%20Finals%20Zenkai%20Pack)"}]},{"id":"606357","name":"Fu, Fighting Enthusiast Treatment (Championship 2024 Finals Zenkai Pack) (Gold Stamped)","number":"BT22-117","subtitle":"Promo","image":"https://tcgplayer-