anufacturer prefers that Stores do not sell these cards."]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"Son Gohan & Trunks\r\n\n[Auto] When this card attacks, look at up to 5 cards from the top of your deck, add up to 1 red \"Saiyan\" or \"Earthling\" card to your hand, then shuffle your deck.\r\n\n[Awaken] When your life is at 4 or less, or you have 2 or more energy and a \"Destroyed West City\" in your Battle Area : Draw 1 card, switch up to 1 of your energy to Active Mode, and add cards from your life to your hand until you have 6 life left.\r\n\nSS Son Gohan & Trunks, Warriors Meeting a Challenge\r\n\n[Activate:Main/Battle] Place 1 of your Z-Energy in your Drop : During this turn, the next time you use an Activate skill on a red \"Son Gohan : Future\" or \"Trunks : Future\" card in your Battle Area and/or Combo Area, reduce its skill cost by 1.\r\n\n[Activate:Main] [Once per turn] Place 1 red \"Saiyan\" card from your hand under a \"Destroyed West City\" in your Battle Area : Draw 2 cards."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"foil","value":2.48,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":1.94,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":2.48,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/530343/dragon-ball-super-ccg-tournament-promotion-cards-son-gohan-and-trunks-ss-son-gohan-and-trunks-warriors-meeting-a-challenge-zenkai-special-release-pack"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/530343/dragon-ball-super-ccg-tournament-promotion-cards-son-gohan-and-trunks-ss-son-gohan-and-trunks-warriors-meeting-a-challenge-zenkai-special-release-pack"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Son%20Gohan%20%26%20Trunks%20%2F%2F%20SS%20Son%20Gohan%20%26%20Trunks%2C%20Warriors%20Meeting%20a%20Challenge%20(Zenkai%20Special%20Release%20Pack)"}]},{"id":"536091","name":"Son Gohan & Trunks // SS Son Gohan & Trunks, Warriors Meeting a Challenge