ndroid\" cards and it gets +5000 power for the battle."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"foil","value":0.76,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":0.84,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":0.76,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/530342/dragon-ball-super-ccg-tournament-promotion-cards-android-17-and-android-18-android-17-and-android-18-future-evil-zenkai-special-release-pack"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/530342/dragon-ball-super-ccg-tournament-promotion-cards-android-17-and-android-18-android-17-and-android-18-future-evil-zenkai-special-release-pack"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Android%2017%20%26%20Android%2018%20%2F%2F%20Android%2017%20%26%20Android%2018%2C%20Future%20Evil%20(Zenkai%20Special%20Release%20Pack)"}]},{"id":"536089","name":"Android 17 & Android 18 // Android 17 & Android 18, Future Evil (2023 Worlds ZENKAI 06 Leader Set)","number":"BT23-002","subtitle":"Promo","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/536089_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/536089_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Tournament Promotion Cards"],["number","BT23-002"],["rarity","Promo"],["type","Leader"],["color","Red"],["Special Trait","Android"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","Android Cell Saga"],["Character","Android 17/Android 18"],["BANDAI Disclaimer","This promotional card is marked “Not For Sale” by BANDAI, as the manufacturer prefers that Stores do not sell these cards."]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"Android 17 & Android 18\r\n\n[Auto] When this card attacks, look at up to 5 cards from the top of your deck, add up to 1 red \"Android\" card to your hand, then shuffle your deck.\r\n\n[Activate:Main] Add up to 1 red \"Android 20\" card with an energy cost of 1 from your deck to your hand, shuffle your deck, and negate this skill for the game.\r\n\n[Awaken] When your life is at 4 or less, or you have 2 or more energy and a \"Destroyed West City\" in your Battle Area : Draw 2 cards and add cards from your life to your hand until you have 6 life left.\r\n\nAndroid 17 & Android 18, Future Evil\r\n\n[Auto] [Once per turn] When your \"Android 17\" or \"Android 18\" card attacks, draw 1 card. \r\n\n[Activate:Main] [Once per turn] Choose 1 of your \"Android 20\" cards and KO it : Play up to 1 red \"Android 17\" or \"Android 18\" card—both with no keyword skills and with an energy cost less than or equal to your energy—from your hand, and that card gains [Barrier] for the turn. Choose up to 1 of your opponent's Battle Cards or Unisons and it gets-15000 power for the turn.\r\n\n[Activate:Battle] [Once per turn] If it's your turn : Choose up to 1 of your red \"Android\" cards and it gets +5000 power for the battle."}],"prices":[],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/536089/dragon-ball-super-ccg-tournament-promotion-cards-android-17-and-android-18-android-17-and-android-18-future-evil-2023-worlds-zenkai-06-leader-set"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Android%2017%20%26%20Android%2018%20%2F%2F%20Android%2017%20%26%20Android%2018%2C%20Future%20Evil%20(2023%20Worlds%20ZENKAI%2006%20Leader%20Set)"}]},{"id":"585125","name":"SS3 Gohanks, Time-Traveling Master-Student Fusion (2023 Worlds ZENKAI 06 Card Set)","number":"BT23-003","subtitle":"Promo","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/585125_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/585125_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Tournament Promotion Cards"],["number","BT23-003"],["rarity","Promo"],["type","Z-Leader"],["color","Red"],["Z-Energy Cost","3"],["Special Trait","Saiyan/Earthling"],["power","20000"],["Era","Dark Empire Saga"],["Character","Gohanks: Xeno"],["BANDAI Disclaimer","This promotional card is marked “Not For Sale