":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Auto] When this card attacks, choose up to 1 of your opponent's Battle Cards, ignoring [Barrier], negate [Indestructible], and KO it.\r\n\n[Activate:Main] [Limit 1] GG, if your Leader is green and you have 3 or more energy : Play this card from your hand, and during that turn, the next time you place a Z-Extra in your Battle Area, reduce its energy cost by G.\r\n\n[Activate:Battle] [Once per turn] If you have 4 or more energy and you switch 3 of your Earthling Tokens to Rest Mode : This card gets +5000 power and [Triple Strike] for the turn."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"foil","value":10.03,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":9,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":10.03,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/691146/dragon-ball-super-ccg-tournament-promotion-cards-ss2-trunks-path-to-the-future-premium-alt-art-set-2026-vol1"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/691146/dragon-ball-super-ccg-tournament-promotion-cards-ss2-trunks-path-to-the-future-premium-alt-art-set-2026-vol1"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=SS2%20Trunks%2C%20Path%20to%20the%20Future%20(Premium%20Alt-Art%20Set%202026%20Vol.1)"}]},{"id":"530331","name":"SSB Son Goku // Son Goku, Autonomous Awakening (Zenkai Special Release Pack)","number":"BT23-099","subtitle":"Uncommon","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/530331_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/530331_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Tournament Promotion Cards"],["number","BT23-099"],["rarity","Uncommon"],["type","Leader"],["color","Yellow"],["Special Trait","Saiyan/Universe 7"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","Universe Survival Saga"],["Character","Son Goku"],["BANDAI Disclaimer","This promotional card is marked “Not For Sale” by BANDAI, as the manufacturer prefers that Stores do no