ergy(Color Cost)","1(-)"],["Z-Energy Cost","1"],["Special Trait","Majin"],["power","5000"],["Era","Majin Buu Saga"],["Character","Majin Buu"],["BANDAI Disclaimer","This promotional card is marked “Not For Sale” by BANDAI, as the manufacturer prefers that Stores do not sell these cards."]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Blocker]\r\n\n[Activate:Main] If your Leader's back side is a \"Majin Buu, Leader of the Agents of Destruction\", its front side is facing up, you have 6 or less life, and you have 2 or more energy : Flip 1 of your Leaders to its back side, draw 2 cards, and remove this card from the game.\r\n\n[Activate:Main] [Limit 1] If your leader is black, you have 3 or more energy, and you place 1 of your Z-Energy in your Drop : Choose up to 1 of your opponent's Battle Cards and place it under this card, and this card gets +20000 power until the end of your opponent's turn."}],"prices":[{"source":"Cardmarket","items":[{"label":"trend","variant":"foil","value":1.68,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg","variant":"foil","value":2.01,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":0.39,"currency":"EUR"}],"ref":{"value":1.46,"currency":"EUR"},"url":null},{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":4.99,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":null,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/705514/dragon-ball-super-ccg-tournament-promotion-cards-majin-buu-pure-destroyer-event-pack-19"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/705514/dragon-ball-super-ccg-tournament-promotion-cards-majin-buu-pure-destroyer-event-pack-19"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Majin%20Buu%2C%20Pure%20Destroyer%20(Event%20Pack%2019)"}]},{"id":"487845","name":"Babidi // Babidi, Insidious Reckoning (Silver Foil)","number":"P-476","subtitle":"Promo","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/487845_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/487845_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Tournament Promotion Cards"],["number","P-476"],["rarity","Promo"],["type","Leader"],["color","Yellow"],["Special Trait","Evil Wizard"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","The Evil Wizard Babidi Saga"],["Character","Evil Wizard Babidi"],["BANDAI Disclaimer","This promotional card is marked “Not For Sale” by BANDAI, as the manufacturer prefers that Stores do not sell these cards."]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"Babidi\r\n\n[Auto] When this card attacks, draw 1 card, and add up to 1 card from your life to your hand.\r\n\n[Awaken] When your life is at 5 or less : You may draw 1 card, and switch up to 1 of your energy to Active Mode.\r\n\n\nBabidi, Insidious Reckoning\r\n\n[Overlord] [Once per turn]\r\n\n[Permanent] Treat \"Agent of Destruction\" cards in your Z-Deck as if they have no specified cost, and reduce the energy cost and Z-Energy Cost of \"Agent of Destruction\" cards in your Z-Deck by 1.\r\n\n[Auto] Discard 1 card from your hand : When this card attacks, draw 1 card.\r\n\n[Activate:Main] [Once per turn] Choose up to 2 of your \"Majin\" and/or \"Agent of Destruction\" cards, and they gain [Servant] for the turn."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"foil","value":0.34,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":0.04,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":0.34,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/487845/dragon-ball-super-ccg-tournament-promotion-cards-babidi-babidi-insidious-reckoning-silver-foil"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/487845/dragon-ball-super-ccg-tournament-promotion-cards-babidi-babidi-insidious-reckoning-silver-foil"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Babidi%20%2F%2F%20Babidi%2C%20Insidious%20Reckoning%20(Silver%20Foil)"}]},{"id":"487850","name":"Babidi // Babidi, Insidious Reckoning (Gold-Stamped)","number":"P-476","subtitle":