nd until you have 6 life left.\n\n//\n\nMonaka, the Strongest Fighter\n\n[Permanent] If your blue \"Monaka\" card would be removed from a Battle Area by your opponent's skill, return it to its owner's hand instead.\n\n[Auto] [Once per turn] When your blue \"God\" card is played, draw 1 card.\n\n[Auto] [Once per turn] When your Battle Card is returned to your hand by one of your skills, choose up to 1 of your blue cards with \"Beerus\" in its character name and it gets +5000 power for the turn."}],"prices":[{"source":"Cardmarket","items":[{"label":"trend","value":0.13,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg","value":0.2,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"low","value":0.02,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg7","value":0.15,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg30","value":0.17,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"trend","variant":"foil","value":0.02,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg","variant":"foil","value":0.17,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":0.02,"currency":"EUR"}],"ref":{"value":0.16,"currency":"EUR"},"url":null},{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"low","variant":"normal","value":0.5,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"market","variant":"foil","value":0.17,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":0.03,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":0.17,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/701491/dragon-ball-super-ccg-impact-beyond-dimensions-monaka-monaka-the-strongest-fighter"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/701491/dragon-ball-super-ccg-impact-beyond-dimensions-monaka-monaka-the-strongest-fighter"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Monaka%20%2F%2F%20Monaka%2C%20the%20Strongest%20Fighter"}]},{"id":"701492","name":"Monaka // Monaka, the Strongest Fighter (SLR)","number":"BT31-027","subtitle":"Special Leader Rare","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/701492_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/70