—from your Warp.\n\n[Activate:Battle] [Once per turn] [Burst 1] If this card is in a battle: Choose up to 1 \"Vegito\" or \"Vegito : Xeno\" card—both black and with an energy cost of 7—and switch your card that's in a battle with the chosen card."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"foil","value":0.52,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":0.19,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"market","variant":"normal","value":1.5,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"normal","value":0.5,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":1.5,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/701165/dragon-ball-super-ccg-impact-beyond-dimensions-vegito-ssb-vegito-ultimate-power"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/701165/dragon-ball-super-ccg-impact-beyond-dimensions-vegito-ssb-vegito-ultimate-power"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Vegito%20%2F%2F%20SSB%20Vegito%2C%20Ultimate%20Power"}]},{"id":"702495","name":"Vegito // SSB Vegito, Ultimate Power (SLR)","number":"BT31-085","subtitle":"Special Leader Rare","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/702495_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/702495_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Impact Beyond Dimensions"],["number","BT31-085"],["rarity","Special Leader Rare"],["type","Leader"],["color","Black"],["Special Trait","Saiyan"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","Special"],["Character","Vegito"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Activate:Main] [Once per turn] Discard 1 card from your hand: Look at up to 5 cards from the top of your deck, add up to 1 black \"Saiyan\" card to your hand, then shuffle your deck.\n\r\n[Awaken] [Burst 1] When you have 2 or more energy and you have a total of 2 or more black \"Vegito\" and/or \"Vegito : Xeno\" cards in your Warp: Draw 2 cards and add cards from your life to your hand until you have 6 life left.\n\r\n