agon-ball-super-ccg-impact-beyond-dimensions-release-event-son-goku-and-vegeta-ss-gogeta-situation-reversal-fusion"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/702721/dragon-ball-super-ccg-impact-beyond-dimensions-release-event-son-goku-and-vegeta-ss-gogeta-situation-reversal-fusion"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Son%20Goku%20%26%20Vegeta%20%2F%2F%20SS%20Gogeta%2C%20Situation%20Reversal%20Fusion"}]},{"id":"702722","name":"Janemba // Janemba, Blade of Hatred","number":"BT31-002","subtitle":"Uncommon","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/702722_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/702722_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Impact Beyond Dimensions Release Event"],["number","BT31-002"],["rarity","Uncommon"],["type","Leader"],["color","Red"],["Special Trait","Evil Incarnate"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","Janemba Saga"],["Character","Janemba"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Auto] When this card attacks, look at up to 5 cards from the top of your deck, add up to 1 red \"Evil Incarnate\" card to your hand, then shuffle your deck.\n\n\n[Awaken] When your life is at 4 or less, or you have 2 or more energy and you have a red Z-Extra in your Battle Area: Draw 1 card, switch up to 1 of your energy to Active Mode, and add cards from your life to your hand until you have 6 life left.\n\n\n//\n\n\nJanemba, Blade of Hatred\n\n\n[Permanent] Negate the keyword skills of all your Battle Cards.\n\n\n[Permanent] During the turn your \"Evil Incarnate\" card was played, if that card's skill would reduce the power of your opponent's cards or the combo power of your opponent's cards in their Combo Area, reduce it by double that amount instead.\n\n\n[Activate:Main] [Once per turn] Discard 1 \"Evil Incarnate\" card from your hand: Draw 2 cards."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"foil","value":5,"cur