rds or Unisons with a specified cost of 2 to your hand, then shuffle your deck.\n\n\n[Awaken] When your life is at 4 or less, or you have 2 or more energy and a green Unison with a specified cost of 2 in play: Draw 1 card, switch up to 1 of your energy to Active Mode, and add cards from your life to your hand until you have 6 life left.\n\n\n//\n\n\nSS4 Gogeta, Vainglorious\n\n\n[Auto] [Once per turn] When you activate a [Union] skill, draw 1 card.\n\n\n[Auto] When this card attacks, draw 1 card.\n\n\n[Activate:Main] [Once per turn] Choose 1 of your mono-green \"Gogeta : GT\" cards and place it into its owner's Drop: Play up to 1 \"Son Goku : GT\" and up to 1 \"Vegeteta : GT\"—both mono-green, with an energy cost of 5 and 20000 power—from your Drop."}],"prices":[{"source":"Cardmarket","items":[{"label":"trend","variant":"foil","value":0.28,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg","variant":"foil","value":0.16,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":0.02,"currency":"EUR"}],"ref":{"value":0.19,"currency":"EUR"},"url":null},{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":4.14,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":null,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/702740/dragon-ball-super-ccg-impact-beyond-dimensions-release-event-ss4-son-goku-and-ss4-vegeta-ss4-gogeta-vainglorious"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/702740/dragon-ball-super-ccg-impact-beyond-dimensions-release-event-ss4-son-goku-and-ss4-vegeta-ss4-gogeta-vainglorious"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=SS4%20Son%20Goku%20%26%20SS4%20Vegeta%20%2F%2F%20SS4%20Gogeta%2C%20Vainglorious"}]},{"id":"702741","name":"SS4 Son Goku, Vow of Victory","number":"BT31-044","subtitle":"Rare","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/702741_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/702741_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Impact Beyond Dimensions Release Event"],["n