bo power from your Drop in combos.\n\n\n[Activate:Battle] [Once per turn] If you have 3 or fewer cards in your Combo Area: Negate this card's skills for the battle."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"foil","value":3.77,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":2.34,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":3.77,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/702748/dragon-ball-super-ccg-impact-beyond-dimensions-release-event-launch-launch-transformed"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/702748/dragon-ball-super-ccg-impact-beyond-dimensions-release-event-launch-launch-transformed"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Launch%20%2F%2F%20Launch%2C%20Transformed"}]},{"id":"702749","name":"Commeson // (Duplicate) Vegeta, Weapon Tainted by Evil","number":"BT31-056","subtitle":"Uncommon","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/702749_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/702749_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Impact Beyond Dimensions Release Event"],["number","BT31-056"],["rarity","Uncommon"],["type","Leader"],["color","Yellow"],["Special Trait","Copy"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","Champa Saga"],["Character","Commeson/(Duplicate) Vegeta"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Permanent] This card can't attack.\n\n\n[Activate:Main] [Once Per Turn] Add 1 card from your life to your hand: Look at up to 5 cards from the top of your deck, add up to 1 yellow card to your life, then shuffle your deck.\n\n\n[Awaken] When you have 2 or more energy: Draw 1 card, then add cards from your life to your hand until you have 5 life left.\n\n\n//\n\n\n(Duplicate) Vegeta, Weapon Tainted by Evil\n\n\n[Activate:Main] [Once Per Turn] Add 1 card from your hand to your life: Draw 1 card and add 1 card from your life to your hand.\n\n\n[Activate:Battle] Flip 1 card from your life to its fron