","Android Cell Saga"],["Character","Hyperbolic Time Chamber"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Permanent] This card can't attack.\n\n\n[Auto] At the start of your Main Phase, look at up to 5 cards from the top of your deck, place up to 1 white card under this card, then shuffle your deck.\n\n\n[Auto] If there are 2 or more cards under this card: At the end of your turn, add up to 2 cards from under this card to your hand, and flip this card to its back side.\n\n\n//\n\n\nCompleted Training in the Hyperbolic Time Chamber\n\n\n[Permanent] This card can't attack.\n\n\n[Auto] At the start of your and your opponent's Main Phase, place 2 cards from the top of your deck under this card, and at the end of the turn, place all cards under this card at the bottom of their owner's deck.\n\n\n[Activate:Main/Battle] [Once Per Turn] Place 1 card from your hand under this card: Add up to 1 card from under this card to your hand.\n\n\n[Activate:Main] [Once Per Turn] Draw 1 card."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"foil","value":7.13,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":3.49,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":7.13,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/702780/dragon-ball-super-ccg-impact-beyond-dimensions-release-event-training-in-the-hyperbolic-time-chamber-completed-training-in-the-hyperbolic-time-chamber"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/702780/dragon-ball-super-ccg-impact-beyond-dimensions-release-event-training-in-the-hyperbolic-time-chamber-completed-training-in-the-hyperbolic-time-chamber"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Training%20in%20the%20Hyperbolic%20Time%20Chamber%20%2F%2F%20Completed%20Training%20in%20the%20Hyperbolic%20Time%20Chamber"}]},{"id":"702781","name":"Cell // Cell, Perfect Power","number":"BT31-116","subtitle":"Uncommon","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/