unny Girl","number":"BT30-016","subtitle":"Uncommon","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/684191_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/684191_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Three Glorious Fighters Release Event"],["number","BT30-016"],["rarity","Uncommon"],["type","Leader"],["color","Blue"],["Special Trait","Earthling"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","Young Son Goku Saga"],["Character","Bulma"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Permanent] You can't include non-\"Earthling\" Battle Cards in your deck.\r\n\n\r\n[Activate:Main] [Once per turn] Draw 1 card and add up to 1 card from your life to your hand.\r\n\n\r\n[Awaken] When your life is at 6 or less : Draw 1 card, and you can't activate skills on cards with energy costs of 4 or more in any of your areas for the game.\r\n\n\r\n//\r\n\n\r\nBulma, Adventurous Bunny Girl\r\n\n\r\n[Permanent] If you have 7 or less energy and your blue \"Earthling\" card would be removed from a Battle Area by a skill or KO'd, add that card to your energy in Rest Mode instead.\r\n\n\r\n[Auto] [Once per turn] When your blue \"Earthling\" card attacks, draw 1 card.\r\n\n\r\n[Activate:Battle] Place 1 of your blue energy at the bottom of its owner's deck : Choose up to 1 of your blue \"Earthling\" cards and it gets +15000 power for the battle."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"foil","value":10.27,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":25,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":10.27,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/684191/dragon-ball-super-ccg-three-glorious-fighters-release-event-bulma-bulma-adventurous-bunny-girl"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/684191/dragon-ball-super-ccg-three-glorious-fighters-release-event-bulma-bulma-adventurous-bunny-girl"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Bulma%20%2F%2F%20Bulma%