s://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Energy%20Marker%20-%20Power%20Absorbed%20(M-33)%20(Gold-Stamped)"}]}],"BT29_PR":[{"id":"670792","name":"Krillin // Krillin, Grown-up Support","number":"BT29-001","subtitle":"Uncommon","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/670792_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/670792_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Fearsome Rivals Release Event"],["number","BT29-001"],["rarity","Uncommon"],["type","Leader"],["color","Red"],["Special Trait","Earthling"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","Broly Saga"],["Character","Krillin"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Auto] When this card attacks, look at up to 5 cards from the top of your deck, add up to 1 red \"Earthling\" card to your hand, then shuffle your deck.\n\n[Awaken] When your life is at 4 or less, or you have 2 or more energy and \"Jaguar's Island, Challenge Stage\" in play : Draw 1 card, switch up to 1 of your energy to Active Mode, and add cards from your life to your hand until you have 6 life left.\n\n\nKrillin, Grown-up Support\n\n[Auto] [Once per turn] When you activate a red Extra from your hand, draw 1 card.\n\n[Activate: Main/Battle] [Once per turn] Discard 1 red card\n\nfrom your hand: Play up to 1 \"Son Goten\" or \"Trunks : Youth\" card—both red, with an energy cost of 1, and no keyword skills—from your Drop in Rest Mode.\n\n[Activate:Battle] Discard 1 red Extra from your hand : This card gets +5000 power for the battle."}],"prices":[{"source":"Cardmarket","items":[{"label":"trend","variant":"foil","value":0.49,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg","variant":"foil","value":0.02,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":0.03,"currency":"EUR"}],"ref":{"value":0.22,"currency":"EUR"},"url":null},{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":5,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":null,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/670792/dragon-ball-super-ccg-fearsome-rivals-release-event-krillin-krillin-grown-up-support"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/670792/dragon-ball-super-ccg-fearsome-rivals-release-event-krillin-krillin-grown-up-support"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Krillin%20%2F%2F%20Krillin%2C%20Grown-up%20Support"}]},{"id":"670793","name":"Broly // SS Broly, Increasing Power","number":"BT29-002","subtitle":"Uncommon","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/670793_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/670793_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Fearsome Rivals Release Event"],["number","BT29-002"],["rarity","Uncommon"],["type","Leader"],["color","Red"],["Special Trait","Saiyan"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","Broly Saga"],["Character","Broly"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Activate:Main] [Once per turn] Add up to 1 card from your life to your hand, look at up to 5 cards from the top of your deck, choose up to 2 red \"Broly\" cards, add up to 1 to your hand, place up to 1 into its owner's Drop, then shuffle your deck.\n\n[Awaken] When your life is at 6 or less and you have 2 or more red \"Broly\" cards in your Drop : Draw 1 card.\n\n\nSS Broly, Increasing Power\n\n[Auto] When your red \"Broly\" card is played, place up to 6 red \"Broly\" cards from your Drop under the played card.\n\n[Auto] Discard 1 card from your hand : When this card attacks, draw 2 cards.\n\n[Activate:Main] [Once per turn] Choose up to 1 of your red \"Broly\" cards with 3 or more cards under it, and it gains [Barrier] and [Dual Attack] until the end of your opponent's turn."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"foil","value":5.08,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":4.98,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":5.08,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/670793/dragon-ball-super-ccg-fearsome-rivals-release-event-broly-ss-broly-increasin