d under it until the end of your turn.\n\n[Auto] When this card attacks, draw 1 card."}],"prices":[{"source":"Cardmarket","items":[{"label":"trend","variant":"foil","value":0.12,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg","variant":"foil","value":0.09,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":0.02,"currency":"EUR"}],"ref":{"value":0.1,"currency":"EUR"},"url":null},{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":5,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":null,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/670820/dragon-ball-super-ccg-fearsome-rivals-release-event-vegeta-vegeta-warrior-race-pride"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/670820/dragon-ball-super-ccg-fearsome-rivals-release-event-vegeta-vegeta-warrior-race-pride"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Vegeta%20%2F%2F%20Vegeta%2C%20Warrior%20Race%20Pride"}]},{"id":"670821","name":"Ginyu // Ginyu Force, Assemble","number":"BT29-058","subtitle":"Uncommon","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/670821_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/670821_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Fearsome Rivals Release Event"],["number","BT29-058"],["rarity","Uncommon"],["type","Leader"],["color","Yellow"],["Special Trait","Ginyu Force/Frieza's Army"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","Frieza Saga"],["Character","Ginyu Force"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Auto] When this card attacks, draw 2 cards and discard 1 card from your hand.\n\n[Awaken] When your life is at 4 or less, or you have 2 or more energy and a \"Ginyu Force\" card with an energy cost of 4 or more in play : Draw 2 cards and add cards from your life to your hand until you have 6 life left.\n\n\nGinyu Force, Assemble\n\n[Auto] If you have 3 or more energy : At the end of your turn, choose up to 3 of your yellow \"Ginyu Force\" cards with energy costs of 4 and return them to their owner's hand.\n\n[Activate:Ba