-001","subtitle":"Uncommon","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/650996_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/650996_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Prismatic Clash Release Event"],["number","BT28-001"],["rarity","Uncommon"],["type","Leader"],["color","Red"],["Special Trait","Saiyan/Earthling"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","Frieza Saga"],["Character","Son Gohan : Youth"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Activate:Battle] If your red \"Vegeta\", \"Krillin\", or \"Namekian\" card is in a battle and you choose 1 of your red \"Son Gohan : Youth\" cards : Draw 1 card, switch your card that's in a battle with the chosen card, and it gets +10000 power for the battle. Flip this card to its back side.\n\n\n\nSon Gohan, Protecting the Weak\n\n[Auto] When a Battle Card that is in your opponent's Battle Area and whose owner is your opponent is KO'd by your red card's attack or skill, flip this card to its front side."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"foil","value":0.62,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":0.99,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":0.62,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/650996/dragon-ball-super-ccg-prismatic-clash-release-event-son-gohan-son-gohan-protecting-the-weak"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/650996/dragon-ball-super-ccg-prismatic-clash-release-event-son-gohan-son-gohan-protecting-the-weak"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Son%20Gohan%20%2F%2F%20Son%20Gohan%2C%20Protecting%20the%20Weak"}]},{"id":"650997","name":"Dragon Ball // Porunga, Wish Dragon","number":"BT28-002","subtitle":"Uncommon","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/650997_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/650997_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Prismatic Clash Release Event"],["number","BT28-002"],["rarity","Uncommon"],["type","Leader"],["color","Red"],["Special Trait","Shenron"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","Frieza Saga"],["Character","Dragon Ball/Porunga"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Permanent] This card can't attack.\n\n[Activate:Main] Switch this card to Rest Mode and discard 1 card from your hand : Look through your deck and your life, add up to a total of 3 cards with [Dragon Ball] among them to your hand, then shuffle any areas you looked through with this skill.\n\n[Wish] When there are 7 [Dragon Ball] cards in your Drop : Add up to 1 card from your Drop to your Z-Energy.\n\n\n\nPorunga, Wish Dragon\n\n[Permanent] This card can't attack.\n\n[Activate:Main] [Once per turn] Play up to 1 red \"Piccolo\" card with an energy cost of 1 from your Drop.\n\n[Activate:Main] [Once per turn] R, place 7 [Dragon Ball] Extras from your Battle Area into their owner's Drop : Draw 1 card, choose all of your and your opponent's non-\"Frieza\" Battle Cards, place them at the bottom of their owners' decks in any order, and deal 1 damage to your opponent."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"foil","value":0.55,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":0.99,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":0.55,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/650997/dragon-ball-super-ccg-prismatic-clash-release-event-dragon-ball-porunga-wish-dragon"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/650997/dragon-ball-super-ccg-prismatic-clash-release-event-dragon-ball-porunga-wish-dragon"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Dragon%20Ball%20%2F%2F%20Porunga%2C%20Wish%20Dragon"}]},{"id":"650998","name":"Son Gohan, Surprise Move","number":"BT28-006","subtitle":"Uncommon","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/650998_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/650998_400w.jpg","details":[["set