er name, switching this card to Rest Mode can also fulfill the conditions.\n\n[Auto] [Once per turn] When your \"Chi-Chi\" card is played, draw 1 card."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"foil","value":1.15,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":0.99,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":1.15,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/651008/dragon-ball-super-ccg-prismatic-clash-release-event-chi-chi-chi-chi-maiden-spirit"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/651008/dragon-ball-super-ccg-prismatic-clash-release-event-chi-chi-chi-chi-maiden-spirit"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Chi-chi%20%2F%2F%20Chi-Chi%2C%20Maiden%20Spirit"}]},{"id":"651009","name":"Tien Shinhan // Tien Shinhan, Return of the Mysterious Technique","number":"BT28-056","subtitle":"Uncommon","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/651009_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/651009_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Prismatic Clash Release Event"],["number","BT28-056"],["rarity","Uncommon"],["type","Leader"],["color","Green"],["Special Trait","Earthling/World Tournament"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","World Martial Arts Tournament Saga"],["Character","Tien Shinhan"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Auto] When this card attacks, draw 1 card.\n\n[Activate:Main] Add up to 1 green \"Chiaotzu\" card with 5000 power or less from your deck to your hand, shuffle your deck, and negate this skill for the game.\n\n[Awaken] When you have 2 or more energy and a green Z-Extra with an energy cost of 2 in your Battle Area : Play 3 Multi-Form Tokens into your Battle Area, switch up to 1 of your energy to Active Mode, and add cards from your life to your hand until you have 6 life left.\n\n(Multi-Form Tokens have 10000 power, 0 combo cost, and 5000 combo power.)\n\n\n\nTien Shinhan, Return of the Mysterious Technique\n\n[Auto] When this card attacks, draw 1 card, and this card gets +5000 power for the battle.\n\n[Activate:Main] [Once per turn] Choose up to 1 of your Multi-Form Tokens and it gets +10000 power for the turn.\n\n[Activate:Battle] [Once per turn] If your opponent has 2 or more energy : The next time you activate an [Activate:Battle] skill on a green \"Tien Shinhan\" card in your hand during the battle, reduce the skill cost by G."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"foil","value":0.42,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":0.41,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":0.42,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/651009/dragon-ball-super-ccg-prismatic-clash-release-event-tien-shinhan-tien-shinhan-return-of-the-mysterious-technique"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/651009/dragon-ball-super-ccg-prismatic-clash-release-event-tien-shinhan-tien-shinhan-return-of-the-mysterious-technique"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Tien%20Shinhan%20%2F%2F%20Tien%20Shinhan%2C%20Return%20of%20the%20Mysterious%20Technique"}]},{"id":"650975","name":"Annin, Keeper of the Furnace of Eight Divisions","number":"BT28-058","subtitle":"Rare","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/650975_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/650975_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Prismatic Clash Release Event"],["number","BT28-058"],["rarity","Rare"],["type","Unison"],["color","Green"],["Energy(Color Cost)","X(GG)"],["power","15000"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Auto] When you activate an [Alliance] skill, this card gets +5000 power for the turn.\n\n[±2] [Activate:Main] Choose up to 1 of your green \"Chi-Chi\" cards with an energy cost of 3 and return it to its owner's hand.\n\n[-5] [Activate:Main] Choose up to 1 each of \"Son Goku\" cards with an [Alliance] sk