ct","body":"[Auto] When this card attacks, draw 1 card.\n\n[Activate:Main] Once per turn Choose 1 of your white \"Universe 7\" Battle Cards and switch it to Hidden Mode : Increase this card's power by the original power on the front of the card that was switched to Hidden Mode by this skill for the turn.\n\n[Awaken] When your life is at 4 or less, or you have 2 or more Hidden Mode cards in your Battle Area : Draw 2 cards and add cards from your life to your hand until you have 6 life left.\n\n(A Hidden Mode card is a face-down card without a card type, and a Revealed Mode card is a face-up card.)\n\n\n\nSSG Son Goku, Crimson Power\n\n[Auto] When this card attacks, draw 1 card.\n\n[Activate:Main] [Once per turn] Choose 1 Hidden Mode card in your Battle Area and place it into its owner's Drop : Draw 1 card.\n\n[Activate:Main] [Once per turn] Choose 1 of your white \"Universe 7\" Battle Cards and switch it to Hidden Mode : Choose up to 1 of your Leaders or up to 1 of your white \"Universe 7\" Battle Cards and increase that card's power by the original power on the front of the card that was switched to Hidden Mode by this skill for the turn."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"foil","value":2.29,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":2.2,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":2.29,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/651021/dragon-ball-super-ccg-prismatic-clash-release-event-son-goku-ssg-son-goku-crimson-power"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/651021/dragon-ball-super-ccg-prismatic-clash-release-event-son-goku-ssg-son-goku-crimson-power"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Son%20Goku%20%2F%2F%20SSG%20Son%20Goku%2C%20Crimson%20Power"}]},{"id":"651022","name":"Belmod // Belmod, God of Destruction","number":"BT28-106","subtitle":"Uncommon","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/6