, and negate this skill for the game.\r\n\n[Awaken] When your life is at 4 or less, or you have 2 or more energy and a \"Destroyed West City\" in your Battle Area : Draw 2 cards and add cards from your life to your hand until you have 6 life left.\r\n\nAndroid 17 & Android 18, Future Evil\r\n\n[Auto] [Once per turn] When your \"Android 17\" or \"Android 18\" card attacks, draw 1 card. \r\n\n[Activate:Main] [Once per turn] Choose 1 of your \"Android 20\" cards and KO it : Play up to 1 red \"Android 17\" or \"Android 18\" card—both with no keyword skills and with an energy cost less than or equal to your energy—from your hand, and that card gains [Barrier] for the turn. Choose up to 1 of your opponent's Battle Cards or Unisons and it gets-15000 power for the turn.\r\n\n[Activate:Battle] [Once per turn] If it's your turn : Choose up to 1 of your red \"Android\" cards and it gets +5000 power for the battle."}],"prices":[{"source":"Cardmarket","items":[{"label":"trend","variant":"foil","value":1.87,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg","variant":"foil","value":1.39,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":0.8,"currency":"EUR"}],"ref":{"value":1.66,"currency":"EUR"},"url":null},{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"foil","value":1.54,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":1.22,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":1.54,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/639714/dragon-ball-super-ccg-expansion-deck-box-set-25-premium-anniversary-box-2025-android-17-and-android-18-android-17-and-android-18-future-evil"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/639714/dragon-ball-super-ccg-expansion-deck-box-set-25-premium-anniversary-box-2025-android-17-and-android-18-android-17-and-android-18-future-evil"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Android%2017%20%26%20Android%2018%20%2F%2F%20Android%2017%20%26%20Android%2018%2C