{"id":"639860","name":"Trunks // SS2 Trunks, Envoy of Justice Returns (Reprint)","number":"SD18-01","subtitle":"Starter Rare","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/639860_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/639860_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Expansion Deck Box Set 25: Premium Anniversary Box 2025"],["number","SD18-01"],["rarity","Starter Rare"],["type","Leader"],["color","Blue"],["Special Trait","Saiyan/Earthling"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","Future Trunks Saga"],["Character","Trunks : Future"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Permanent] During your opponent's turn, if you would add a card from your life to your hand or place it in your Drop, you may reveal it and add it to your hand instead.\r\n\n[Auto] When this card attacks, look at up to 5 cards from the top of your deck, add up to 1 \"Saiyan\" or \"Earthling\" card—both blue and with an energy cost of 4 or less—or 1 blue Unison with a specified cost of 2 among them to your hand, then shuffle your deck.\r\n\n[Awaken] When a player's life is at 4 or less or a player has 3 or more Z-Energy : You may draw 1 card and switch up to 1 of your energy to Active Mode.\r\n\n\nSS2 Trunks, Envoy of Justice Returns\r\n\n[Permanent] During your opponent's turn, if you would add a card from your life to your hand or place it in your Drop, you may reveal it and add it to your hand instead.\r\n\n[Auto] When this card attacks, draw 1 card.\r\n\n[Auto] At the end of your turn, switch up to 1 of your mono-blue energy to Active Mode.\r\n\n[Activate:Main] [Once per turn] BB : Draw 1 card, then choose up to 1 of your opponent's Battle Cards and place it at the bottom of its owner's deck. Additionally, if you have a mono-blue Z-Battle Card with an energy cost of 5 or more in play, this card gets +10000 power and [Double Strike] for the turn."}],"prices":[{"source":"Cardmarket","items":[{"label":"trend","variant":"foil","value":2.11,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg","variant":"