"Special Trait","Frieza Clan/Frieza's Army"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","Frieza Saga/Resurrection 'F' Saga"],["Character","Frieza"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Auto] When this card attacks, look at up to 5 cards from the top of your deck, add up to 1 yellow \"Frieza Clan\" card to your hand, then shuffle your deck.\n\n\n\n[Activate:Main] [Once per turn] Add up to 1 card from your life to your hand, place up to 1 yellow \"Frieza Clan card from your deck into its owner's Drop, then shuffle your deck.\n\n\n\n[Awaken] When your life is at 5 or less : Draw 2 cards.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nGolden Frieza, Shining Pride\n\n\n\n[Auto] Discard 1 yellow card from your hand : When this card attacks, draw 2 cards.\n\n\n\n[Activate:Main] [Once per turn] Place 1 of your yellow \"Frieza Clan\" cards into its owner's Drop : Play up to 1 yellow \"Frieza Clan\" card with an energy cost of 11 from your hand."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"normal","value":2.16,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"normal","value":0.99,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":2.16,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/620057/dragon-ball-super-ccg-history-of-z-pre-release-cards-frieza-golden-frieza-shining-pride"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/620057/dragon-ball-super-ccg-history-of-z-pre-release-cards-frieza-golden-frieza-shining-pride"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Frieza%20%2F%2F%20Golden%20Frieza%2C%20Shining%20Pride"}]},{"id":"620052","name":"Broly // SS Broly, Big Action","number":"BT27-066","subtitle":"Uncommon","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/620052_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/620052_400w.jpg","details":[["set","History of Z Pre-Release Cards"],["number","BT27-066"],["rarity","Uncommon"],["type","Leader"],["color","Yellow"],["Special Trait","Saiyan/Saiyan/Fierce Foe"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","Broly Saga"],["Character","Broly"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Auto] When this card attacks, draw 1 card.\n\n\n\n[Awaken] When your life is at 4 or less, or you have 2 or more energy and a yellow Z-Unison with a specitied cost of 2 in play : Draw 1 card, switch up to 1 of your energy to Active Mode, and add cards from your life to your hand until you have 4 life left.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nSS Broly, Big Action</strong\n\n\n\n[Auto] [Once per turn] When your energy is switched to Rest Mode, draw 1 card. Additionally, if it's your turn and all of your energy is in Rest Mode and is mono-yellow, play up to 1 yellow \"Fierce Foe\" card with an energy cost less than or equal to your current energy from your hand, and this card gets +10000 power until the end of your opponent's turn."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"normal","value":2.45,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"normal","value":4.69,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":2.45,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/620052/dragon-ball-super-ccg-history-of-z-pre-release-cards-broly-ss-broly-big-action"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/620052/dragon-ball-super-ccg-history-of-z-pre-release-cards-broly-ss-broly-big-action"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Broly%20%2F%2F%20SS%20Broly%2C%20Big%20Action"}]},{"id":"620049","name":"Tapion, Confrontation","number":"BT27-067","subtitle":"Uncommon","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/620049_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/620049_400w.jpg","details":[["set","History of Z Pre-Release Cards"],["number","BT27-067"],["rarity","Uncommon"],["type","Z-Unison"],["color","Yellow"],["Energy(Color Cost)","X(YY)"],["Z-Energy Cost","1"],["power","15000"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Auto] [Once per t