lue \"Gogeta : Br\" card's [Union] skill from your hand. If you do, add the chosen cards to your Z-Energy. \n\r\n[Auto] When this card attacks, draw 1 card. \n\r\n[Activate:Main] [Once per turn] If you have a Battle Card with a [Union] skill in play and you place 1 of your Z-Energy into your Drop : Switch this card to Active Mode."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"normal","value":9.32,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"normal","value":4,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":9.32,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/584667/dragon-ball-super-ccg-ultimate-advent-pre-release-cards-gogeta-ssb-gogeta-mighty-fusion-warrior"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/584667/dragon-ball-super-ccg-ultimate-advent-pre-release-cards-gogeta-ssb-gogeta-mighty-fusion-warrior"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Gogeta%20%2F%2F%20SSB%20Gogeta%2C%20Mighty%20Fusion%20Warrior"}]},{"id":"584752","name":"Broly // SS Broly, Full-Power Explosion","number":"BT26-032","subtitle":"Uncommon","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/584752_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/584752_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Ultimate Advent Pre-Release Cards"],["number","BT26-032"],["rarity","Uncommon"],["type","Leader"],["color","Blue"],["Special Trait","Saiyan/Frieza's Army"],["Era","DBS : Broly Saga"],["Character","Broly : Br"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Permanent] When your blue \"Broly : Br\" card would be removed from a Battle Area by a skill or KO'd, if 1 or more blue \"Broly : Br\" cards are under that card, return all of them to their owner's hand instead. \n\r\n[Auto] When this card attacks, add up to 1 card from your life to your hand, look at up to 7 cards from the top of your deck, add up to 1 blue \"Broly : Br\" card to your hand, then shuffle your deck. \n\r\n[Awaken] When