 1 card.\r\n\n[Activate:Battle] [Once per turn] If it's your opponent's turn and you have 1 or more red cards and 1 or more green cards in your Combo Area : During this turn, the next time you activate [Arrival Red/Green] on a \"Vegeta\" or \"Trunks : Future\" card in your hand, reduce the skill cost by R."}],"prices":[{"source":"Cardmarket","items":[{"label":"trend","value":0.08,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg","value":0.05,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"low","value":0.02,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg7","value":0.05,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg30","value":0.07,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"trend","variant":"foil","value":1.58,"currency":"EUR"}],"ref":{"value":0.06,"currency":"EUR"},"url":null},{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"normal","value":0.13,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"normal","value":0.1,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":0.13,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/555722/dragon-ball-super-ccg-legend-of-the-dragon-balls-trunks-ss-trunks-tournament-battle-to-the-death"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/555722/dragon-ball-super-ccg-legend-of-the-dragon-balls-trunks-ss-trunks-tournament-battle-to-the-death"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Trunks%20%2F%2F%20SS%20Trunks%2C%20Tournament%20Battle%20to%20the%20Death"}]},{"id":"556800","name":"Trunks // SS Trunks, Tournament Battle to the Death (SLR)","number":"BT25-070","subtitle":"Special Leader Rare","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/556800_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/556800_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Legend of the Dragon Balls"],["number","BT25-070"],["rarity","Special Leader Rare"],["type","Leader"],["color","Green"],["Special Trait","Saiyan/Earthling"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","Boujack Saga"],["Character","Trunks : Future"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Permanent] Negate the [Energy-Exhaust] skill on Red/Green multicolor \"Saiyan\" cards in all of your areas.\r\n\n[Auto] [Once per turn] When your \"Vegeta\" or \"Trunks : Future\" card attacks, look at up to 5 cards from the top of your deck, add up to 1 \"Saiyan\" or \"Earthling\" card—both red or green and with an energy cost of 4 or less—to your hand, then shuffle your deck.\r\n\n[Awaken] When your life is at 4 or less, or you have 2 or more energy and \"Vegeta, Rescuing a Son\" in play : Draw 1 card, switch up to 1 of your energy to Active Mode, and add cards from your life to your hand until you have 6 life left.\r\n\n\r\n\nSS Trunks, Tournament Battle to the Death\r\n\n[Auto] Once per turn] When you use a card in a combo, draw 1 card.\r\n\n[Activate:Battle] [Once per turn] If it's your opponent's turn and you have 1 or more red cards and 1 or more green cards in your Combo Area : During this turn, the next time you activate [Arrival Red/Green] on a \"Vegeta\" or \"Trunks : Future\" card in your hand, reduce the skill cost by R."}],"prices":[{"source":"Cardmarket","items":[{"label":"trend","variant":"foil","value":59.49,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg","variant":"foil","value":120,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":100,"currency":"EUR"}],"ref":{"value":100,"currency":"EUR"},"url":null},{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"foil","value":94.65,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":180,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":94.65,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/556800/dragon-ball-super-ccg-legend-of-the-dragon-balls-trunks-ss-trunks-tournament-battle-to-the-death-slr"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/556800/dragon-ball-super-ccg-legend-of-the-dragon-balls-trunks-ss-trunks-tournament-battle-to-the-death-slr"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Trunks%20%2F%2F%20SS%20Trunks%2C%20To