["set","Legend of the Dragon Balls Pre-Release Cards"],["number","BT25-001"],["rarity","Uncommon"],["type","Leader"],["color","Red"],["Special Trait","Saiyan"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","King Piccolo Saga"],["Character","Son Goku : Childhood"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Auto] When this card attacks, draw 1 card.\r\n\n[Activate:Main] [Once per turn] Add up to 1 card from your life to your hand, place up to 1 red skill-less Battle Card from your deck in your Drop, then shuffle your deck.\r\n\n[Awaken] When your life is at 4 or less : Draw 2 cards.\r\n\n\r\n\nSon Goku Face-Off With the Great Demon King\r\n\n[Auto] [Once per turn] When your red originally skill-less Battle Card is played, draw 1 card.\r\n\n[Auto] When your red Battle Card with 30000 power is played, choose up to 1 of your opponent's Battle Cards or Unisons and it gets-15000 power for the turn.\r\n\n[Activate:Main] You may play 1 red skill-less Battle Card from your Z-Deck or hand. If you do, negate this skill for the turn."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"normal","value":4.48,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"normal","value":3.99,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":4.48,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/558634/dragon-ball-super-ccg-legend-of-the-dragon-balls-pre-release-cards-son-goku-son-goku-face-off-with-the-great-demon-king"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/558634/dragon-ball-super-ccg-legend-of-the-dragon-balls-pre-release-cards-son-goku-son-goku-face-off-with-the-great-demon-king"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Son%20Goku%20%2F%2F%20Son%20Goku%20Face-Off%20With%20the%20Great%20Demon%20King"}]},{"id":"558622","name":"King Piccolo // King Piccolo, Final Stage of Conquest","number":"BT25-002","subtitle":"Uncommon","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/558622_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":