t Battle to the Death\r\n\n[Auto] Once per turn] When you use a card in a combo, draw 1 card.\r\n\n[Activate:Battle] [Once per turn] If it's your opponent's turn and you have 1 or more red cards and 1 or more green cards in your Combo Area : During this turn, the next time you activate [Arrival Red/Green] on a \"Vegeta\" or \"Trunks : Future\" card in your hand, reduce the skill cost by R."}],"prices":[{"source":"Cardmarket","items":[{"label":"trend","value":0.08,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg","value":0.05,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"low","value":0.02,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg7","value":0.05,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg30","value":0.07,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"trend","variant":"foil","value":1.58,"currency":"EUR"}],"ref":{"value":0.06,"currency":"EUR"},"url":null},{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"low","variant":"normal","value":1,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":null,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/558643/dragon-ball-super-ccg-legend-of-the-dragon-balls-pre-release-cards-trunks-ss-trunks-tournament-battle-to-the-death"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/558643/dragon-ball-super-ccg-legend-of-the-dragon-balls-pre-release-cards-trunks-ss-trunks-tournament-battle-to-the-death"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Trunks%20%2F%2F%20SS%20Trunks%2C%20Tournament%20Battle%20to%20the%20Death"}]},{"id":"558618","name":"Boujack Brigade // Boujack, Crashing the Tournament","number":"BT25-071","subtitle":"Uncommon","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/558618_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/558618_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Legend of the Dragon Balls Pre-Release Cards"],["number","BT25-071"],["rarity","Uncommon"],["type","Leader"],["color","Green"],["Special Trait","Boujack Brigade"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","Boujack Saga"],["Character","Boujack Brigade/Boujack"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Auto] When this card attacks, draw 1 card.\r\n\n[Activate:Main] [Once per turn] Place 1 green \"Boujack Brigade\" card from your hand face up in your Z-Deck : Look at up to 5 cards from the top of your deck, add up to 1 green \"Boujack Brigade\" card to your hand, then shuffle your deck.\r\n\n[Awaken] When your life is at 4 or less or you have 2 or more face-up \"Boujack Brigade\" cards in your Z-Deck : Draw 1 card, switch up to 1 of your energy to Active Mode, and add cards from your life to your hand until you have 6 life left.\r\n\nBoujack, Crashing the Tournament\r\n\n[Auto] [Once per turn] When your green \"Boujack Brigade\" card is played, draw 1 card.\r\n\n[Auto] [Once per turn] Place 3 face-up \"Boujack Brigade\" cards from your Z-Deck in your Drop : When this card attacks, switch this card to Active Mode and it gets +10000 power for the battle.\r\n\n[Activate:Battle] [Once per turn] If it's your opponent's turn and you KO 1 of your green \"Boujack Brigade\" cards : This card gets +10000 power for the battle."}],"prices":[{"source":"Cardmarket","items":[{"label":"trend","value":0.18,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg","value":0.09,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"low","value":0.02,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg7","value":0.16,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg30","value":0.09,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"trend","variant":"foil","value":1.92,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":1,"currency":"EUR"}],"ref":{"value":0.13,"currency":"EUR"},"url":null},{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"low","variant":"normal","value":0.9,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":null,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/558618/dragon-ball-super-ccg-legend-of-the-dragon-balls-pre-release-cards-boujack-brigade-boujack-crashing-the-tournament"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/558618/dragon-ball-super-ccg-legend-of-the-dragon-balls-pre-release-cards-boujack-brigade-boujack-crashing-the-tournament"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"ht