gito, Potara-Fusion to Protect the Future","number":"BT25-094","subtitle":"Rare","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/558669_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/558669_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Legend of the Dragon Balls Pre-Release Cards"],["number","BT25-094"],["rarity","Rare"],["type","Battle"],["color","Green"],["Energy(Color Cost)","7(GG)"],["Special Trait","Saiyan"],["power","25000"],["Combo Power","5000"],["Combo Energy","0"],["Era","Future Trunks Saga"],["Character","Vegito"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Deflect] [Triple Strike]\r\n\n[Union-Potara] GGG : Green \"Vegeta\" Z-Battle Card and green \"Son Goku\" card.\r\n\n[Auto] When this card is played, choose up to 1 of your opponent's Unisons and remove 2 markers from it, and your opponent discards 1 card from their hand.\r\n\n[Activate:Main] [Limit 1] If your Leader is a green card with both \"Trunks : Future\" and \"Mai : Future\", you have \"Vegeta, Fusion in the Future\" in play, and you discard this card from your hand : Add up to 1 \"Vegito, Fusion in\r\nthe Future\" from your deck to your hand, then shuffle your deck."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"foil","value":1.7,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":1.7,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":1.7,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/558669/dragon-ball-super-ccg-legend-of-the-dragon-balls-pre-release-cards-ssb-vegito-potara-fusion-to-protect-the-future"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/558669/dragon-ball-super-ccg-legend-of-the-dragon-balls-pre-release-cards-ssb-vegito-potara-fusion-to-protect-the-future"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=SSB%20Vegito%2C%20Potara-Fusion%20to%20Protect%20the%20Future"}]},{"id":"558640","name":"SS4 Son Goku & SS4 Vegeta // SS4 Gogeta, Strongest Fusion Explosion","numbe