ffect","body":"[Auto] [Once per turn] When you play a yellow \"Frieza\" card, this card gets +10000 power for the turn.\r\n\n\r\n[+2] [Activate:Main] If your Leader is a green \"Frieza\" card and you declare 1 number that's 3 or less : Choose up to 1 of your opponent's non-token Battle Cards and increase its energy cost by the declared number for the turn.\r\n\n\r\n[-3] [Activate:Main] Your opponent discards 1 card from their hand."}],"prices":[{"source":"Cardmarket","items":[{"label":"trend","variant":"foil","value":0.23,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg","variant":"foil","value":0.16,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":0.02,"currency":"EUR"}],"ref":{"value":0.2,"currency":"EUR"},"url":null},{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"low","variant":"normal","value":0.76,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"market","variant":"foil","value":0.33,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":0.07,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":0.33,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/538198/dragon-ball-super-ccg-beyond-generations-cooler-brotherly-assistance"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/538198/dragon-ball-super-ccg-beyond-generations-cooler-brotherly-assistance"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Cooler%2C%20Brotherly%20Assistance"}]},{"id":"538199","name":"You Must Die By My Hand!","number":"BT24-060","subtitle":"Common","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/538199_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/538199_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Beyond Generations"],["number","BT24-060"],["rarity","Common"],["type","Z-Extra"],["color","Green"],["Energy(Color Cost)","1(G)"],["Z-Energy Cost","1"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Auto] If your Leader is a green \"Frieza\" card, your life is at 1, and you remove this card from the game : When one of your green \"Frieza\" cards attac