\r\n\n\n\r\n\n[Auto] [Once per turn] When you use one of your red \"Saiyan\" or \"Earthling\" cards in a combo, draw 1 card.\r\n\n\n\r\n\n[Activate:Main] [Once per turn] Place 1 red \"Saiyan\" from your Z-Energy under [Concentrated Saiyan Power] in your Battle Area : Draw 1 card and discard 1 card from your hand.\r\n\n\n\r\n\n[Awaken] When your life is at 4 or less, or your life is at 6 or less and you have a red \"Bulma\" card in your Drop : Draw 2 cards.\r\n\n\n\r\n\nVegeta, Awakened Feelings\r\n\n\n\r\n\n[Auto] If you have a red Z-Unison with an original power of 20000 or more in play : When this card attacks, this card gets +5000 power and [Critical] for the battle.\r\n\n\n\r\n\n[Auto] [Once per turn] When you use one of your red \"Saiyan\" or \"Earthling\" cards in a combo, draw 1 card.\r\n\n\n\r\n\n[Activate:Main] [Once per turn] Place 1 red \"Saiyan\" from your Z-Energy under [Concentrated Saiyain Power] in your Battle Area : Draw 1 card and discard 1 card from your hand."}],"prices":[{"source":"Cardmarket","items":[{"label":"trend","variant":"foil","value":1.17,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg","variant":"foil","value":4.54,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":0.1,"currency":"EUR"}],"ref":{"value":1.39,"currency":"EUR"},"url":null},{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":8.5,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":null,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/542535/dragon-ball-super-ccg-beyond-generations-pre-release-cards-vegeta-vegeta-awakened-feelings"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/542535/dragon-ball-super-ccg-beyond-generations-pre-release-cards-vegeta-vegeta-awakened-feelings"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Vegeta%20%2F%2F%20Vegeta%2C%20Awakened%20Feelings"}]},{"id":"542536","name":"Beerus // Beerus, Pursuing the Power of the Gods","number":"BT24-002","subtitle":"Uncommon","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/542536_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/542536_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Beyond Generations Pre-Release Cards"],["number","BT24-002"],["rarity","Uncommon"],["type","Leader"],["color","Red"],["Special Trait","God"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","Battle of Gods Saga"],["Character","Beerus"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"Beerus\r\n\n\n\r\n\n[Permanent] Negate the [Energy-Exhaust] skill on your Red/Yellow multicolor \"God\" cards in all areas.\r\n\n\n\r\n\n[Activate:Main] [Once per turn] Add 1 red or yellow \"God\" card from your hand to your Z-Energy : Look at up to 5 cards from the top of your deck, add up to 1 red \"God\" card to your hand, then shuffle your deck.\r\n\n\n\r\n\n[Awaken] When your life is at 4 or less, or you have 2 or more energy and you have a red Z-Unison with a specified cost of 1 in play : Draw 2 cards and add cards from your life to your hand until you have 6 life left.\r\n\n\n\r\n\nBeerus, Pursuing the Power of the Gods\r\n\n\n\r\n\n[Blocker]\r\n\n\n\r\n\n[Permanent] Negate the [Energy-Exhaust] skill on your Red/Yellow multicolor \"God\" cards in all areas.\r\n\n\n\r\n\n[Auto] When this card attacks, draw 1 card.\r\n\n\n\r\n\n[Auto] [Once per turn] When you use one of your Red/Yellow multicolor \"God\" cards in a combo, add up to 1 card from your life to your hand, and during this turn, the next time you activate [Arrival Red/Yellow] on a \"Beerus\" card with an energy cost of 5 in your hand, reduce the skill cost by R."}],"prices":[{"source":"Cardmarket","items":[{"label":"trend","variant":"foil","value":1.88,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg","variant":"foil","value":0.1,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":0.1,"currency":"EUR"}],"ref":{"value":0.82,"currency":"EUR"},"url":null},{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":2.99,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":null,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/542536/dragon-ball-super-ccg-beyond-generations-pre-release-cards-beerus-beerus-pursuing-the-power-of-the-gods"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/542536/dragon-ball-super-ccg-beyond-generations-pre-release-cards-beerus-beerus-pursuing-the-power-of-the-gods"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Beerus%20%2F%2F%20Beerus%2C%20Pursuing%20the%20Power%20of%20the%20Gods"}]},{"id":"542506","name":"SSG Son Goku, Crimson Guardian Deity","number":"BT24-004","subtitle":"Rare","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/542506_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/542506_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Beyond Generations Pre-Release Cards"],["number","BT24-004"],["rarity","Rare"],["type","Unison"],["color","Red"],["Energy(Color Cost)","X(RRRR)"],["Z-Energy Cost","2"],["power","20000"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Double Strike] [Barrier]\r\n\n\n\r\n\n[Auto] When a player attacks, you may use 1 Battle Card from under this card in a combo with its skills negated for the turn. If you do, negate this skill for the turn.\r\n\n\n\r\n\n[-1] [Activate:Main] Switch this card to Active Mode, choose up to 1 of your opponent's Battle Cards, ignoring [Barrier], and it gets -25000 power for the turn.\r\n\n\n\r\n\n[-2] [Activate:Main] Choose all of your opponent's Battle Cards and Unisons and they get -25000 power for the turn. Choose up to 1 of your cards and it gets +5000 power until the end of your opponent's turn."}],"prices":[{"source":"Cardmarket","items":[{"label":"trend","variant":"foil","value":0.02,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg","variant":"foil","value":0.08,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":0.02,"currency":"EUR"}],"ref":{"value":0.08,"currency":"EUR"},"url":null},{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":10,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":null,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/542506/dragon-ball-super-