hling\", or Namekian card—all green and with an energy cost of 4 or less—to your hand, then shuffle your deck.\r\n\n\r\n\n[Awaken] When your life is at 4 or less or you have a green Z-Unison with a specified cost of 2 in play : Draw 1 card, switch up to 1 of your energy to Active Mode, and add cards from your life to your hand until you have 6 life left.\r\n\n\r\nSS Son Goku, Beginning of a Legend\r\n\n\r\n\n[Auto] When this card attacks, this card gets +5000 power for the battle.\r\n\n\r\n\n[Auto] [Once per turn] When one of your Battle Cards gains [Blocker] by the skill of a green Z-Unison, add up to 1 green Battle Card from your Drop to your Z-Energy with its skills negated for the turn.\r\n\n\r\n\n[Activate:Battle] [Once per turn] Draw 1 card, then choose up to 1 of your cards and it gets +5000 power for the battle."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"normal","value":2.5,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"normal","value":2,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":2.5,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/542550/dragon-ball-super-ccg-beyond-generations-pre-release-cards-son-goku-ss-son-goku-beginning-of-a-legend"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/542550/dragon-ball-super-ccg-beyond-generations-pre-release-cards-son-goku-ss-son-goku-beginning-of-a-legend"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Son%20Goku%20%2F%2F%20SS%20Son%20Goku%2C%20Beginning%20of%20a%20Legend"}]},{"id":"542551","name":"Frieza // Frieza, Scourge of Saiyans","number":"BT24-056","subtitle":"Uncommon","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/542551_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/542551_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Beyond Generations Pre-Release Cards"],["number","BT24-056"],["rarity","Uncommon"],["type","Leader"],["color","Green"],["Special Trait","Frieza Clan/Frieza's Army"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","Frieza Saga"],["Character","Frieza"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"Frieza\r\n\n\n\r\n\n[Activate:Main] [Once per turn] Add 1 card from your life to your hand : Look at up to 5 cards from the top of your deck, add up to 1 green or yellow \"Frieza\" card to your hand, then shuffle your deck.\r\n\n\n\r\n\n[Awaken] When your life is at 4 or less : Draw 1 card and switch up to 1 of your energy to Active Mode.\r\n\n\n\r\n\nFrieza, Scourge of Saiyans\r\n\n\n\r\n\n[Permanent] When choosing Battle Cards for the skill cost of [Successor] on a \"Frieza\" card in your hand, once per turn you may choose any number of your opponent's Battle Cards as mono-green Battle Cards.\r\n\n\n\r\n\n[Auto] When this card attacks, draw 1 card.\r\n\n\n\r\n\n[Activate:Battle] [Once per turn] [Spirit Boost 1] Use up to 1 Green/Yellow multicolor card with a combo cost of 1 from your hand in a combo with its skills negated for the turn."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"foil","value":0.65,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":0.71,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":0.65,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/542551/dragon-ball-super-ccg-beyond-generations-pre-release-cards-frieza-frieza-scourge-of-saiyans"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/542551/dragon-ball-super-ccg-beyond-generations-pre-release-cards-frieza-frieza-scourge-of-saiyans"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Frieza%20%2F%2F%20Frieza%2C%20Scourge%20of%20Saiyans"}]},{"id":"542518","name":"Cooler, Brotherly Assistance","number":"BT24-059","subtitle":"Rare","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/542518_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/542518_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Beyond Generations Pre-Release Cards"],["number","BT24-059"],["rarity","Rare"],["type","Unison"],["colo