0Power"}]},{"id":"542560","name":"SS4 Son Goku & SS4 Vegeta // SS4 Vegito, Sparking Potara Warrior","number":"BT24-112","subtitle":"Uncommon","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/542560_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/542560_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Beyond Generations Pre-Release Cards"],["number","BT24-112"],["rarity","Uncommon"],["type","Leader"],["color","Black"],["Special Trait","Saiyan"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","Prison Planet Saga"],["Character","Son Goku: Xeno/Vegeta: Xeno/Vegito: Xeno"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"SS4 Son Goku & SS4 Vegeta\r\n\n\n[Auto] [Once per turn] [Burst 1] When one of your \"Son Goku : Xeno\" or \"Vegeta : Xeno\" cards is used in a combo, draw 1 card.\r\n\n\n[Awaken] When your life is at 4 or less or you have a black Z-Unison with a specified cost of 2 in play : Draw 1 card, switch up to 1 of your energy to Active Mode, and add cards from your life to your hand until you have 6 life left.\r\n\n\nSS4 Vegito, Sparking Potara Warrior\r\n\n\n[Permanent] You can choose Battle Cards from under your black Z-Unison when choosing cards to use with a black card's [Union-Potara] skill from your hand. \r\n\n\n[Auto] [Once per turn] When your black card with a [Union] skill or black Z-Unison attacks or activates the [Blocker] skill, draw 1 card and it gets +5000 power for the turn.\r\n\n\n[Activate:Battle] [Once per turn] Use up to 2 black cards with 5000 combo power from under your Battle Cards or Z-Unisons—both black—in a combo with their skills negated for the turn."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"foil","value":4.35,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":2,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":4.35,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/542560/dragon-ball-super-ccg-beyond-generations-pre-release-cards-ss4-son-goku-and-ss4-vegeta-ss4-vegito-sparking-potara-warrior"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer",