BT23-037","subtitle":"Uncommon","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/522411_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/522411_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Perfect Combination"],["number","BT23-037"],["rarity","Uncommon"],["type","Leader"],["color","Blue"],["Special Trait","Saiyan/Namekian"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","Saiyan Saga"],["Character","Son Goku/Piccolo"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"Son Goku\r\n\n[Blocker]\r\n\n[Permanent] If you have a blue \"Son Goku\" card without [Barrier] in play, your blue \"Piccolo\" cards can't be attacked.\r\n\n[Auto] When this card attacks, draw 1 card, then add up to 1 card from your life to your hand.\r\n\n[Auto] When your life becomes 6 or when your \"Piercing Special Beam Cannon\"'s [Auto] skill activates, draw 1 card, then flip this card over.\r\n\nSon Goku & Piccolo, Rag-Tag Alliance\r\n\n[Auto] When this card attacks, draw 1 card.\r\n\n[Auto] If you have a \"Piercing Special Beam Cannon\" in your Battle Area : At the start of your opponent's Main Phase, you may flip this card over. If you do, switch this card and up to 1 of your energy to Active Mode, this card gets +5000 power for the turn, then choose up to 1 of your blue \"Piccolo\" cards and it gains [Barrier] for the turn."}],"prices":[{"source":"Cardmarket","items":[{"label":"trend","value":0.05,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg","value":0.02,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"low","value":0.02,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg7","value":0.03,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg30","value":0.05,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"trend","variant":"foil","value":0.38,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg","variant":"foil","value":0.56,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":0.05,"currency":"EUR"}],"ref":{"value":0.04,"currency":"EUR"},"url":null},{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"foil","value":0.31,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":0.25,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"market","variant":"normal","value":0.15,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"normal","value":0.04,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":0.15,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/522411/dragon-ball-super-ccg-perfect-combination-son-goku-son-goku-and-piccolo-rag-tag-alliance"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/522411/dragon-ball-super-ccg-perfect-combination-son-goku-son-goku-and-piccolo-rag-tag-alliance"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Son%20Goku%20%2F%2F%20Son%20Goku%20%26%20Piccolo%2C%20Rag-Tag%20Alliance"}]},{"id":"523406","name":"Raditz // Raditz, the Invasion Begins","number":"BT23-038","subtitle":"Uncommon","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/523406_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/523406_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Perfect Combination"],["number","BT23-038"],["rarity","Uncommon"],["type","Leader"],["color","Blue"],["Special Trait","Saiyan"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","Saiyan Saga"],["Character","Raditz"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"Raditz\r\n\n[Auto] When this card attacks, draw 1 card.\r\n\n[Activate:Main] If you have 2 or more energy : Reduce the Z-Energy cost of \"Scouter\" in your Z-Deck by 1 for the turn, and negate this skill for the game.\r\n\n[Awaken] When your life is at 4 or less or you have a total of 3 or more blue \"Saiyan\" cards among all cards in your energy and Battle Area : Draw 2 cards and add cards from your life to your hand until you have 6 life left.\r\n\nRaditz, the Invasion Begins\r\n\n[Auto] When this card attacks, draw 1 card.\r\n\n[Auto] Remove 1 \"Scouter\" in your Battle Area from the game : When one of your blue \"Raditz\" cards is KO'd, play up to 1 blue \"Nappa\" card with 16000 power from your deck, then shuffle your deck.\r\n\n[Auto] At the end of your turn, choose up to 1 of your blue \"Raditz\" Battle Cards, switch it to Active Mode, and it gains [Blocker] until the end of your opponent's turn."}],"prices":[{"source":"Cardmarket","items":[{"label":"trend","value":0.04,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg","value":0.02,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"low","value":0.02,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg7","value":0.05,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg30","value":0.05,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"trend","variant":"foil","value":0.34,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg","variant":"foil","value":0.2,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":0.05,"currency":"EUR"}],"ref":{"value":0.05,"currency":"EUR"},"url":null},{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"normal","value":0.08,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"normal","value":0.01,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"market","variant":"foil","value":0.41,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":0.15,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":0.08,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/523406/dragon-ball-super-ccg-perfect-combination-raditz-raditz-the-invasion-begins"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/523406/dragon-ball-super-ccg-perfect-combination-raditz-raditz-the-invasion-begins"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Raditz%20%2F%2F%20Raditz%2C%20the%20Invasion%20Begins"}]},{"id":"522669","name":"Son Goku, Strategy of Sacrifice","number":"BT23-039","subtitle":"Rare","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/522669_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/522669_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Perfect Combination"],["number","BT23-039"],["rarity","Rare"],["type","Z-Battle"],["color","Blue"],["Energy(Color Cost)","1(B)"],["Z-Energy Cost","1"],["Special Trait","Saiyan"],["power","5000"],["Era","Saiyan Saga"],["Character","Son Goku"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Auto] [Limit 1] if you have a \"Piercing Special Beam Cannon\" in your Battle Area and you s