yan/Earthling"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","DBS:SUPER HERO Saga"],["Character","Son Gohan:SH"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"Son Gohan\r\n\n[Auto] When this card attacks, draw 1 card. \n\r\n[Awaken] If your life is at 4 or less or your opponent has a red \"Pan: SH\" card in play: Draw 2 cards, then add cards from your life to your hand until you have 6 life left.\r\n\n\nSon Gohan, Unfaltering Power\r\n\n [Auto][Once per turn] When your red \"Son Gohan : SH\" or \"Piccolo : SH\" card attacks, draw one card. \n\r\n[Auto] At the end of your turn, choose up to 1 of your red \"Piccolo : SH\" cards and switch it to Activate Mode. \n\r\n[Auto][Once per turn] When your \"Piccolo, Power Beyond Awakening\" activates [Blocker] skill or is removed from Battle Area by an opponent's skill, at the end of the turn, add cards from your life to your hand until you have 4 life left, and place up to 1 red \"Son Gohan : SH\" Z-Leader from your Z-Deck on top of this card."}],"prices":[{"source":"Cardmarket","items":[{"label":"trend","value":0.04,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg","value":0.05,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"low","value":0.02,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg7","value":0.04,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg30","value":0.04,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"trend","variant":"foil","value":0.9,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg","variant":"foil","value":0.19,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":0.2,"currency":"EUR"}],"ref":{"value":0.04,"currency":"EUR"},"url":null},{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"foil","value":0.28,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":0.2,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"market","variant":"normal","value":0.05,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"normal","value":0.05,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":0.05,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/509215/dragon-ball-super-ccg-critical-blow-son-gohan-son-gohan-unfaltering-power"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://w