ard from your Battle Area in your Drop. If you do, this card gets +5000 power for the turn."}],"prices":[{"source":"Cardmarket","items":[{"label":"trend","value":0.05,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg","value":0.09,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"low","value":0.02,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg7","value":0.05,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg30","value":0.04,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"trend","variant":"foil","value":0.09,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":0.15,"currency":"EUR"}],"ref":{"value":0.05,"currency":"EUR"},"url":null},{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"normal","value":0.18,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"normal","value":0.05,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"market","variant":"foil","value":3.35,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":3,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":0.18,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/508025/dragon-ball-super-ccg-critical-blow-broly-and-paragus-ss-broly-devil-of-destruction"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/508025/dragon-ball-super-ccg-critical-blow-broly-and-paragus-ss-broly-devil-of-destruction"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Broly%20%26%20Paragus%20%2F%2F%20SS%20Broly%2C%20Devil%20of%20Destruction"}]},{"id":"507818","name":"SS Broly, All-Transcending Devil","number":"BT22-056","subtitle":"Uncommon","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/507818_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/507818_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Critical Blow"],["number","BT22-056"],["rarity","Uncommon"],["type","Z-Leader"],["color","Green"],["Z-Energy Cost","2"],["Special Trait","Saiyan"],["power","20000"],["Era","Broly Saga"],["Character","Broly"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Z-Awaken] When your life is at 3 or less and you have a [Broly's Ring] and [Dormant Legend] in your Drop : Green \"Broly\" ca