tial Discipline\r\n\n[Permanent] During your opponent's turn, reduce the skill cost of \"Grandpa's Heirloom, the Four-Star Ball's\" [Activate:Main/Battle] in your hand by Y. \n\r\n[Permanent] You can use yellow originally skill-less Rest Mode Battle Cards in combos. \n\r\n[Auto] [Once per turn] When you play a yellow originally skill-less Battle Card, choose up to 1 of you opponent's Battle Cards or Unisons and negate its skills for the turn.\r\nAdditionally, if it's your turn, draw 1 card."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"foil","value":0.87,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":4.99,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"market","variant":"normal","value":0.25,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"normal","value":0.1,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":0.25,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/510032/dragon-ball-super-ccg-critical-blow-son-goku-son-goku-and-korin-martial-discipline"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/510032/dragon-ball-super-ccg-critical-blow-son-goku-son-goku-and-korin-martial-discipline"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Son%20Goku%20%2F%2F%20Son%20Goku%20%26%20Korin%2C%20Martial%20Discipline"}]},{"id":"510172","name":"Fortuneteller Baba // Fortuneteller Baba & Son Gohan, Battle Observation","number":"BT22-082","subtitle":"Uncommon","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/510172_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/510172_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Critical Blow"],["number","BT22-082"],["rarity","Uncommon"],["type","Leader"],["color","Yellow"],["Special Trait","Earthling//Earthling"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","Fortuneteller Baba Saga"],["Character","Fortuneteller Baba/Son Gohan"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"Fortuneteller Baba/strong>\r\n\n\r\n[Auto] When this card is placed in your Leader Area, activate up to 1 \"Fortuneteller Baba's Palace\" from your deck. \n\r\n[Activate:Main] Switch this card to Rest Mode: Draw 1 card, look at up to 2 cards from the top of your opponent's deck and place them on top of their deck in any order. \n\r\n[Awaken] If your life is at 5 or less or you have 4 cards under a \"Fortuneteller Baba's Palace\" in your Battle Area : Draw 2 cards. \r\n\n\nFortuneteller Baba & Son Gohan, Battle Observation\r\n\n[Permanent] Your yellow \"Son Gohan\" Z-Battle Cards gain [Double Strike]. \n [Auto] When this card attacks, draw 1 card. look at up to 3 cards from the top of your opponent's deck and place them on top of their deck in any order. \n\r\n[Activate:Main] Y, If you choose 4 Battle Cards under a \"Fortuneteller Baba's Palace\" in your Battle Area: Use all of the chosen cards in a combo."}],"prices":[{"source":"Cardmarket","items":[{"label":"trend","value":0.04,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg","value":0.04,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"low","value":0.02,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg7","value":0.05,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg30","value":0.04,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"trend","variant":"foil","value":0.11,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":0.05,"currency":"EUR"}],"ref":{"value":0.04,"currency":"EUR"},"url":null},{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"foil","value":0.43,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":0.25,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"market","variant":"normal","value":0.08,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"normal","value":0.05,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":0.08,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/510172/dragon-ball-super-ccg-critical-blow-fortuneteller-baba-fortuneteller-baba-and-son-gohan-battle-observation"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/510172/dragon-ball-super-ccg-critical-blow-fortuneteller-baba-fortuneteller-baba-and-son-gohan-battle-observation"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.