our deck, add up to 1 blue \"Janemba\" card to your hand, then shuffle your deck. \n\r\n[Auto] Once per turn If it's your opponent's turn : When one of your blue Z-Extras is placed in a Battle Area, draw 1 card and switch up to 1 of your mono-blue energy to Active Mode."}],"prices":[{"source":"Cardmarket","items":[{"label":"trend","variant":"foil","value":0.42,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg","variant":"foil","value":0.09,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":0.1,"currency":"EUR"}],"ref":{"value":0.58,"currency":"EUR"},"url":null},{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"foil","value":0.56,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":3,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":0.56,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/515371/dragon-ball-super-ccg-critical-blow-pre-release-cards-janemba-janemba-silent-demon"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/515371/dragon-ball-super-ccg-critical-blow-pre-release-cards-janemba-janemba-silent-demon"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Janemba%20%2F%2F%20Janemba%2C%20Silent%20Demon"}]},{"id":"515372","name":"SS Gogeta, Light Shining Through Hell","number":"BT22-033","subtitle":"Uncommon","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/515372_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/515372_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Critical Blow Pre-Release Cards"],["number","BT22-033"],["rarity","Uncommon"],["type","Z-Leader"],["color","Blue"],["Z-Energy Cost","2"],["Special Trait","Saiyan"],["power","20000"],["Era","Janemba Saga"],["Character","Gogeta"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Z-Awaken] U, when your life is at 3 or less : Blue card with both \"Son Goku\" and \"Vegeta\". \n\r\n[Auto] [Once per turn] When your Blue/Yellow multicolor \"Gogeta\" card is played by a [Union] skill, draw 1 card, choose up to 1 of your opponent's Battle Cards,\r\nignoring Barrier, and place it at the bottom of its owner's deck.\n\r\n[Auto] When this card attacks, draw 1 card. \n\r\n[Activate:Battle] [Once per turn] If it's your turn, you have a \"Gogeta\" or \"Veku\" card—both with the [Aegis] skill-in play, and you send 1 blue card and 1 yellow\r\ncard from your Drop to your Warp: Switch 2 of your energy to Active Mode, and you can only play yellow Battle Cards for the turn."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"foil","value":6.78,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":4.95,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":6.78,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/515372/dragon-ball-super-ccg-critical-blow-pre-release-cards-ss-gogeta-light-shining-through-hell"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/515372/dragon-ball-super-ccg-critical-blow-pre-release-cards-ss-gogeta-light-shining-through-hell"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=SS%20Gogeta%2C%20Light%20Shining%20Through%20Hell"}]},{"id":"515401","name":"Janemba, Pure Evil","number":"BT22-034","subtitle":"Rare","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/515401_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/515401_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Critical Blow Pre-Release Cards"],["number","BT22-034"],["rarity","Rare"],["type","Z-Battle"],["color","Blue"],["Energy(Color Cost)","2(UU)"],["Z-Energy Cost","2"],["Special Trait","Evil Incarnate"],["power","15000"],["Era","Janemba Saga"],["Character","Janemba"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Unique] \n\r\n[Permanent] If your Leader is blue and you have a blue Z-Extra in your Battle Area, reduce the energy cost of this card in your Z-Deck by U, and reduce the Z-Energy cost by 1. \n\r\n[Auto] When this card is played, choose up to 1 of your opponent's Battle Cards with an energy cost of 3 or less and place it at the bott