dy":"Son Goten\r\n\n\r\n[Activate:Main] [Once per turn] Look at up to 5 cards from the top of your deck and add up to 1 green \"Son Gohan : Adolescence\" or \"Son Goten\" card to your hand, then shuffle your deck.\r\n\n\r\n[Awaken] When your life is at 4 or less or you have 2 or more energy and you have a [Family Kamehameha, Emotions Delivered] in your Battle Area : Draw 2 cards and add cards from your life to your hand until you have 6 life left.\r\n\n//\n\r\nSS Son Gohan & SS Son Goten, Brothers\r\n\n\r\n[Auto] [Once per turn] When you play a \"Son Gohan : Adolescence\" or \"Son Goten\" card—both green and with an energy cost of 6 or more—from your hand, draw 1 card.\r\n\n\r\n[Activate:Main] [Once per turn] Play up to 1 [Son Gohan, Close Call] or [Son Goten, Close Call] from your hand or Drop in Rest Mode.\r\n\n\r\n[Activate:Battle] [Once per turn] If you discard 1 card from your hand : During that turn, the next time you activate [Activate: Battle] on a \"Son Gohan : Adolescence\" or \"Son Goten\" card—both green and with an energy cost of 6—from your hand, reduce that skill's skill cost by G."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"foil","value":7.59,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":4.99,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":7.59,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/515378/dragon-ball-super-ccg-critical-blow-pre-release-cards-son-goten-ss-son-gohan-and-ss-son-goten-brothers"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/515378/dragon-ball-super-ccg-critical-blow-pre-release-cards-son-goten-ss-son-gohan-and-ss-son-goten-brothers"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Son%20Goten%20%2F%2F%20SS%20Son%20Gohan%20%26%20SS%20Son%20Goten%2C%20Brothers"}]},{"id":"515379","name":"Broly & Paragus // SS Broly, Devil of Destruction","number":"BT22-055","subtitle":"Uncommon","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/515379_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/515379_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Critical Blow Pre-Release Cards"],["number","BT22-055"],["rarity","Uncommon"],["type","Leader"],["color","Green"],["Special Trait","Saiyan"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","Broly Saga"],["Character","Broly/Paragus"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"Broly & Paragus\r\n\n\r\n[Activate:Main] Add up to 1 \"Broly\" or \"Paragus\" card—both green and with an energy cost of 1—from your deck to your hand, shuffle your deck, and negate this skill for the game.\r\n\n\r\n[Activate:Main] If you have 2 or more energy and you have a skill-less \"Broly\" card in play : Draw 2 cards, add cards from your life to your hand until you have 6 life left, and flip this card over.\r\n\n\r\n[Awaken] When your life is at 4 or less : Draw 1 card and switch up to 1 of your energy to Active Mode.\r\n\n//\n\r\nSS Broly, Devil of Destruction\r\n\n\r\n[Permanent] Your Red/Green multicolor \"Broly\" cards in all areas get -1 combo cost and -5000 combo power.\r\n\n\r\n[Permanent] During a battle in which your \"Broly\" card is attacking a Battle Card, your opponent can't activate [Counter] skills.\r\n\n\r\n[Auto] When this card attacks, draw 1 card. Additionally, you may place 1 green card from your Battle Area in your Drop. If you do, this card gets +5000 power for the turn."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"foil","value":29.39,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":55.99,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":29.39,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/515379/dragon-ball-super-ccg-critical-blow-pre-release-cards-broly-and-paragus-ss-broly-devil-of-destruction"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/515379/dragon-ball-super-ccg-critical-blow-pre-release-cards-broly-and-paragus-ss-broly-devil-of-destruction"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmar