 [Limit 1] If you have 4 or more energy, your \"Broly\" is in a battle in which it's attacking a Battle Card, and you remove this card from the game : Your card that's in a battle gets +30000 power for the turn. Additionally, if an opponent's Battle Card is KO'd by that battle, you may place 1 of your Z-Energy in your Drop at the end of the battle. If you do, your opponent discards 2 cards from their hand."}],"prices":[{"source":"Cardmarket","items":[{"label":"trend","variant":"foil","value":0.29,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg","variant":"foil","value":0.3,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":0.05,"currency":"EUR"}],"ref":{"value":0.3,"currency":"EUR"},"url":null},{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"foil","value":1.25,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":0.99,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":1.25,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/515382/dragon-ball-super-ccg-critical-blow-pre-release-cards-gigantic-meteor-of-destruction"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/515382/dragon-ball-super-ccg-critical-blow-pre-release-cards-gigantic-meteor-of-destruction"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Gigantic%20Meteor%20of%20Destruction"}]},{"id":"515408","name":"SS Son Gohan, Released Power","number":"BT22-063","subtitle":"Rare","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/515408_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/515408_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Critical Blow Pre-Release Cards"],["number","BT22-063"],["rarity","Rare"],["type","Battle"],["color","Green"],["Energy(Color Cost)","6(GGGGGG)"],["Special Trait","Saiyan/Earthling"],["power","20000"],["Combo Power","5000"],["Combo Energy","0"],["Era","Broly Saga"],["Character","Son Gohan : Adolescence"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Auto] When this card is played, choose up to 1 of your opponent's Unisons and remove 2 markers from it. \n\r\n[Auto] If you place 2 cards from under this card in your Drop : When this card attacks, your opponent discards 1 card from their hand. \n\r\n[Activate:Battle][Limit1] G, if your green \"Son Gohan : Adolescence\" Card with an energy cost of 4 is attacking : Play this card from your hand ontop of the attacking card, and this card gains [Critical] for the battle."}],"prices":[{"source":"Cardmarket","items":[{"label":"trend","variant":"foil","value":0.29,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg","variant":"foil","value":0.18,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":0.1,"currency":"EUR"}],"ref":{"value":0.28,"currency":"EUR"},"url":null},{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"foil","value":0.88,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":2.85,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":0.88,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/515408/dragon-ball-super-ccg-critical-blow-pre-release-cards-ss-son-gohan-released-power"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/515408/dragon-ball-super-ccg-critical-blow-pre-release-cards-ss-son-gohan-released-power"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=SS%20Son%20Gohan%2C%20Released%20Power"}]},{"id":"515409","name":"SS Son Goten, Released Power","number":"BT22-068","subtitle":"Rare","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/515409_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/515409_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Critical Blow Pre-Release Cards"],["number","BT22-068"],["rarity","Rare"],["type","Battle"],["color","Green"],["Energy(Color Cost)","6(GGGGGG)"],["Special Trait","Saiyan/Earthling"],["power","20,000"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Activate:Battle] [Limit 1] G, if your green \"Son Goten\" card with an energy cost of 4 is attacking : Play this card from your hand on top of the attacking card, and this card gains [Double Strike] for the battle. \n\r\n[Activate:Battle] Place 2 cards from under this card in your Drop : Choose up to 1 of your cards and it gets +5000 power for the turn."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"foil","value":0.55,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":0.18,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":0.55,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/515409/dragon-ball-super-ccg-critical-blow-pre-release-cards-ss-son-goten-released-power"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/515409/dragon-ball-super-ccg-critical-blow-pre-release-cards-ss-son-goten-released-power"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=SS%20Son%20Goten%2C%20Released%20Power"}]},{"id":"515383","name":"Trunks, Provocation","number":"BT22-071","subtitle":"Uncommon","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/515383_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/515383_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Critical Blow Pre-Release Cards"],["number","BT22-071"],["rarity","Uncommon"],["type","Battle"],["color","Green"],["Energy(Color Cost)","2(GG)"],["Special Trait","Saiyan/Earthling"],["power","15000"],["Combo Power","10000"],["Combo Energy","0"],["Era","Broly Saga"],["Character","Trunks : Youth"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Super Combo] \n\r\n[Auto] If your Leader is green and your life is at 4 or less : When this card is used in a combo, draw one card."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"foil","value":3.29,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":0.5,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":3.29,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/515383/dragon-ball-super-ccg-critical-blow-pre-release-cards-trunks-provocation"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/515383/dragon-ball-s