Martial Discipline","number":"BT22-081","subtitle":"Uncommon","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/515384_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/515384_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Critical Blow Pre-Release Cards"],["number","BT22-081"],["rarity","Uncommon"],["type","Leader"],["color","Yellow"],["Special Trait","Saiyan/Earthling"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","Young Son Goku Saga"],["Character","Son Goku : Childhood/Korin"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"Son Goku\r\n\n[Activate:Main][Once per turn] Look at up to 5 cards from the top of your deck, add up to 1 \"Son Goku : Childhood\" or \"Earthling\" card— both yellow and with an energy cost of 4 or less— to your hand, then shuffle your deck.\n\r\n[Awaken] If your life is at 6 or less and you have a yellow skill-less Battle Card in your Drop : Draw 2 cards, and your originally skill-less Battle Cards can't gain skills for the game.\r\n\n\nSon Goku & Korin, Martial Discipline\r\n\n[Permanent] During your opponent's turn, reduce the skill cost of \"Grandpa's Heirloom, the Four-Star Ball's\" [Activate:Main/Battle] in your hand by Y. \n\r\n[Permanent] You can use yellow originally skill-less Rest Mode Battle Cards in combos. \n\r\n[Auto] [Once per turn] When you play a yellow originally skill-less Battle Card, choose up to 1 of you opponent's Battle Cards or Unisons and negate its skills for the turn.\r\nAdditionally, if it's your turn, draw 1 card."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"foil","value":5.79,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":7.49,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":5.79,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/515384/dragon-ball-super-ccg-critical-blow-pre-release-cards-son-goku-son-goku-and-korin-martial-discipline"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/515384/dragon-ball-super-ccg-critical-blow-pre-release-cards-son-goku-son-goku-and-korin-martial-discipline"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Son%20Goku%20%2F%2F%20Son%20Goku%20%26%20Korin%2C%20Martial%20Discipline"}]},{"id":"515386","name":"Fortuneteller Baba // Fortuneteller Baba & Son Gohan, Battle Observation","number":"BT22-082","subtitle":"Uncommon","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/515386_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/515386_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Critical Blow Pre-Release Cards"],["number","BT22-082"],["rarity","Uncommon"],["type","Leader"],["color","Yellow"],["Special Trait","Earthling//Earthling"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","Fortuneteller Baba Saga"],["Character","Fortuneteller Baba/Son Gohan"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"Fortuneteller Baba/strong>\r\n\n\r\n[Auto] When this card is placed in your Leader Area, activate up to 1 \"Fortuneteller Baba's Palace\" from your deck. \n\r\n[Activate:Main] Switch this card to Rest Mode: Draw 1 card, look at up to 2 cards from the top of your opponent's deck and place them on top of their deck in any order. \n\r\n[Awaken] If your life is at 5 or less or you have 4 cards under a \"Fortuneteller Baba's Palace\" in your Battle Area : Draw 2 cards. \r\n\n\nFortuneteller Baba & Son Gohan, Battle Observation\r\n\n[Permanent] Your yellow \"Son Gohan\" Z-Battle Cards gain [Double Strike]. \n [Auto] When this card attacks, draw 1 card. look at up to 3 cards from the top of your opponent's deck and place them on top of their deck in any order. \n\r\n[Activate:Main] Y, If you choose 4 Battle Cards under a \"Fortuneteller Baba's Palace\" in your Battle Area: Use all of the chosen cards in a combo."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"foil","value":3.58,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":1.32,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":3.58,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/515386/dragon-ball-super-ccg-critical-blow-pre-release-cards-fortuneteller-baba-fortuneteller-baba-and-son-gohan-battle-observation"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/515386/dragon-ball-super-ccg-critical-blow-pre-release-cards-fortuneteller-baba-fortuneteller-baba-and-son-gohan-battle-observation"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Fortuneteller%20Baba%20%2F%2F%20Fortuneteller%20Baba%20%26%20Son%20Gohan%2C%20Battle%20Observation"}]},{"id":"515411","name":"Son Gohan, Unpredicted Blow","number":"BT22-083","subtitle":"Rare","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/515411_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/515411_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Critical Blow Pre-Release Cards"],["number","BT22-083"],["rarity","Rare"],["type","Z-Battle"],["color","Yellow"],["Energy(Color Cost)","3(YYY)"],["Z-Energy Cost","2"],["Special Trait","Earthling"],["power","25000"],["Era","Fortuneteller Baba Saga"],["Character","Son Gohan"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Deflect][Barrier][Dual Attack] \n\r\n[Permanent] If you have a yellow non-\"Great Ape\" \"Son Goku : Childhood\" card with an energy cost of 5 or more in play, reduce the energy cost of this card in your Z-Deck by Y. \n\r\n[Auto] When this card is played, choose up to 1 of your yellow non-\"Great Ape\" \"Son Goku : Childhood\" Battle Cards, and it gains [Dual Attack] for the turn. \n\r\n[Auto] At the end of your turn, remove this card from the game."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"foil","value":0.52,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":0.18,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":0.52,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/515411/dragon-ball-super-ccg-critical-blow-pre-release-cards-son-gohan-unpredicted-blow"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/515411/dragon-ball-super-ccg-criti