w.jpg","details":[["set","Wild Resurgence"],["number","BT21-033"],["rarity","Common"],["type","Extra"],["color","Red"],["Energy(Color Cost)","1(R)"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Permanent] This card gains \"Desire\" in all areas.\r\n\n[Activate:Main] If your Leader is red : Draw 1 card, choose up to 1 red \"Garlic Jr.\" from your Battle Area, and that card gains [Indestructible] until the end of your opponent's turn. Additionally, if this skill was activated by one of your red \"Shenron\"'s skills, draw 1 card."}],"prices":[{"source":"Cardmarket","items":[{"label":"trend","value":0.03,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg","value":0.02,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"low","value":0.02,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg7","value":0.03,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg30","value":0.03,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"trend","variant":"foil","value":0.12,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg","variant":"foil","value":0.08,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":0.02,"currency":"EUR"}],"ref":{"value":0.03,"currency":"EUR"},"url":null},{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"normal","value":0.07,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"normal","value":0.03,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"market","variant":"foil","value":0.3,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":0.09,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":0.07,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/494128/dragon-ball-super-ccg-wild-resurgence-garlic-jrs-ambition"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/494128/dragon-ball-super-ccg-wild-resurgence-garlic-jrs-ambition"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Garlic%20Jr.'s%20Ambition"}]},{"id":"496116","name":"Uub // Uub & Mr. Buu, Resonating Spirits","number":"BT21-034","subtitle":"Uncommon","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/496116_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/496116_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Wild Resurgence"],["number","BT21-034"],["rarity","Uncommon"],["type","Leader"],["color","Blue"],["Special Trait","Earthling/Majin"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","Baby Saga"],["Character","Uub/Mr. Buu"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"Uub\r\n\n[Auto] When this card attacks, draw 1 card.\r\n\n[Awaken] When your life is at 4 or less or there is a blue \"Mr. Buu\" Z-Battle Card with an energy cost of 2 in play : Draw 1 card, switch up to 1 of your energy to Active Mode, and add cards from your life to your hand until you have 6 life left.\r\n\n\nUub & Mr. Buu, Resonating Spirits\r\n\n[Auto] When this card attacks, draw 1 card. Additionally, if this card attacks your opponent's Leader and there are no cards in your opponent's Combo Area at the beginning of that battle's Damage Step, draw 1 card. \r\n\n[Activate:Main] [Once per turn] Add up to 1 Battle Card in your opponent's Drop to their Z-Energy."}],"prices":[{"source":"Cardmarket","items":[{"label":"trend","value":0.06,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg","value":0.1,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"low","value":0.02,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg7","value":0.06,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg30","value":0.04,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"trend","variant":"foil","value":0.3,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg","variant":"foil","value":0.06,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":0.1,"currency":"EUR"}],"ref":{"value":0.06,"currency":"EUR"},"url":null},{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"foil","value":0.41,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":0.1,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"market","variant":"normal","value":0.17,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"normal","value":0.05,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":0.17,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/496116/dragon-ball-super-ccg-wild-resurgence-uub-uub-and-mr-buu-resonating-spirits"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product