 your turn : When you play a blue \"Baby\" with an energy cost of 4 or more, play up to 1 Battle Card with an energy cost of 3 or less and an original power of 10000 or less from under this card with its non-keyword skills negated for the turn.\r\n\n[Activate:Main] [Once per turn] Place 1 mono-blue \"Vegeta: GT\" with an energy cost of 1 or 1 mono-blue \"Brainwashed\" from your hand under this card : Draw 1 card."}],"prices":[{"source":"Cardmarket","items":[{"label":"trend","value":0.03,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg","value":0.03,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"low","value":0.02,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg7","value":0.03,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg30","value":0.03,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"trend","variant":"foil","value":0.23,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":0.02,"currency":"EUR"}],"ref":{"value":0.03,"currency":"EUR"},"url":null},{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"normal","value":0.1,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"normal","value":0.03,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"market","variant":"foil","value":0.14,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":0.05,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":0.1,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/495566/dragon-ball-super-ccg-wild-resurgence-universal-tuffleization-plan"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/495566/dragon-ball-super-ccg-wild-resurgence-universal-tuffleization-plan"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Universal%20Tuffleization%20Plan"}]},{"id":"496985","name":"Son Gohan // SS Son Gohan, The Results of Fatherly Training","number":"BT21-067","subtitle":"Uncommon","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/496985_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/496985_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Wild Resurgence"],["number","BT21-067"],["rarity","Uncommon"],["type","Leader"],["color","Green"],["Special Trait","Saiyan/Earthling"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","Android Cell Saga"],["Character","Son Gohan: Childhood"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"Son Gohan\r\n\n[Auto] When this card is placed in your Leader Area, activate up to 1 \"Hyperbolic Time Chamber\" from your deck.\r\n\n[Auto] When this card attacks, look at up to 5 cards from the top of your deck, add up to 1 green \"Saiyan\" to your hand, then shuffle your deck.\r\n\n[Awaken] When your life is at 4 or less or if you have a \"SS Son Goku, Showing the Results of Training\" in play : Draw 1 card, switch up to 1 of your energy to Active Mode, then add cards from your life to your hand until you have 6 life left.\r\n\n\nSS Son Gohan, The Results of Fatherly Training\r\n\n[Auto] [Once per turn] Place 1 card from your hand at the bottom of your deck : When you use a card in a combo, draw 2 cards.\r\n\n[Auto] [Once per turn] When one of your mono-green \"Son Gohan: Childhood\" Battle Cards attacks, use up to 1 mono-green card with 5000 combo power from your Drop in a combo with its skills negated for the turn."}],"prices":[{"source":"Cardmarket","items":[{"label":"trend","value":0.06,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg","value":0.07,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"low","value":0.02,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg7","value":0.05,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg30","value":0.05,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"trend","variant":"foil","value":0.98,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg","variant":"foil","value":0.09,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":0.1,"currency":"EUR"}],"ref":{"value":0.06,"currency":"EUR"},"url":null},{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"foil","value":0.28,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":0.25,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"market","variant":"normal","value":0.1,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"normal","value":0.1,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":0.1,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/496985/dragon-ball-super-ccg-wild-resurgence-son-gohan-ss-son-gohan-the-results-of-fatherly-training"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/496985/dragon-ball-super-ccg-wild-resurgence-son-gohan-ss-son-gohan-the-results-of-fatherly-training"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Son%20Gohan%20%2F%2F%20SS%20Son%20Gohan%2C%20The%20Results%20of%20Fatherly%20Training"}]},{"id":"496712","name":"Cell // Cell, The Greatest Threat to Mankind","number":"BT21-068","subtitle":"Uncommon","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/496712_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/496712_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Wild Resurgence"],["number","BT21-068"],["rarity","Uncommon"],["type","Leader"],["color","Green"],["Special Trait","Android"],["power","5000/10000"],["Era","Android Cell Saga"],["Character","Cell"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"Cell\r\n\n[Permanent] All Battle Cards in your deck must be green \"Android\".\r\n\n[Auto] When this card is placed in your Leader Area, place up to 1 \"Gingertown\" from your deck in your opponent's Battle Area.\r\n\n[Activate:Main] Switch this card to Rest Mode and place 1 green \"Android\" from your hand at the bottom of your deck : Draw 2 cards.\r\n\n[Awaken] When your life is at 5 or less or there is a green \"Cell\" with an energy cost of 3 in play : Play up to 1 \"Android 17\" and 1 \"Android 18\"—both green and with an energy cost of 2—from your deck to your opponent's Battle Area, shuffle your deck, then add cards from your life to your hand until you have 5 life left.\r\n\n\nCell, The Greatest Threat to Mankind\r\n\n[Permanent] Unless there are 1 or more cards of both \"Android 17\" and \"Android 18\"—both green and with an energy cost of 2—under this card, you can't activate [Z-Awaken].\r\n\n[Auto] [Once per turn] When you use one of your opponent's Battle Cards in a combo, this card gets +5000 power until the end of your opponent's turn.\r\n\n[Auto] When this card attacks, draw 1 card, choose up to 1 Battle Card with an energy cost of 3 or less from your Drop or your opponent's Battle Area and place it under this card."}],"prices":[{"source":"Cardmarket","items":[{"label":"trend","value":0.06,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg","value":0.05,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"low","value":0.02,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg7","value":0.06,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg30","value":0.04,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"trend","variant":"foil","value":0.82,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg","variant":"foil","value":0.26,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":0.02,"currency":"EUR"}],"ref":{"value":0.06,"currency":"EUR"},"url":null},{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"foil","value":0.25,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":0.2,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"market","variant":"normal","value":0.11,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"normal","value":0.07,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":0.11,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/496712/dragon-ball-super-ccg-wild-resurgence-cell-cell-the-greatest-threat-to-mankind"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/496712/dragon-ball-super-ccg-wild-resurgence-cell-cell-the-greatest-threat-to-mankind"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Cell%20%2F%2F%20Cell%2C%20The%20Greatest%20Threat%20to%20Mankind"}]},{"id":"496986","name":"SS2 Son Gohan, Trigger to Fierce Rage","number":"BT21-069","subtitle":"Uncommon","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/496986_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/496986_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Wild Resurgence"],["number","BT21-069"],["rarity","Uncommon"],["type","Z-Leader"],["color","Green"],["Z-Energy Cost","3"],["Special Trait","Saiyan/Earthling"],["power","20000"],["Era"