Character","Son Goku // Vegeta"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"SSB Son Goku\r\n\n[Auto] When this card attacks, draw 1 card, and this card gets +5000 power for the battle.\r\n\n[Auto] After using this card in a battle, flip this card to its back side.\r\n\n[Auto] At the end of you and your opponent's turns, choose up to 1 of your opponent's Battle Cards with an energy cost of 4 or less in Rest Mode and KO it.\r\n\n[Activate:Battle] [Limit 1] If it's your turn : Choose up to 1 yellow \"Vegeta\" with an energy cost of 2, and that card gets +5000 power for the battle.\r\n\n\nSSB Vegeta, God-Level Power\r\n\n[Auto] [Limit 1] After using this card in a battle, draw 1 card, then flip this card to its front side.\r\n\n[Activate:Main] [Limit 1] Flip this card to its front side. \r\n\n[Activate:Battle] [Limit 1] If it's your turn : Choose up to 1 yellow \"Son Goku\" with an energy cost of 2, and that card gets +5000 power for the battle."}],"prices":[{"source":"Cardmarket","items":[{"label":"trend","value":0.06,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg","value":0.07,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"low","value":0.02,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg7","value":0.07,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg30","value":0.06,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"trend","variant":"foil","value":4.7,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg","variant":"foil","value":7.83,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":9.9,"currency":"EUR"}],"ref":{"value":0.07,"currency":"EUR"},"url":null},{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"normal","value":0.25,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"normal","value":0.1,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"market","variant":"foil","value":7.38,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":5.39,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":0.25,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/494149/dragon-ball-super-ccg-wild-resurgence-ssb-son-goku-ssb-vegeta-god-level-power"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/produ