s in you and your opponent's Warps is 7 or more, reduce the energy cost of this card in your hand by 7.\r\n\n[Auto] Place 1 card from under this card into your Drop : When this card or your opponent attacks, choose up to 1 of your opponent's Battle Cards and send it to its owner's Warp."}],"prices":[{"source":"Cardmarket","items":[{"label":"trend","variant":"foil","value":16.01,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":15,"currency":"EUR"}],"ref":{"value":18.08,"currency":"EUR"},"url":null},{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"foil","value":18.88,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":17.5,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":18.88,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/497840/dragon-ball-super-ccg-wild-resurgence-dark-king-mechikabura-last-judgement"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/497840/dragon-ball-super-ccg-wild-resurgence-dark-king-mechikabura-last-judgement"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Dark%20King%20Mechikabura%2C%20Last%20Judgement"}]}],"DBS-B21PRE":[{"id":"499494","name":"Son Goku // Son Goku, for the Sake of Family","number":"BT21-001","subtitle":"Uncommon","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/499494_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/499494_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Wild Resurgence Pre-Release Cards"],["number","BT21-001"],["rarity","Uncommon"],["type","Leader"],["color","Red"],["Special Trait","Saiyan"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","Garlic Jr. Saga"],["Character","Son Goku"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"Son Goku\r\n\n[Auto] When this card attacks, draw 1 card.\r\n\n[Awaken] When your life is at 4 or less, or you have 2 or more energy and there is a \"Son Gohan, Awakened Hidden Power\" under your opponent's Leader : Add up to 1 \"Power Pole\" from your deck to your hand, shuffle your deck, draw 1 card, and add cards from your life to your hand until you have 6 life left.\r\n\n\nSon Goku, for the Sake of Family\r\n\n[Permanent] Reduce the energy cost of a \"Power Pole\" by R.\r\n\n[Permanent] If you have a red \"Son Goku\" or \"Piccolo\" Z-Battle Card in play, your \"Son Goku\" cards with \"Power Pole\" under them gain [Critical].\r\n\n[Auto] When this card attacks, draw 1 card."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"normal","value":7.16,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"normal","value":6.06,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":7.16,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/499494/dragon-ball-super-ccg-wild-resurgence-pre-release-cards-son-goku-son-goku-for-the-sake-of-family"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/499494/dragon-ball-super-ccg-wild-resurgence-pre-release-cards-son-goku-son-goku-for-the-sake-of-family"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Son%20Goku%20%2F%2F%20Son%20Goku%2C%20for%20the%20Sake%20of%20Family"}]},{"id":"499495","name":"Garlic Jr. // Garlic Jr., Immortal Being","number":"BT21-002","subtitle":"Uncommon","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/499495_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/499495_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Wild Resurgence Pre-Release Cards"],["number","BT21-002"],["rarity","Uncommon"],["type","Leader"],["color","Red"],["Special Trait","Demon Clan/Shenron"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","Garlic Jr. Saga"],["Character","Garlic Jr."]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"Garlic Jr.\r\n\n[Activate:Main] Switch this card to Rest Mode : Play up to 1 red \"Ginger\", \"Sansyo\" or \"Nikky\" with an energy cost of 1 from your deck, then shuffle your deck.\r\n\n[Wish] When there are 7 [Dragon Ball] cards in your Drop : Add up to 1 \"Garlic Jr.'s Ambition\" from your deck to your hand, then shuffle your deck.\r\n\n\nGarlic Jr., Immortal Being\r\n\n[Activate:Main] [Once per turn] Choose one—\r\n\nPlay up to 1 red \"Ginger\", \"Sansyo\", or \"Nikky\" with an energy cost of 4 from your deck with its skills negated for the turn, then shuffle your deck. \r\n\n• Activate the [Activate:Main] skill of up to 1 red or black \"Desire\" from your hand with an energy cost less than or equal to your current energy.\r\n\n[Activate:Battle] R, if your life is at 2 or less and you remove 7 [Dragon Ball] cards in your Drop from the game : You don't take damage for the turn, then flip this card over at the end of the turn."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"normal","value":0.47,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"normal","value":0.39,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":0.47,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/499495/dragon-ball-super-ccg-wild-resurgence-pre-release-cards-garlic-jr-garlic-jr-immortal-being"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/499495/dragon-ball-super-ccg-wild-resurgence-pre-release-cards-garlic-jr-garlic-jr-immortal-being"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Garlic%20Jr.%20%2F%2F%20Garlic%20Jr.%2C%20Immortal%20Being"}]},{"id":"499496","name":"Son Goku, Full Power and Full Blast","number":"BT21-003","subtitle":"Uncommon","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/499496_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/499496_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Wild Resurgence Pre-Release Cards"],["number","BT21-003"],["rarity","Uncommon"],["type","Z-Battle"],["color","Red"],["Energy(Color Cost)","3(RRR)"],["Z-Energy Cost","2"],["Special Trait","Saiyan"],["power","20000"],["Era","Garlic Jr. Saga"],["Character","Son Goku"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Auto] When this card is played, this card gains [Barrier] for the turn.\r\n\n[Auto] [Once per turn] If there is a \"Son Gohan, Awakened Hidd