":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/499521/dragon-ball-super-ccg-wild-resurgence-pre-release-cards-uub-uub-and-mr-buu-resonating-spirits"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Uub%20%2F%2F%20Uub%20%26%20Mr.%20Buu%2C%20Resonating%20Spirits"}]},{"id":"499522","name":"Baby // Baby, Awakening With a Grudge","number":"BT21-035","subtitle":"Uncommon","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/499522_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/499522_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Wild Resurgence Pre-Release Cards"],["number","BT21-035"],["rarity","Uncommon"],["type","Leader"],["color","Blue"],["Special Trait","Machine Mutant/Saiyan"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","Baby Saga"],["Character","Baby/Vegeta: GT"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"Baby\r\n\n[Auto] When you place this card in your Leader Area, activate up to 1 \"Universal Tuffleization Plan\" from your deck.\r\n\n[Auto] Place 1 mono-blue \"Vegeta : GT\" with an energy cost of 1 or 1 mono-blue \"Brainwashed\" from your hand under a \"Universal Tuffleization Plan\" in your Battle Area : When this card attacks, draw 2 cards.\r\n\n[Awaken] When your life is at 4 or less or there are 4 or more cards under a \"Universal Tuffleization Plan\" in your Battle Area : Draw 1 card, switch up to 1 of your energy to Active Mode, then add cards from your life to your hand until you have 6 life left.\r\n\n\nBaby, Awakening With a Grudge\r\n\n[Overlord] [Once per turn]\r\n\n[Auto] When this card attacks, choose one—\r\n\n• Look at up to 5 cards from the top of your deck, place up to 1 blue \"Brainwashed\" card under a \"Universal Tuffleization Plan\" in your Battle Area, then shuffle your deck.\r\n\n• Place up to 1 of your opponent's Battle Cards that does not include \"Son Goku: GT\" from their Drop under a \"Universal Tuffleization Plan\" in your Battle Area.\r\n\n[Activate:Main] [Once per turn] Add up to 1 card from your life to your hand, choose up to 1 of your blue \"Brainwashed\" cards, and that card gets +5000 power for the turn."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"normal","value":0.71,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"normal","value":0.5,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":0.71,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/499522/dragon-ball-super-ccg-wild-resurgence-pre-release-cards-baby-baby-awakening-with-a-grudge"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/499522/dragon-ball-super-ccg-wild-resurgence-pre-release-cards-baby-baby-awakening-with-a-grudge"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Baby%20%2F%2F%20Baby%2C%20Awakening%20With%20a%20Grudge"}]},{"id":"499524","name":"Uub, Fusion of Two Spirits","number":"BT21-036","subtitle":"Uncommon","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/499524_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/499524_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Wild Resurgence Pre-Release Cards"],["number","BT21-036"],["rarity","Uncommon"],["type","Z-Leader"],["color","Blue"],["Z-Energy Cost","3"],["Special Trait","Earthling"],["power","20000"],["Era","Baby Saga"],["Character","Uub"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Z-Awaken] B, you have 3 or less life and you place 1 blue \"Mr. Buu\" from your Drop under this card : Blue \"Uub\".\r\n\n[Auto] [Once per turn] When this card attacks, draw 1 card, choose up to 1 of your opponent's Battle Cards and add it to its owner's Z-Energy.\r\n\n[Activate:Main] [Once per turn] If your opponent has 5 or more Z-Energy : Choose up to 1 of your blue \"Uub\" Battle Cards with a blue \"Mr. Buu\" under it and switch it to Active Mode.\r\n\n[Activate:Battle] [Once per turn] If your opponent has 10 or more Z-Energy : This card gets +10000 power and [Double Strike] for the battle."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","va