re energy : When you activate [Swap] on one of your yellow \"Frieza\" cards, you may flip this card to its back side. If you do, draw 2 cards, then add cards from your life to your hand until you have 6 life left.\r\n\n[Activate:Main] [Once per turn] Look at up to 5 cards from the top of your deck, add up to 1 \"The Return of the Army of Terror\" or yellow \"Frieza>\" to your hand, then shuffle your deck.\r\n\n[Awaken] When your life is at 4 or less : Draw 1 card, then switch up to 1 of your energy to Active Mode.\r\n\n\nFrieza, The Emperor Who Swore Revenge\r\n\n[Permanent] Reduce the skill cost of [Swap] on your yellow \"Frieza\" cards by Y.\r\n\n[Auto] [Once per turn] When you activate [Swap], draw 1 card.\r\n\n[Auto] [Once per turn] When one of your yellow \"Frieza\" cards with [Swap] and an energy cost of 3 or more attacks, look at up to 3 cards from the top of your deck, use up to 1 yellow \"Frieza's Army\" in a combo with its skills negated for the turn, then place the remaining cards at the bottom of your deck in any order."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"normal","value":3.99,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"normal","value":0.47,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":3.99,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/499549/dragon-ball-super-ccg-wild-resurgence-pre-release-cards-frieza-frieza-the-emperor-who-swore-revenge"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/499549/dragon-ball-super-ccg-wild-resurgence-pre-release-cards-frieza-frieza-the-emperor-who-swore-revenge"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Frieza%20%2F%2F%20Frieza%2C%20The%20Emperor%20Who%20Swore%20Revenge"}]},{"id":"499483","name":"Golden Frieza, Shining Emperor","number":"BT21-102","subtitle":"Rare","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/499483_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/49948