tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/488838_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/488838_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Power Absorbed"],["number","BT20-023"],["rarity","Uncommon"],["type","Leader"],["color","Blue"],["Special Trait","Android"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","Special"],["Character","Android 18"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"Android 18\r\n\n[Auto] When this card attacks, draw 1 card, and place up to 1 blue card from your Drop under this card.\r\n\n[Awaken] When your life is at 4 or less or there are 3 or more cards under this card : Draw 1 card, switch up to 1 of your energy to Active Mode, and add cards from your life to your hand until you have 6 life left.\r\n\n\n\r\nAndroid 18, Impenetrable Rushdown\r\n\n[Auto] When this card attacks, draw 1 card, and place up to 1 blue card from your Drop under this card.\r\n\n[Auto] [Once per turn] When you add a card from your life to your hand, place up to 1 blue card from your Drop under this card.\r\n\n[Activate:Battle] [Once per turn] Add 1 card from your life to your hand : This card gets +5000 power for the battle."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":14,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":null,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/488838/dragon-ball-super-ccg-power-absorbed-android-18-android-18-impenetrable-rushdown-collector-booster-exclusive"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/488838/dragon-ball-super-ccg-power-absorbed-android-18-android-18-impenetrable-rushdown-collector-booster-exclusive"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Android%2018%20%2F%2F%20Android%2018%2C%20Impenetrable%20Rushdown%20(Collector%20Booster%20Exclusive)"}]},{"id":"482563","name":"Android 21 // Android 21, the Nature of Evil","number":"BT20-024","subtitle":"Uncommon","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/482563_in_1000x1000.jpg","t