android-21-android-21-the-nature-of-evil"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Android%2021%20%2F%2F%20Android%2021%2C%20the%20Nature%20of%20Evil"}]},{"id":"488837","name":"Android 21 // Android 21, the Nature of Evil (Collector Booster Exclusive)","number":"BT20-024","subtitle":"Uncommon","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/488837_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/488837_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Power Absorbed"],["number","BT20-024"],["rarity","Uncommon"],["type","Leader"],["color","Blue"],["Special Trait","Android/Scientist"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","Special"],["Character","Android 21"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"Android 21\r\n\n[Permanent] You can't activate Extras, and during your turn, you can't play battle cards by skills.\r\n\n[Auto] If you have an \"Android 21\" Z-Battle Card in play : At the end of your turn, switch up to 1 of your blue energy to Active Mode.\r\n\n[Activate:Main] [Once per turn] Add 1 card from your life to your hand : Look at up to 5 cards from the top of your deck, add up to 1 blue \"Android\" card among them to your hand, shuffle your deck, and this card gets +5000 power for the turn.\r\n\n[Awaken] When your life is at 4 or less : Draw 1 card, and switch up to 1 of your energy to Active Mode.\r\n\n\n\r\nAndroid 21, the Nature of Evil\r\n\n[Permanent] During your turn, you can't play battle cards by skills.\r\n\n[Permanent] When paying energy costs for your \"Android 21\" cards, you can use your \"Android 21\" Z-Battle Cards and your opponent's Battle Cards and\r\nUnisons as energy.\r\n\n[Activate:Main] [Once per turn] Draw 1 card, and choose up to 3 of your opponent's Battle Cards and/or Unisons, ignoring [Barrier], and switch them to Active Mode."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"foil","value":48,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":38