"}],"prices":[{"source":"Cardmarket","items":[{"label":"trend","value":0.04,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg","value":0.03,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"low","value":0.02,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg7","value":0.04,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg30","value":0.04,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"trend","variant":"foil","value":1.67,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg","variant":"foil","value":6.5,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":0.05,"currency":"EUR"}],"ref":{"value":0.04,"currency":"EUR"},"url":null},{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"normal","value":0.07,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"normal","value":0.07,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"market","variant":"foil","value":0.22,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":0.14,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":0.07,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/483249/dragon-ball-super-ccg-power-absorbed-son-goku-ss4-son-goku-betting-it-all"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/483249/dragon-ball-super-ccg-power-absorbed-son-goku-ss4-son-goku-betting-it-all"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Son%20Goku%20%2F%2F%20SS4%20Son%20Goku%2C%20Betting%20It%20All"}]},{"id":"492497","name":"Son Goku // SS4 Son Goku, Betting It All (Collector Booster Exclusive)","number":"BT20-054","subtitle":"Uncommon","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/492497_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/492497_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Power Absorbed"],["number","BT20-054"],["rarity","Uncommon"],["type","Leader"],["color","Green"],["Special Trait","Saiyan"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","Super 17 Saga"],["Character","Son Goku : GT"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"Son Goku\r\n\n\r\n[Auto] When this card is placed in your Leader Area, send up to 1 [Android 20, Vengeful Alliance] and 1 [Dr. Myuu, Vengeful Alliance] from your deck to your Warp.\r\n\n\r\n[Auto] When this card attacks, look at up to 5 cards from the top of your deck, add up to 1 green \"Saiyan\" card among them to your hand, and shuffle your deck.\r\n\n\r\n[Awaken] When your life is at 4 or less, or when you have 2 or more energy while there are 2 or more \"Son Goku : GT\" cards in your Warp : Draw 1 card, switch up to 1 of your energy to Active Mode, and add cards from your life to your hand until you have 6 life left.\r\n\n\n\r\nSS4 Son Goku, Betting It All\r\n\n\r\n[Auto] [Once per turn] When a \"Pan\" card or a card with \"GT\" in its character name—both green and without \"Son Goku : GT\"—is placed from your Battle Area in your Drop, add it to your Z-Energy from your Drop.\r\n\n\r\n[Auto] When this card attacks, draw 1 card.\r\n\n\r\n[Auto] At the end of your turn, choose up to 1 of your green \"Android 18\" Z-Battle Cards and switch it to Active Mode."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":13.7,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":null,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/492497/dragon-ball-super-ccg-power-absorbed-son-goku-ss4-son-goku-betting-it-all-collector-booster-exclusive"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/492497/dragon-ball-super-ccg-power-absorbed-son-goku-ss4-son-goku-betting-it-all-collector-booster-exclusive"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Son%20Goku%20%2F%2F%20SS4%20Son%20Goku%2C%20Betting%20It%20All%20(Collector%20Booster%20Exclusive)"}]},{"id":"482628","name":"Android 20 & Dr. Myuu // Hell Fighter 17, Plans in Motion","number":"BT20-055","subtitle":"Uncommon","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/482628_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/482628_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Power Absorbed"],["number","BT20-055"],["rarity","Uncommon"],["type","Leader"],["color","Green"],["Special Trait","Android/Machine Mutant"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","Super 17 Saga"],["Character","Android 20/Dr. Myuu/ Hell Fighter 17"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"Android 20 & Dr. Myuu\r\n\n[Auto] When this card attacks, look at up to 5 cards from the top of your deck, add up to 1 \"Android\" or \"Machine Mutant\" card—both green and with an energy cost of 6 or less—among them to your hand, and shuffle your deck.\r\n\n[Awaken] When your life is at 4 or less, or when you have 2 or more energy while 1 or more \"Android 17\" and \"Hell Fighter 17\" cards are in your Z-Energy and Battle Area : Draw 2 cards and add cards from your life to your hand until you have 6 life left.\r\n\n\n\r\nHell Fighter 17, Plans in Motion\r\n\n[Auto] When this card attacks, draw 1 card.\r\n\n[Activate:Main] [Once per turn] Add up to 1 card from your life to your hand, and choose up to 1 of your opponent's Unisons and remove a marker from it. \r\n\n[Activate:Main] [Once per turn] Place 1 card from under one of your \"Super 17\" cards under this card : For the turn, reduce the skill cost of [Z-Awaken] on \"Super 17, Ready to Absorb\" in your Z-Deck by G."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"normal","value":0.14,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"normal","value":0.1,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"market","variant":"foil","value":0.27,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":0.05,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":0.14,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/482628/dragon-ball-super-ccg-power-absorbed-android-20-and-dr-myuu-hell-fighter-17-plans-in-motion"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/482628/dragon-ball-super-ccg-power-absorbed-android-20-and-dr-myuu-hell-fighter-17-plans-in-motion"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Android%2020%20%26%20Dr.%20Myuu%20%2F%2F%20Hell%20Fighter%2017%2C%20Plans%20in%20Motion"}]},{"id"