nergy Cost","3"],["Special Trait","Universe 3"],["power","25000"],["Era","Universe Survival Saga"],["Character","Anilaza"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Deflect] [Double Strike]\r\n\n[Auto] When this card is played, draw 1 card, place up to 1 \"Paparoni\" card, 1 \"Koitsukai\" card, 1 \"Panchia\" card, and 1 \"Bollarator\" card all red from your Battle Area and/or Drop under this card, and this card gains [Barrier] for the turn.\r\n\n[Auto] [Once per turn] When this card attacks, for every 2 cards under this card, choose up to 1 of your opponent's Battle Cards or Unisons, and it gets-30000 power for the turn.\r\n\n[Activate:Main] [Once per turn] Place up to 1 red \"Universe 3\" card from your hand under this card. Additionally, if there are 6 or more cards under this card, this card gains [Dual Attack] for the turn."}],"prices":[{"source":"Cardmarket","items":[{"label":"trend","value":0.04,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg","value":0.03,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"low","value":0.02,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg7","value":0.05,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg30","value":0.07,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"trend","variant":"foil","value":0.28,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg","variant":"foil","value":0.99,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":0.02,"currency":"EUR"}],"ref":{"value":0.05,"currency":"EUR"},"url":null},{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"normal","value":0.19,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"normal","value":0.18,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":0.19,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/487996/dragon-ball-super-ccg-power-absorbed-pre-release-cards-anilaza-dimension-bender"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/487996/dragon-ball-super-ccg-power-absorbed-pre-release-cards-anilaza-dimension-bender"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Anilaza%2C%20Dimension%20Bender"}]},{"id":