mber":"BT20-024","subtitle":"Uncommon","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/487900_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/487900_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Power Absorbed Pre-Release Cards"],["number","BT20-024"],["rarity","Uncommon"],["type","Leader"],["color","Blue"],["Special Trait","Android/Scientist"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","Special"],["Character","Android 21"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"Android 21\r\n\n[Permanent] You can't activate Extras, and during your turn, you can't play battle cards by skills.\r\n\n[Auto] If you have an \"Android 21\" Z-Battle Card in play : At the end of your turn, switch up to 1 of your blue energy to Active Mode.\r\n\n[Activate:Main] [Once per turn] Add 1 card from your life to your hand : Look at up to 5 cards from the top of your deck, add up to 1 blue \"Android\" card among them to your hand, shuffle your deck, and this card gets +5000 power for the turn.\r\n\n[Awaken] When your life is at 4 or less : Draw 1 card, and switch up to 1 of your energy to Active Mode.\r\n\n\n\r\nAndroid 21, the Nature of Evil\r\n\n[Permanent] During your turn, you can't play battle cards by skills.\r\n\n[Permanent] When paying energy costs for your \"Android 21\" cards, you can use your \"Android 21\" Z-Battle Cards and your opponent's Battle Cards and\r\nUnisons as energy.\r\n\n[Activate:Main] [Once per turn] Draw 1 card, and choose up to 3 of your opponent's Battle Cards and/or Unisons, ignoring [Barrier], and switch them to Active Mode."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"normal","value":29.9,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"normal","value":19.99,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":29.9,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/487900/dragon-ball-super-ccg-power-absorbed-pre-release-cards-android-21-android-21-the-nature-of-evil"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/487900/dragon-ball-super-ccg-power-absorbed-pre-release-cards-android-21-android-21-the-nature-of-evil"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Android%2021%20%2F%2F%20Android%2021%2C%20the%20Nature%20of%20Evil"}]},{"id":"487911","name":"Android 18, Accel Dance","number":"BT20-025","subtitle":"Uncommon","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/487911_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/487911_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Power Absorbed Pre-Release Cards"],["number","BT20-025"],["rarity","Uncommon"],["type","Z-Leader"],["color","Blue"],["Z-Energy Cost","3"],["Special Trait","Android"],["power","20000"],["Era","Special"],["Character","Android 18"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Z-Awaken] B, when your life is at 3 or less : Blue \"Android 18\".\r\n\n[Z-Stack 2] Blue \"Krillin\" and blue \"Android 17\" cards with energy costs of 5. (When putting this card into play/on top of your Leader from your Z-Deck, place up to 2 of the specified cards from your Z-Deck under this card.)\r\n\n[Auto] [Once per turn] When this card attacks, draw 1 card, and place up to 1 blue card from your Drop under this card.\r\n\n[Activate:Main] [Once per turn] BBB, place 3 other blue non-Leader cards from under this card in their owners' Drops : Play up to 1 \"Krillin\" or \"Android 17\" Z-Battle Card—both blue—from under this card, and this card gains [Double Strike] for the turn."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"normal","value":0.66,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"normal","value":0.49,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":0.66,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/487911/dragon-ball-super-ccg-power-absorbed-pre-release-cards-android-18-accel-dance"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/487911/dragon-ball-super-ccg-power-absorbed-pre-release-cards-android-18-accel-dance"},{"label":"Cardmarke