et.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Android%2021%2C%20Total%20Audacity"}]},{"id":"487936","name":"Krillin Helping His Family","number":"BT20-052","subtitle":"Uncommon","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/487936_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/487936_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Power Absorbed Pre-Release Cards"],["number","BT20-052"],["rarity","Uncommon"],["type","Extra"],["color","Blue"],["Energy(Color Cost)","1(B)"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Activate:Main] [Limit 1] If your Leader is a blue \"Android 18\" card : Draw 1 card, look at up to 7 cards from the top of your deck, place up to 1 \"Krillin\" or \"Android 18\" card—both blue—among them in your Drop, shuffle your deck, and if you placed a \"Krillin\" or \"Android 18\" card in your Drop, switch up to 1 of your mono-blue energy to Active Mode."}],"prices":[{"source":"Cardmarket","items":[{"label":"trend","variant":"foil","value":0.7,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg","variant":"foil","value":0.72,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":0.95,"currency":"EUR"}],"ref":{"value":0.95,"currency":"EUR"},"url":null},{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"normal","value":0.67,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"normal","value":0.58,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":0.67,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/487936/dragon-ball-super-ccg-power-absorbed-pre-release-cards-krillin-helping-his-family"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/487936/dragon-ball-super-ccg-power-absorbed-pre-release-cards-krillin-helping-his-family"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Krillin%20Helping%20His%20Family"}]},{"id":"487938","name":"Son Goku // SS4 Son Goku, Betting It All","number":"BT20-054","subtitle":"Uncommon","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/487938_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/487938_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Power Absorbed Pre-Release Cards"],["number","BT20-054"],["rarity","Uncommon"],["type","Leader"],["color","Green"],["Special Trait","Saiyan"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","Super 17 Saga"],["Character","Son Goku : GT"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"Son Goku\r\n\n\r\n[Auto] When this card is placed in your Leader Area, send up to 1 [Android 20, Vengeful Alliance] and 1 [Dr. Myuu, Vengeful Alliance] from your deck to your Warp.\r\n\n\r\n[Auto] When this card attacks, look at up to 5 cards from the top of your deck, add up to 1 green \"Saiyan\" card among them to your hand, and shuffle your deck.\r\n\n\r\n[Awaken] When your life is at 4 or less, or when you have 2 or more energy while there are 2 or more \"Son Goku : GT\" cards in your Warp : Draw 1 card, switch up to 1 of your energy to Active Mode, and add cards from your life to your hand until you have 6 life left.\r\n\n\n\r\nSS4 Son Goku, Betting It All\r\n\n\r\n[Auto] [Once per turn] When a \"Pan\" card or a card with \"GT\" in its character name—both green and without \"Son Goku : GT\"—is placed from your Battle Area in your Drop, add it to your Z-Energy from your Drop.\r\n\n\r\n[Auto] When this card attacks, draw 1 card.\r\n\n\r\n[Auto] At the end of your turn, choose up to 1 of your green \"Android 18\" Z-Battle Cards and switch it to Active Mode."}],"prices":[{"source":"Cardmarket","items":[{"label":"trend","value":0.04,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg","value":0.03,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"low","value":0.02,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg7","value":0.04,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg30","value":0.04,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"trend","variant":"foil","value":1.67,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg","variant":"foil","value":6.5,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":0.05,"currency":"EUR"}],"ref":{"value":0.04,"currency":"EUR"},"url":null},{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"low",