wer Absorbed Pre-Release Cards"],["number","BT20-085"],["rarity","Uncommon"],["type","Leader"],["color","Yellow"],["Special Trait","Majin"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","Majin Buu Saga"],["Character","Majin Buu"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"Majin Buu\r\n\n[Auto] When this card attacks, draw 1 card.\r\n\n[Activate:Main] [Once per turn] Look at up to 5 cards from the top of your deck, add up to 1 yellow \"Majin\" card with an energy cost of 6 or less among them to your hand, shuffle your deck, and if you added a card to your hand, discard 1 card from your hand.\r\n\n[Awaken] When your life is at 4 or less or you have a yellow \"Majin\" Z-Battle Card with an energy cost of 2 or more in play : Draw 1 card, switch up to 1 of your energy to Active Mode, and add cards from your life to your hand until you have 6 life left.\r\n\n\n\r\nMajin Buu, Absorption Complete\r\n\n[Auto] Discard 1 yellow card from your hand : When this card attacks, draw 2 cards.\r\n\n[Auto] [Once per turn] If it's your opponent's turn : When you play a yellow \"Majin\" card, choose up to 1 of your opponent's Battle Cards or Unisons and switch it to Rest Mode."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"normal","value":0.98,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"normal","value":0.6,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":0.98,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/487957/dragon-ball-super-ccg-power-absorbed-pre-release-cards-majin-buu-majin-buu-absorption-complete"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/487957/dragon-ball-super-ccg-power-absorbed-pre-release-cards-majin-buu-majin-buu-absorption-complete"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Majin%20Buu%20%2F%2F%20Majin%20Buu%2C%20Absorption%20Complete"}]},{"id":"487962","name":"SS Son Goku, Majin Showdown","number":"BT20-086","subtitle":"Uncommon","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com