/www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=SS%20Son%20Goku%2C%20Majin%20Showdown"}]},{"id":"488109","name":"Son Goku, Spirit Bomb Hope","number":"BT20-087","subtitle":"Rare","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/488109_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/488109_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Power Absorbed Pre-Release Cards"],["number","BT20-087"],["rarity","Rare"],["type","Z-Leader"],["color","Yellow"],["Z-Energy Cost","2"],["Special Trait","Saiyan"],["power","15000"],["Era","Majin Buu Saga"],["Character","Son Goku"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Z-Awaken] Y, when your life is at 4 or less : Yellow \"Son Goku\".\r\n\n[Z-Stack 1] Yellow \"Son Goku\" Leader with Z-Energy cost of 4. (When putting this card into play/on top of your Leader from your Z-Deck, place up to 1 of the specified cards from your Z-Deck under this card)\r\n\n[Activate:Main] [Once per turn] Place 1 card from your hand under a \"Spirit Bomb\" in your Battle Area : Draw 2 cards.\r\n\n[Activate:Main] If there are 7 or more cards under a \"Spirit Bomb\" in your Battle Area : Remove this card from the game, place up to 1 \"Son Goku\" Z-Leader from under your Leader on top of your Leader, and if you placed a card, you may switch your Leader to Active Mode."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"normal","value":2.29,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"normal","value":0.97,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":2.29,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/488109/dragon-ball-super-ccg-power-absorbed-pre-release-cards-son-goku-spirit-bomb-hope"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/488109/dragon-ball-super-ccg-power-absorbed-pre-release-cards-son-goku-spirit-bomb-hope"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Son%20Goku%2C%20Spirit%20Bomb%20Hope"}]},{"id":"487965","name":"M