 When this card attacks, draw 2 cards.\r\n\n\r\n[Awaken] When your life is at 2 or less, or your opponent has 2 or more energy and 2 or more \"Slug's Army\" cards are in your Z-Energy : You may draw 2 cards, switch up to 1 of your energy to Active Mode, and add the top card of your deck to your life.\r\n\n\n\r\nLord Slug, in His Prime\r\n\n\r\n[Permanent] When a \"Slug's Army\" card with a combo cost of 1 would leave your Battle Area, you may place it in your Z-Energy instead. If you do, place 1 of your Z-Energy in its owner's Drop.\r\n\n\r\n[Auto] Discard 1 \"Slug's Army\" card from your hand : When this card attacks, draw 2 cards.\r\n\n\r\n[Activate:Battle] [Once per turn] (Y) : Use up to 1 mono-yellow \"Slug's Army\" card with a combo cost of 1 from your Drop in a combo with its skills negated for the turn."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"normal","value":0.03,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"normal","value":0.03,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":0.19,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":0.03,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/450660/dragon-ball-super-ccg-fighters-ambition-lord-slug-lord-slug-in-his-prime"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/450660/dragon-ball-super-ccg-fighters-ambition-lord-slug-lord-slug-in-his-prime"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Lord%20Slug%20%2F%2F%20Lord%20Slug%2C%20in%20His%20Prime"}]},{"id":"450735","name":"Piccolo // Piccolo, Yet Unseen Power","number":"BT19-101","subtitle":"Uncommon","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/450735_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/450735_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Fighter's Ambition"],["number","BT19-101"],["rarity","Uncommon"],["type","Leader"],["color","Yellow"],["Special Trait","Namekian/God/Master's Teachings"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","D