 your Leader Card is a black \"Saiyan\" card : When your opponent activates a [Counter] skill, they choose 1 card in their hand and send it to their Warp."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"normal","value":0.49,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"normal","value":0.2,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":0.49,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/451316/dragon-ball-super-ccg-5th-anniversary-set-son-goku-true-fighting-spirit-revision"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/451316/dragon-ball-super-ccg-5th-anniversary-set-son-goku-true-fighting-spirit-revision"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Son%20Goku%2C%20True%20Fighting%20Spirit%20(Revision)"}]},{"id":"451313","name":"Young Invaders (Revision)","number":"BT13-028","subtitle":"Common","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/451313_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/451313_400w.jpg","details":[["set","5th Anniversary Set"],["number","BT13-028"],["rarity","Common"],["type","Extra"],["color","Red"],["Energy(Color Cost)","3(RRR)"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Field]\r\n\n[Auto] R, If your Leader Card is a \"King Vegeta : BR\" card : At the start of your opponent's turn, play up to 1 red \"Saiyan\" card with 500 power from your deck to your opponent's Battle Area, then shuffle your deck. If you played a card, you can't play Battle Cards that aren't red \"Saiyan\" cards for the turn.\r\n\n[Activate:Main] [Once per turn] R : Add up to 1 card from your life to your hand, then play up to 1 red \"Saiyan\" card with 500 power from your deck in Rest Mode with its skills negated for the game, then shuffle your deck.\r\n\n[Activate:Main] [Once per turn] R : Choose 1 of your opponent's Battle Cards and it gets -5000 power for the turn."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant