vision)"}]},{"id":"451308","name":"Black Smoke Dragon, Offering of Destruction (Revision)","number":"BT13-124","subtitle":"Uncommon","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/451308_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/451308_400w.jpg","details":[["set","5th Anniversary Set"],["number","BT13-124"],["rarity","Uncommon"],["type","Unison"],["color","Black"],["Energy(Color Cost)","X"],["power","15000"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Rejuvenate] [Once per turn] If your Leader Card is black and you remove 4 markers from this card.\r\n\n[Permanent] This card can't attack.\r\n\n[Activate:Main] [Once per turn]If your Leader Card is a black \"Demon Realm Race\" card : Add a marker to this card.\r\n\n[-1] [Activate:Main] If your Leader Card is a black \"Demon Realm Race\" card :Your opponent sends 1 Battle Card from their drop area to their Warp; you place up to 2 \"Dark Dragon Ball\" cards from your deck in your Drop Area, shuffle your deck, and draw 1 card."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"low","variant":"normal","value":0.13,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":null,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/451308/dragon-ball-super-ccg-5th-anniversary-set-black-smoke-dragon-offering-of-destruction-revision"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/451308/dragon-ball-super-ccg-5th-anniversary-set-black-smoke-dragon-offering-of-destruction-revision"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Black%20Smoke%20Dragon%2C%20Offering%20of%20Destruction%20(Revision)"}]},{"id":"451307","name":"Demon God Towa, Offering of the Dark Dragon Balls (Revision)","number":"BT13-139","subtitle":"Common","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/451307_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/451307_400w.jpg","details":[["set","5th Anniversary Set"],["number","BT13-139"],["rarity","Common"],["type","Battle"],["color","Black"],["Energy(Color Cost)","2"],["Special Trait","Demon Realm Race/Demon God"],["power","15000"],["Combo Power","10000"],["Combo Energy","0"],["Era","Dark Empire Saga"],["Character","Towa"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Super Combo]\r\n\n[Auto] [Sparking 5] If your Leader Card is black : When this card is used in a combo, draw 1 card."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"normal","value":0.2,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"normal","value":0.2,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":0.2,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/451307/dragon-ball-super-ccg-5th-anniversary-set-demon-god-towa-offering-of-the-dark-dragon-balls-revision"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/451307/dragon-ball-super-ccg-5th-anniversary-set-demon-god-towa-offering-of-the-dark-dragon-balls-revision"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Demon%20God%20Towa%2C%20Offering%20of%20the%20Dark%20Dragon%20Balls%20(Revision)"}]},{"id":"451306","name":"Videl // Videl, the Town's Heroine (Revision)","number":"BT14-061","subtitle":"Common","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/451306_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/451306_400w.jpg","details":[["set","5th Anniversary Set"],["number","BT14-061"],["rarity","Common"],["type","Leader"],["color","Green"],["Special Trait","Earthling/Heroine"],["power","5000/10000"],["Era","The Evil Wizard Babidi Saga"],["Character","Videl"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Auto] When this card attacks, draw 1 card.\r\n\n[Auto] [Once per turn] When one of your skill-less Battle Cards is used in a combo, draw 1 card and add up to 1 card from your life to your hand.\r\n\n[Auto] [Once per turn] [Spirit Boost 1] (You must remove a marker from your Unison Card to activate this skill.) If it's your opponent's turn and a skill-less Battle Card with an energy cost of 1 is being used in a combo from your hand : When a skill-less Battle Card with an energy cost of 1 in your Combo Area would be placed in its owner's Drop Area, play it instead.\r\n\n[Awaken] When your life is at 4 or less : You may draw 1 card, switch up to 1 of your energy to Active Mode, then flip this card over.\r\n\n\r\n\nVidel, the Town's Heroine\r\n\n[Auto] When this attacks, draw 1 card. Choose up to 1 of your green Unison Cards in Active Mode and switch it to Rest Mode, then add that card's power to this card's power for the battle.\r\n\n[Auto] [Once per turn] When one of your skill-less Battle Cards is used in a combo, it gets +4000 combo power for the battle, then draw 1 card.\r\n\n[Auto] [Once per turn] [Spirit Boost 1] If a skill-less Battle Card with an energy cost of 1 is being used in a combo from your hand : When a skill-less Battle Card with an energy cost of 1 in your Combo Area would be placed in its owner's Drop Area, play it instead, and it gets +5000 power for the turn."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"normal","value":0.37,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"normal","value":0.13,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":0.37,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/451306/dragon-ball-super-ccg-5th-anniversary-set-videl-videl-the-towns-heroine-revision"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/451306/dragon-ball-super-ccg-5th-anniversary-set-videl-videl-the-towns-heroine-revision"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Videl%20%2F%2F%20Videl%2C%20the%20Town's%20Heroine%20(Revision)"}]},{"id":"451310","name":"Power Beyond Super Saiyan 2 (Revision)","number":"BT14-087","subtitle":"Common","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/451310_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/451310_400w.jpg","details":[["set","5th Anniversary Set"],["number","BT14-087"],["rarity","Common"],["type","Extra"],["color","Green"],["Energy(Color Cost)","1(G)"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Counter : Play] You can activate this skill if your opponent announces they’re playing a Unison Card. Your opponent may remove a marker from the Unison Card they played. If they don't, choose up to 1 of their Battle Cards and KO it."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"low","variant":"normal","value":0.02,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":null,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/451310/dragon-ball-super-ccg-5th-anniversary-set-power-beyond-super-saiyan-2-revision"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/451310/dragon-ball-super-ccg-5th-anniversary-set-power-beyond-super-saiyan-2-revision"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Power%20Beyond%20Super%20Saiyan%202%20(Revision)"}]},{"id":"451305","name":"Ultimate Dark Dragon-Slaying Bullet (Revision)","number":"BT14-140","subtitle":"Super Rare","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/451305_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/451305_400w.jpg","details":[["set","5th Anniversary Set"],["number","BT14-140"],["rarity","Super Rare"],["type","Extra"],["color","Black"],["Energy(Color Cost)","1"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Counter:Play] You can activate this skill if your opponent declares they’re playing a Unison Card. They may either remove a marker from the Unison Card for every 2 cards in their Drop Area and Warp, or place it in their Drop Area instead of playing it. If they don't, your opponent can only attack one more time for the turn.\r\n\n[Permanent] This card gains \"Shadow Dragon\" in all areas.\r\n\n[Activate:Main/Battle] [Limit 1] Your opponent choses 1 of their Battle Cards with an energy cost less than the number of cards in their Drop Area and sends it to its owner's Warp."}],"prices":