9/dragon-ball-super-ccg-5th-anniversary-set-kaio-ken-son-goku-decisive-battle-revision"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/451309/dragon-ball-super-ccg-5th-anniversary-set-kaio-ken-son-goku-decisive-battle-revision"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Kaio-Ken%20Son%20Goku%2C%20Decisive%20Battle%20(Revision)"}]},{"id":"451302","name":"Kaio-Ken Son Goku, Confronting Invasion (Revision)","number":"BT15-068","subtitle":"Common","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/451302_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/451302_400w.jpg","details":[["set","5th Anniversary Set"],["number","BT15-068"],["rarity","Common"],["type","Battle"],["color","Green"],["Energy(Color Cost)","2(G)"],["Special Trait","Saiyan"],["power","15000"],["Combo Power","5000"],["Combo Energy","0"],["Era","Saiyan Saga"],["Character","Son Goku"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Unique] [Barrier]\r\n\n[Activate:Main] [Limit 1] G, if there are a total of 4 \"King Kai's Training\" in your Warp and/or under a \"King Kai's Planet\" in your Battle Area, and you send this card to its owner's Warp : Play up to 1 \"Kaio-Ken Son Goku, Maximum Gains\" from your deck, then shuffle your deck."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"normal","value":0.18,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"normal","value":0.13,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":0.18,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/451302/dragon-ball-super-ccg-5th-anniversary-set-kaio-ken-son-goku-confronting-invasion-revision"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/451302/dragon-ball-super-ccg-5th-anniversary-set-kaio-ken-son-goku-confronting-invasion-revision"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Kaio-Ken%20Son%20Goku%2C%20Confronting%20Invasion%20