acter","Vegeta: Xeno/Trunks: Xeno/Vegeks: Xeno"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Permanent] You can't play non-black Battle Cards.\r\n\n[Activate:Main] [Once per turn] [Burst 5] Draw 1 card.\r\n\n[Awaken] When you life is at 4 or less or you have 20 or more cards in your Drop Area : You may draw 1 card, switch up to 1 of your energy to Active Mode, add cards from your life to your hand until you have 6 cards in your life, and flip this card over. \r\n\n\r\n\nVegeks, the Unsung Fusion Hero\r\n\n[Permanent] You can't play non-black Battle Cards.\r\n\n[Permanent] [Sparking 20] (This skill takes effect when you have 20 or more cards in your Drop Area.) If you would lose the game by running out of cards in your deck, shuffle your Drop Area into your deck instead.\r\n\n[Activate:Main] [Once per turn] Draw 1 card, place 5 cards from the top of your deck in your Drop Area, then choose up to 1 of your black Unison Cards and it gains [Double Strike] for the turn."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"normal","value":0.29,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"normal","value":0.2,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":0.29,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/451295/dragon-ball-super-ccg-5th-anniversary-set-vegeta-xeno-and-trunks-xeno-vegeks-the-unsung-fusion-hero-revision"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/451295/dragon-ball-super-ccg-5th-anniversary-set-vegeta-xeno-and-trunks-xeno-vegeks-the-unsung-fusion-hero-revision"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Vegeta%3A%20Xeno%20%26%20Trunks%20Xeno%20%2F%2F%20Vegeks%2C%20the%20Unsung%20Fusion%20Hero%20(Revision)"}]}],"DBS-B18PRE":[{"id":"284722","name":"Son Goku & Vegeta // SS4 Son Goku & SS4 Vegeta, In It Together","number":"BT18-001","subtitle":"Uncommon","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/284722_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/284722_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Dawn of the Z-Legends Pre-Release Cards"],["number","BT18-001"],["rarity","Uncommon"],["type","Leader"],["color","Red"],["Special Trait","Saiyan"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","Shadow Dragon Saga"],["Character","Son Goku: GT/Vegeta: GT"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Permanent] You can use your mono-red Rest Mode \"Saiyan\" cards in combos.\r\n\n[Auto][Once per turn] When you use a card in a combo, look at up to 3 cards from the top of your deck, add up to 1 red \"Saiyan\" card or 1 red Unison with a specified cost of 2 among them to your hand, and place the remaining cards at the bottom of your deck in any order.\r\n\n[Awaken] When your life is at 4 or less or you have 2 or more energy and both \"Son Goku : GT\" and \"Vegeta : GT\" cards in your Z-Energy : You may draw 1 card, switch up to 1 of your energy to Active Mode, and add cards from your life to your hand until you have 6 life left.\r\n\n\nSS4 Son Goku & SS4 Vegeta, In It Together\r\n\n[Permanent] You can use your mono-red Rest Mode \"Saiyan\" cards in combos.\r\n\n[Permanent] Your \"Gogeta : GT\" cards can attack your opponent's Battle Cards in Active Mode, and when your \"Gogeta : GT\" cards attack your opponent's Battle Cards, your opponent skips their Defense Step.\r\n\n[Auto][Once per turn] When you activate [Union-Fusion], this card gains \"Gogeta : GT\" for the turn.\r\n\n[Auto] When this card attacks, draw 1 card, then play up to 1 red \"Saiyan\" card with an energy cost of 1 from your hand in Rest Mode."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"normal","value":16.19,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"normal","value":15,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":16.19,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/284722/dragon-ball-super-ccg-dawn-of-the-z-legends-pre-release-cards-son-goku-and-vegeta-ss4-son-goku-and-ss4-vegeta-in-it-together"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"