-ball-super-ccg-dawn-of-the-z-legends-pre-release-cards-bardocks-crew-bardock-inherited-will"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/284690/dragon-ball-super-ccg-dawn-of-the-z-legends-pre-release-cards-bardocks-crew-bardock-inherited-will"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Bardock's%20Crew%20%2F%2F%20Bardock%2C%20Inherited%20Will"}]},{"id":"284715","name":"Piccolo // Piccolo, Facing New Foes","number":"BT18-090","subtitle":"Uncommon","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/284715_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/284715_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Dawn of the Z-Legends Pre-Release Cards"],["number","BT18-090"],["rarity","Uncommon"],["type","Leader"],["color","Yellow"],["Special Trait","Namekian/God"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","DBS: SUPER HERO Saga"],["Character","Piccolo: SH"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Auto] Discard 1 card from your hand : When this card attacks, look at up to 5 cards from the top of your deck, add up to 1 yellow card among them to your hand, then shuffle your deck.\r\n\n[Awaken] When your life is at 4 or less or you have a mono-yellow \"Son Gohan : SH\" Z-Battle Card in play : You may draw 1 card, switch up to 1 of your energy to Active Mode, and add cards from your life to your hand until you have 6 life left.\r\n\n\n\r\nPiccolo, Facing New Foes\r\n\n[Auto][Once per turn] If it's your turn : When you play a yellow card from your Drop or a Z-Battle Card, draw 1 card.\r\n\n[Auto] When this card attacks, draw 1 card, and discard 1 card from your hand.\r\n\n[Activate : Battle][Once per turn] Discard 1 card from your hand : Use up to 1 yellow Battle Card with 5000 combo power from your Drop in a combo with its skills negated for the turn, and this card gets +1000 power for the battle."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"normal","value":4.98,"cu