o Power","10000"],["Combo Energy","1"],["Era","Android Cell Saga"],["Character","Cell"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Union-Absorb] G, choose 1 \"Android 18\" card in your Drop Area and place it under this card : Choose up to 1 \"Cell\" card with an energy cost of 8 from your deck or hand, play it on top of this card in Active Mode, then shuffle your deck if you looked through it.\r\n\n[Energy-Exhaust]\r\n\n[Auto] If you have 4 or more energy : When this card is placed in a Drop Area from a Battle Area by a skill, choose up to 1 \"Cell\" card with an energy cost of 8 in your Drop Area and play it."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"foil","value":0.15,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":0.05,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":0.15,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/271433/dragon-ball-super-ccg-expansion-deck-box-set-20-ultimate-deck-2022-cell-perfection-reclaimed"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/271433/dragon-ball-super-ccg-expansion-deck-box-set-20-ultimate-deck-2022-cell-perfection-reclaimed"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Cell%2C%20Perfection%20Reclaimed"}]}],"DBS-B17PRE":[{"id":"273260","name":"Son Goku // Son Goku, Pan, & Trunks, Space Adventurers","number":"BT17-001","subtitle":"Uncommon","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/273260_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/273260_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Ultimate Squad Pre-Release Cards"],["number","BT17-001"],["rarity","Uncommon"],["type","Leader"],["color","Red"],["Special Trait","Saiyan/Earthling"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","Black Star Dragon Ball Saga"],["Character","Son Goku: GT/Pan/Trunks: GT"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Auto] When this card is placed in your Leader Area, play up to 1 \"Spaceship, Vessel of Hope\" from your deck with a marker on it.\r\n\n[Auto] Choose 1 \"Spaceship, Vessel of Hope\" in your Unison Area and place 1 \"Saiyan\" card from your hand under it : When this card attacks, draw 2 cards.\r\n\n[Awaken] When your life is at 4 or less or one of your Unison Cards has 7 or more markers on it : You may draw 2 cards, then add cards from your life to your hand until you have 6 life left and flip this card over.\r\n\n\nSon Goku, Pan, & Trunks, Space Adventurers\r\n\n[Auto] When this card attacks, draw 1 card.\r\n\n[Activate:Main] [Once per turn] R, if you don't have a Unison Card in play : Play up to 1 \"Spaceship, Vessel of Hope\" from your hand or Drop Area with a marker on it.\r\n\n[Activate:Main] [Once per turn] [Spirit Boost 10] If you have 5 or more energy : Play up to 1 red \"Son Goku : GT\" card with an energy cost of 8 from your hand, and it gets +5000 power for the turn."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"normal","value":1.52,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"normal","value":1.75,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":1.52,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/273260/dragon-ball-super-ccg-ultimate-squad-pre-release-cards-son-goku-son-goku-pan-and-trunks-space-adventurers"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/273260/dragon-ball-super-ccg-ultimate-squad-pre-release-cards-son-goku-son-goku-pan-and-trunks-space-adventurers"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Son%20Goku%20%2F%2F%20Son%20Goku%2C%20Pan%2C%20%26%20Trunks%2C%20Space%20Adventurers"}]},{"id":"273249","name":"Dr. Myuu & General Rilldo // Dr. Myuu & Hyper Meta-Rilldo, Rulers of Planet-2","number":"BT17-002","subtitle":"Uncommon","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/273249_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/273249_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Ultimate Squad Pre-Release Cards"],["number","BT17-002"],["ra