 deck."}],"prices":[{"source":"Cardmarket","items":[{"label":"trend","value":0.02,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg","value":0.02,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"low","value":0.02,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg7","value":0.02,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg30","value":0.03,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"trend","variant":"foil","value":0.08,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg","variant":"foil","value":0.25,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":0.15,"currency":"EUR"}],"ref":{"value":0.02,"currency":"EUR"},"url":null},{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"low","variant":"normal","value":0.75,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":null,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/273243/dragon-ball-super-ccg-ultimate-squad-pre-release-cards-commander-red-red-ribbon-robot-seeking-world-conquest"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/273243/dragon-ball-super-ccg-ultimate-squad-pre-release-cards-commander-red-red-ribbon-robot-seeking-world-conquest"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Commander%20Red%20%2F%2F%20Red%20Ribbon%20Robot%2C%20Seeking%20World%20Conquest"}]},{"id":"273250","name":"Gamma 1 & Gamma 2 // Gamma 1 & Gamma 2, Newfound Foes","number":"BT17-032","subtitle":"Uncommon","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/273250_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/273250_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Ultimate Squad Pre-Release Cards"],["number","BT17-032"],["rarity","Uncommon"],["type","Leader"],["color","Blue"],["Special Trait","Android/Red Ribbon Army"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","DBS: SUPER HERO Saga"],["Character","Gamma 1: SH/ Gamma 2: SH"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Permanent] You can't use non- \"Red Ribbon Army\" card skills to place cards in your energy. \r\n\n[Auto] When this card attacks, draw 1 card.\r\n\n[Awaken] When your life is at 4 or less or you have a blue Unison Card with a specified cost of 2 in play : You may draw 1 card, switch up to 1 of your energy to Active Mode, add cards from your life to your hand until you have 6 life left, and flip this card over.\r\n\n\nGamma 1 & Gamma 2, Newfound Foes\r\n\n[Permanent] You can't use non-\"Red Ribbon Army\" card skills to place cards in your energy. \r\n\n[Auto] When a blue card is played from your energy, place the top card of your deck in your energy in Rest Mode.\r\n\n[Auto] Add 3 blue \"Android\" cards from your energy to your hand : At the end of your turn, draw 1 card, add up to 3 blue \"Android\" cards in your hand to your energy, and until the end of your opponent's next turn, you can't activate the skills of non-\"Android\" Battle Cards with energy costs of 7 or less in all areas."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"normal","value":2.95,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"normal","value":2.4,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":2.95,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/273250/dragon-ball-super-ccg-ultimate-squad-pre-release-cards-gamma-1-and-gamma-2-gamma-1-and-gamma-2-newfound-foes"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/273250/dragon-ball-super-ccg-ultimate-squad-pre-release-cards-gamma-1-and-gamma-2-gamma-1-and-gamma-2-newfound-foes"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Gamma%201%20%26%20Gamma%202%20%2F%2F%20Gamma%201%20%26%20Gamma%202%2C%20Newfound%20Foes"}]},{"id":"273248","name":"Dr. Gero, Abominable Creator","number":"BT17-034","subtitle":"Uncommon","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/273248_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/273248_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Ultimate Squad Pre-Release Cards"],["number","BT17-034"],["rarity","Uncommon"],["type","Unison"],["color","Blue"],["Energy(Color Cost)","X(B)"],["power","1000"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Empower Blue 3]\r\n\n