/dragon-ball-super-ccg-ultimate-squad-pre-release-cards-son-goku-ss-son-goku-fearless-fighter"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Son%20Goku%20%2F%2F%20SS%20Son%20Goku%2C%20Fearless%20Fighter"}]},{"id":"273256","name":"Piccolo // Piccolo, Supreme Power","number":"BT17-082","subtitle":"Uncommon","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/273256_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/273256_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Ultimate Squad Pre-Release Cards"],["number","BT17-082"],["rarity","Uncommon"],["type","Leader"],["color","Yellow"],["Special Trait","Namekian/God"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","Android Cell Saga"],["Character","Piccolo"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Auto] Place 1 \"Namekian\" card from your hand under this card : When this card attacks, draw 1 card, then look at up to 5 cards from the top of your deck, add up to 1 green or yellow \"Namekian\" card among them to your hand, and shuffle your deck.\r\n\n[Awaken] When your life is at 4 or less or there are 2 or more cards under this card : You may draw 1 card, switch up to 1 of your energy to Active Mode, add cards from your life to your hand until you have 5 life left, and flip this card over.\r\n\n\nPiccolo, Supreme Power\r\n\n[Permanent] When placing Battle Cards under other cards to pay skill costs for your \"Namekian\" [Union-Absorb] skills, you can use cards from under this card instead.\r\n\n[Auto] Place 1 \"Namekian\" card from your hand under this card : When this card attacks, draw 2 cards.\r\n\n[Activate:Battle] [Once per turn] Place 1 card from under this card in its owner's Drop Area : This card gets +5000 power for the battle."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"normal","value":1.34,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"normal","value":1.34,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":1.34,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.co