lace X cards from under this card in their owner's Drop Areas : This card gets +2000 power for the battle for each card placed in a Drop Area using this skill. Additionally, if you placed 3 or more cards in Drop Areas using this skill, draw 1 card, then switch up to 1 of your mono-blue energy to Active Mode."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"normal","value":0.19,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"normal","value":0.03,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"market","variant":"foil","value":0.71,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":0.49,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":0.19,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/259439/dragon-ball-super-ccg-realm-of-the-gods-son-goku-ssg-son-goku-crimson-warrior"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/259439/dragon-ball-super-ccg-realm-of-the-gods-son-goku-ssg-son-goku-crimson-warrior"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Son%20Goku%20%2F%2F%20SSG%20Son%20Goku%2C%20Crimson%20Warrior"}]},{"id":"259447","name":"Whis // Whis, Invitation to Battle","number":"BT16-021","subtitle":"Uncommon","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/259447_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/259447_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Realm of the Gods"],["number","BT16-021"],["rarity","Uncommon"],["type","Leader"],["color","Blue"],["Special Trait","God"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","Battle of Gods Saga"],["Character","Whis"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Activate:Main] Switch this card to Rest Mode : Draw 1 card, then play up to 1 blue or yellow skill-less Battle Card with 15000 power from your deck or Drop Area in your opponent's Battle Area in Rest Mode. Shuffle your deck if you looked through it.\r\n\n[Awaken] When your life is at 3 or less or your opponent's Leader Card's back is facing up : You may draw 2 cards, then flip th