er-Son Onslaught\r\n\n[Auto] When this card attacks, you may draw 1 card. If you don't, choose up to 1 yellow \"Vegeta\", yellow \"Trunks: Future\", or yellow \"Bulma: Future\" card with an energy cost of 1 in your hand or Drop Area and play it in Rest Mode.\r\n\n[Auto] [Once per turn] When a yellow Battle Card activates an [EX-Evolve] skill from your hand, draw 1 card.\r\n\n[Activate:Battle] [Once per turn] Place 1 card from under this card in its owner's Drop Area : This card gets +10000 power and [Double Strike] for the battle."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"normal","value":0.38,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"normal","value":0.1,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"market","variant":"foil","value":1.04,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":0.25,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":0.38,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/259634/dragon-ball-super-ccg-realm-of-the-gods-trunks-ssb-vegeta-and-ss-trunks-father-son-onslaught"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/259634/dragon-ball-super-ccg-realm-of-the-gods-trunks-ssb-vegeta-and-ss-trunks-father-son-onslaught"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Trunks%20%2F%2F%20SSB%20Vegeta%20%26%20SS%20Trunks%2C%20Father-Son%20Onslaught"}]},{"id":"260245","name":"Zamasu // SS Rose Goku Black, Wishes Fulfilled","number":"BT16-072","subtitle":"Uncommon","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/260245_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/260245_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Realm of the Gods"],["number","BT16-072"],["rarity","Uncommon"],["type","Leader"],["color","Yellow"],["Special Trait","Saiyan/God/Shenron"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","Future Trunks Saga"],["Character","Goku Black"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Auto] When this card attacks, add up to 2 [Dragon Ball] cards from your dec