r-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/264080_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/264080_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Realm of the Gods Pre-Release Cards"],["number","BT16-070"],["rarity","Rare"],["type","Extra"],["color","Green"],["Energy(Color Cost)","1(G)"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Counter:Attack] Negate the attack, and you don't take damage from your opponent's non-keyword skills for the turn."}],"prices":[{"source":"Cardmarket","items":[{"label":"trend","value":0.05,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg","value":0.06,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"low","value":0.02,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg7","value":0.04,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg30","value":0.07,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"trend","variant":"foil","value":0.15,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":0.03,"currency":"EUR"}],"ref":{"value":0.06,"currency":"EUR"},"url":null},{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"low","variant":"normal","value":0.18,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":null,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/264080/dragon-ball-super-ccg-realm-of-the-gods-pre-release-cards-damage-negation"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/264080/dragon-ball-super-ccg-realm-of-the-gods-pre-release-cards-damage-negation"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Damage%20Negation"}]},{"id":"264081","name":"Trunks // SSB Vegeta & SS Trunks, Father-Son Onslaught","number":"BT16-071","subtitle":"Uncommon","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/264081_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/264081_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Realm of the Gods Pre-Release Cards"],["number","BT16-071"],["rarity","Uncommon"],["type","Leader"],["color","Yellow"],["Special Trait","Saiyan/Earthling"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","Future Trunks Saga"],["Character","Vegeta/Trunks: Future"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Auto] When this card attacks, draw 1 card.\r\n\n[Activate:Main] If you have 2 or more energy and you choose 1 yellow \"Vegeta\" card in your Battle Area and place it under this card : Flip this card over. If you do, draw 1 card, then add cards from your life to your hand until you have 6 life left.\r\n\n[Awaken] When your life is at 4 or less : You may draw 2 cards, then flip this card over.\r\n\n\nSSB Vegeta & SS Trunks, Father-Son Onslaught\r\n\n[Auto] When this card attacks, you may draw 1 card. If you don't, choose up to 1 yellow \"Vegeta\", yellow \"Trunks: Future\", or yellow \"Bulma: Future\" card with an energy cost of 1 in your hand or Drop Area and play it in Rest Mode.\r\n\n[Auto] [Once per turn] When a yellow Battle Card activates an [EX-Evolve] skill from your hand, draw 1 card.\r\n\n[Activate:Battle] [Once per turn] Place 1 card from under this card in its owner's Drop Area : This card gets +10000 power and [Double Strike] for the battle."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"normal","value":5.23,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"normal","value":5.23,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":5.23,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/264081/dragon-ball-super-ccg-realm-of-the-gods-pre-release-cards-trunks-ssb-vegeta-and-ss-trunks-father-son-onslaught"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/264081/dragon-ball-super-ccg-realm-of-the-gods-pre-release-cards-trunks-ssb-vegeta-and-ss-trunks-father-son-onslaught"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Trunks%20%2F%2F%20SSB%20Vegeta%20%26%20SS%20Trunks%2C%20Father-Son%20Onslaught"}]},{"id":"265468","name":"Zamasu // SS Rose Goku Black, Wishes Fulfilled","number":"BT16-072","subtitle":"Uncommon","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/265468_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/265468_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Realm of the Gods Pre-Release Cards"],["number","BT16-072"],["rarity","Uncommon"],["type","Leader"],["color","Yellow"],["Special Trait","Saiyan/God/Shenron"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","Future Trunks Saga"],["Character","Goku Black"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Auto] When this card attacks, add up to 2 [Dragon Ball] cards from your deck and/or life to your hand; shuffle any areas you looked through using this skill.\r\n\n[Wish] When your life is at 3 or less or there are 7 [Dragon Ball] cards in your Drop Area : Draw 1 card, then place all [Dragon Ball] cards from your Drop Area at the bottom of your deck in any order and flip this card over.\r\n\n\nSS Rose Goku Black, Wishes Fulfilled\r\n\n[Activate:Main] [Once per turn] Choose one—\r\n\n• Draw 1 card.\r\n\n• Add up to 1 [Dragon Ball] card from your deck to your hand, then shuffle your deck.\r\n\n• Remove 7 [Dragon Ball] cards in your Drop Area from the game. If you do, play up to 1 \"Zamasu\" card with an energy cost of 2 or less and [Indestructible] from your Warp, and this card gains [Triple Attack] for the turn."}],"prices":[{"source":"Cardmarket","items":[{"label":"trend","value":3.75,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg","value":0.11,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"low","value":0.02,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg7","value":0.08,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg30","value":1.55,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"trend","variant":"foil","value":1.83,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":0.2,"currency":"EUR"}],"ref":{"value":0.83,"currency":"EUR"},"url":null},{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"low","variant":"normal","value":19.99,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":null,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/265468/dragon-ball-super-ccg-realm-of-the-gods-pre-release-cards-zamasu-ss-rose-goku-black-wishes-fulfilled"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/265468/dragon-ball-super-ccg-realm-of-the-gods-pre-release-cards-zamasu-ss-rose-goku-black-wishes-fulfilled"},{"label":"