-2nd-edition-violent-rays"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Violent%20Rays"}]},{"id":"258529","name":"Baby // Baby, Spirit of the Tuffles","number":"BT11-031","subtitle":"Common","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/258529_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/258529_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Vermilion Bloodline (2nd Edition)"],["number","BT11-031"],["rarity","Common"],["type","Leader"],["color","Blue"],["Special Trait","Saiyan/Machine Mutant/Great Ape"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","Baby Saga"],["Character","Vegeta: GT/Baby"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Auto] When you place this card in your Leader Area, activate up to 1 {Planet Tuffle} from your deck.\r\n\n[Auto] When this card attacks, draw 1 card.\r\n\n[Awaken] When your life is at 4 or less : You may draw 2 cards, then flip this card over.\r\n\n\n\r\nBaby, Spirit of the Tuffles\r\n\n[Overlord] [Once per turn] (Place 1 of your Battle Cards with the [Servant] skill at the bottom of your deck : Draw 1 card.)\r\n\n[Auto] When this card attacks, draw 1 card.\r\n\n[Activate:Main] [Once per turn] Look at up to 3 cards from the top of your deck, add up to 1 mono-blue card with a [Counter] skill among them to your hand, place the remaining cards at the bottom of your deck, in any order, then choose 1 card in your hand and place it at the bottom of your deck."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"foil","value":0.39,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":0.39,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"normal","value":0.11,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":0.39,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/258529/dragon-ball-super-ccg-vermilion-bloodline-2nd-edition-baby-baby-spirit-of-the-tuffles"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/258529/dragon-ball-super-ccg-vermilion-bloodline-2n