,"Leader"],["color","Yellow"],["Special Trait","Saiyan/Earthling/Monster/Rider"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","Garlic Jr. Saga"],["Character","Son Gohan: Youth/Hire-Dragon"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Permanent] During your turn, if you have a skill-less Battle Card in play, this card gets +5000 power.\r\n\n[Auto] When this card attacks, draw 1 card, then add up to 1 card from your life to your hand.\r\n\n[Awaken] When your life is at 4 or less : You may draw 2 cards and flip this card over.\r\n\n\n\r\nSon Gohan & Hire-Dragon, Boundless Friendship\r\n\n[Activate:Main] [Once per turn] Y: Draw 1 card, then play up to 1 yellow skill-less Battle Card with an energy cost of 1 from your Drop Area.\r\n\n[Activate:Battle] [Once per turn] When this card is in a battle, if it's your turn and there is a \"Monster\" card in your Combo Area, draw 1 card.\r\n\n\r\n\nThis card has been errata'd as of 2/4/2022."}],"prices":[{"source":"Cardmarket","items":[{"label":"trend","variant":"foil","value":0.69,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg","variant":"foil","value":1.17,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":0.3,"currency":"EUR"}],"ref":{"value":0.72,"currency":"EUR"},"url":null},{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"low","variant":"normal","value":0.1,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":0.18,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":null,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/258627/dragon-ball-super-ccg-vermilion-bloodline-2nd-edition-son-gohan-son-gohan-and-hire-dragon-boundless-friendship"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/258627/dragon-ball-super-ccg-vermilion-bloodline-2nd-edition-son-gohan-son-gohan-and-hire-dragon-boundless-friendship"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Son%20Gohan%20%2F%2F%20Son%20Gohan%20%26%20Hire-Dragon%2C%20Boundless%20Friendship"}]},{"id":"258628","name":"Garlic Jr. // Garlic Jr., the Immortal Demon","number":"BT11-092","subtitle":"Common","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/258628_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/258628_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Vermilion Bloodline (2nd Edition)"],["number","BT11-092"],["rarity","Common"],["type","Leader"],["color","Yellow"],["Special Trait","Demon Clan"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","Garlic Jr. Saga"],["Character","Garlic Jr."]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Overlord] [Once per turn] (Place 1 of your Battle Cards with the [Servant] skill at the bottom of your deck : Draw 1 card.)\r\n\n[Auto] When this card attacks, draw 1 card.\r\n\n[Awaken] When your life is at 4 or less, or if you have a yellow Unison Card with a specified cost of 3 in play : You may draw 1 card, switch up to 1 of your energy to Active Mode, add cards from your life to your hand until you have 6 life left, and flip this card over.\r\n\n\n\r\nGarlic Jr., the Immortal Demon\r\n\n[Overlord] [Once per turn]\r\n\n[Auto] When this card attacks, draw 1 card.\r\n\n[Auto] When one of your opponent's cards attacks, you may choose 1 yellow \"Demon Clan\" card with an energy cost of 2 or less in your. hand and play it in Rest Mode. If you do, negate this skill for the turn."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"normal","value":0.25,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"normal","value":0.01,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":0.05,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":0.25,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/258628/dragon-ball-super-ccg-vermilion-bloodline-2nd-edition-garlic-jr-garlic-jr-the-immortal-demon"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/258628/dragon-ball-super-ccg-vermilion-bloodline-2nd-edition-garlic-jr-garlic-jr-the-immortal-demon"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Garlic%20Jr.%20%2F%2F%20Garlic%20Jr.%2C%20the%20I