nd : If your opponent has 5 or more life, deal 1 damage to your opponent.\r\n\n[Awaken] When your life is at 4 or less : You may draw 2 cards and flip this card over.\r\n\n\r\n\nSon Gohan & Son Goten, Brotherly Bonds\r\n\n[Auto] [Sparking 5] (This skill takes effect when you have 5 or more cards in your Drop Area.) When this card attacks, draw 1 card.\r\n\n[Auto] [Once per turn] When one of your Battle Cards activates [Alliance], choose up to 1 of your opponent's Battle Cards with 30000 power or less and KO it.\r\n\n[Activate:Main] [Once per turn] [Sparking] Choose 3 cards in your hand and place them in your Drop Area : Choose all of your red and green Battle Cards, then both the chosen cards and this card get +10000 power for the duration of the turn."}],"prices":[{"source":"Cardmarket","items":[{"label":"trend","variant":"foil","value":122.11,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg","variant":"foil","value":70,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":59.99,"currency":"EUR"}],"ref":{"value":76.26,"currency":"EUR"},"url":null},{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"normal","value":26.99,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"normal","value":22,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":26.99,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/195182/dragon-ball-super-ccg-assault-of-the-saiyans-pre-release-cards-son-gohan-son-gohan-and-son-goten-brotherly-bonds"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/195182/dragon-ball-super-ccg-assault-of-the-saiyans-pre-release-cards-son-gohan-son-gohan-and-son-goten-brotherly-bonds"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Son%20Gohan%20%2F%2F%20Son%20Gohan%20%26%20Son%20Goten%2C%20Brotherly%20Bonds"}]},{"id":"195184","name":"Broly // Broly, Recurring Nightmare","number":"BT7-002_PR","subtitle":"Uncommon","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/195184_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcg