a","Future Trunks Saga"],["Character","Son Goku/Vegeta/Vegito"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Permanent] If your life is at 4 or less, this card gets +5000 power during your opponent's turn.\r\n\n[Auto] When this card attacks, draw 1 card.\r\n\n[Activate:Main] If you have 4 or more energy : Choose up to 1 blue \"Son Goku\" and 1 yellow \"Vegeta\" card in your hand with energy costs of 2 or less and play them, you can only play \"Trunks: Future\" and \"Vegito\" cards for the duration of the turn, and you can't activate this skill for the duration of the game.\r\n\n[Awaken] When your life is at 4 or less : You may draw 1 card and flip this card over.\r\n\n\r\n\nSSB Vegito, Energy Eruption\r\n\n[Auto] When this card attacks, draw 1 card.\r\n\n[Auto] [Once per turn] When you combo with 1 or more Battle Cards with a combo cost of 1 in your Energy Area using a skill, choose up to 1 of those Battle Cards, and when the battle ends the chosen card is returned to its owner's hand instead of being placed in its owner's Drop Area."}],"prices":[{"source":"Cardmarket","items":[{"label":"trend","variant":"foil","value":243.22,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg","variant":"foil","value":50,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":99,"currency":"EUR"}],"ref":{"value":171.85,"currency":"EUR"},"url":null}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/195211/dragon-ball-super-ccg-assault-of-the-saiyans-pre-release-cards-son-goku-and-vegeta-ssb-vegito-energy-eruption"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Son%20Goku%20%26%20Vegeta%20%2F%2F%20SSB%20Vegito%2C%20Energy%20Eruption"}]},{"id":"195213","name":"Goku Black & Zamasu // Fused Zamasu, Supreme Strike","number":"BT7-026_PR","subtitle":"Uncommon","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/195213_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/195213_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Assault o