","Rare"],["type","Extra"],["color","Blue"],["Energy(Color Cost)","1(B)"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Counter:Attack] If your Leader Card is blue : Negate the attack, then choose up to 1 of your opponent's Battle Cards with an energy cost of 1 and return it to its owner's hand.\r\n\n[Permanent] If this card is in your Drop Area, you can activate it by paying its energy cost and removing it and 1 blue card in your hand from the game.\r\n\n[Auto] When you activate this card, you can't activate {All Too Easy...} for the duration of the turn."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"normal","value":7.16,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"normal","value":6.99,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":7.16,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/195244/dragon-ball-super-ccg-assault-of-the-saiyans-pre-release-cards-all-too-easy"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/195244/dragon-ball-super-ccg-assault-of-the-saiyans-pre-release-cards-all-too-easy"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=All%20Too%20Easy..."}]},{"id":"195245","name":"Raditz // Raditz, Brotherly Hate","number":"BT7-049_PR","subtitle":"Uncommon","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/195245_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/195245_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Assault of the Saiyans Pre-Release Cards"],["number","BT7-049_PR"],["rarity","Uncommon"],["type","Leader"],["color","Green"],["Special Trait","Saiyan"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","Saiyan Saga"],["Character","Raditz"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Auto] When this card attacks a Leader Card, your opponent chooses 1 card from their hand and sends it to their Warp.\r\n\n[Activate:Main] [Once per turn] Look at up to 5 cards from the top of your deck, then choose up to 1 red or green \"Raditz\", \"Vegeta\", or \"Nappa\" card among them, add it to your hand, shuffle your deck, and if you added a card to your hand, choose 1 card from your hand and place it in your Drop Area.\r\n\n[Awaken] When your life is at 4 or less : You may choose up to 1 of your energy, switch it to Active Mode, and flip this card over.\r\n\n\r\n\nRaditz, Brotherly Hate\r\n\n[Auto] When this card attacks a Leader Card, your opponent chooses 1 card from their hand and sends it to their Warp.\r\n\n[Activate:Main] [Once per turn] Choose up to 1 red or green \"Saiyan\" card in your Battle Area and it gets +5000 power for the duration of the turn."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"normal","value":8.65,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"normal","value":19.99,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":8.65,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/195245/dragon-ball-super-ccg-assault-of-the-saiyans-pre-release-cards-raditz-raditz-brotherly-hate"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/195245/dragon-ball-super-ccg-assault-of-the-saiyans-pre-release-cards-raditz-raditz-brotherly-hate"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Raditz%20%2F%2F%20Raditz%2C%20Brotherly%20Hate"}]},{"id":"195246","name":"Son Goku // Kaio-Ken Son Goku, Training Complete","number":"BT7-050_PR","subtitle":"Common","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/195246_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/195246_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Assault of the Saiyans Pre-Release Cards"],["number","BT7-050_PR"],["rarity","Common"],["type","Leader"],["color","Green"],["Special Trait","Saiyan"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","Saiyan Saga"],["Character","Son Goku"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Auto] When this card attacks a Leader Card, draw 1 card.\r\n\n[Awaken] When your life is at 4 or less : You may choose up to 1 of your energy, switch it to Active Mode, and flip t