ffect","body":"[Permanent] If your Leader Card is a mono-red \"Saiyan\" card, reduce the energy cost of this card in your hand by 2.\r\n\n[Activate:Battle] [Limit 1] Choose one—\r\n\n• If it's your turn, choose any number of your opponent's Battle Cards that add up to a total power of 30000 or less and KO them.\r\n\n• Choose up to 1 of your Leader Cards or Unison Cards and it gets +15000 power and has its skills negated for the battle. Additionally, if your Leader Card is a \"Broly\" card, the chosen card gets an additional +10000 power for the battle."}],"prices":[{"source":"Cardmarket","items":[{"label":"trend","variant":"foil","value":0.37,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg","variant":"foil","value":0.36,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":0.15,"currency":"EUR"}],"ref":{"value":0.37,"currency":"EUR"},"url":null},{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"foil","value":0.5,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":0.45,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":0.5,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/249667/dragon-ball-super-ccg-saiyan-showdown-gigantic-meteor"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/249667/dragon-ball-super-ccg-saiyan-showdown-gigantic-meteor"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Gigantic%20Meteor"}]},{"id":"250581","name":"Cabba // SS Cabba, Proud Volley","number":"BT15-031","subtitle":"Uncommon","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/250581_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/250581_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Saiyan Showdown"],["number","BT15-031"],["rarity","Uncommon"],["type","Leader"],["color","Blue"],["Special Trait","Saiyan/Alien/Universe 6"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","Champa Saga"],["Character","Cabba"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Auto] Choose 1 \"Universe 6\" card in your hand and discard it: When this card attacks, draw 2 cards.\r\n\n[Awaken] When your life is at 4 or less or you have a blue Unison Card with a specified cost of 2 in play : You may draw 2 cards, add cards from your life to your hand until you have 6 life left, then flip this card over.\r\n\n\r\n\nSS Cabba, Proud Volley\r\n\n[Auto] [Once per turn] If it's your opponent's turn : When you play a blue \"Universe 6\" card, switch up to 1 of your blue energy to Active Mode.\r\n\n[Auto] When this card attacks, draw 1 card.\r\n\n[Activate:Battle] [Once per turn] [Spirit Boost 1] Use up to 1 blue \"Universe 6\" card from your Drop Area in a combo with its skills negated for the turn."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"foil","value":0.28,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":0.15,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"market","variant":"normal","value":0.19,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"normal","value":0.03,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":0.19,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/250581/dragon-ball-super-ccg-saiyan-showdown-cabba-ss-cabba-proud-volley"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/250581/dragon-ball-super-ccg-saiyan-showdown-cabba-ss-cabba-proud-volley"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Cabba%20%2F%2F%20SS%20Cabba%2C%20Proud%20Volley"}]},{"id":"250603","name":"Kale // Kale, Demon of Universe 6","number":"BT15-032","subtitle":"Uncommon","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/250603_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/250603_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Saiyan Showdown"],["number","BT15-032"],["rarity","Uncommon"],["type","Leader"],["color","Blue"],["Special Trait","Saiyan/Alien/Universe 6"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","Universe Survival Saga"],["Character","Kale"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Auto] When this card attacks, draw 1 card.\r\n\n[Auto] At the 