 Area into its owner's Drop Area : This card gets +10000 power for the battle, and -10000 power during the next turn."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"normal","value":0.25,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"normal","value":0.02,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"market","variant":"foil","value":0.78,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":2.63,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":0.25,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/251237/dragon-ball-super-ccg-saiyan-showdown-son-goku-son-goku-destined-confrontation"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/251237/dragon-ball-super-ccg-saiyan-showdown-son-goku-son-goku-destined-confrontation"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Son%20Goku%20%2F%2F%20Son%20Goku%2C%20Destined%20Confrontation"}]},{"id":"251307","name":"Vegeta // Vegeta, Destined Confrontation","number":"BT15-062","subtitle":"Uncommon","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/251307_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/251307_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Saiyan Showdown"],["number","BT15-062"],["rarity","Uncommon"],["type","Leader"],["color","Green"],["Special Trait","Saiyan"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","Saiyan Saga"],["Character","Vegeta"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Auto] [Once per turn] If it's your opponent's turn : When one of your Battle Cards is removed from your Battle Area by an opponent's skill, your opponent chooses 1 card in their hand and discards it.\r\n\n[Activate:Battle] [Once per turn] If your life is less than or equal to your opponent's, this card gets +5000 power for the battle.\r\n\n[Awaken] When your life is at 3 or less or your opponent's Leader Card's back is facing up : You may draw 2 cards, choose up to 1 of your opponent's Unison Cards and remove a marker from it, then flip this card over.\r\n\n\r\n\nVegeta, Destined Confrontation\r\n\n[Auto] When this card attacks, choose up to 1 of your opponent's Unison Cards and remove a marker from it. Additionally, if your opponent doesn't have a Unison Card in play, choose up to 1 green \"Great Ape\" card in your Battle Area, switch it to Active Mode, and negate its skills for the turn.\r\n\n[Auto] [Once per turn] If it's your opponent's turn : When one of your Battle Cards is removed from your Battle Area by an opponent's skill, draw 1 card, and your opponent chooses 1 card in their hand and discards it."}],"prices":[{"source":"Cardmarket","items":[{"label":"trend","value":0.05,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg","value":0.07,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"low","value":0.02,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg7","value":0.05,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg30","value":0.04,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"trend","variant":"foil","value":0.61,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":0.45,"currency":"EUR"}],"ref":{"value":0.05,"currency":"EUR"},"url":null},{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"foil","value":0.48,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":0.29,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"market","variant":"normal","value":0.13,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"normal","value":0.02,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":0.13,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/251307/dragon-ball-super-ccg-saiyan-showdown-vegeta-vegeta-destined-confrontation"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/251307/dragon-ball-super-ccg-saiyan-showdown-vegeta-vegeta-destined-confrontation"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Vegeta%20%2F%2F%20Vegeta%2C%20Destined%20Confrontation"}]},{"id":"251308","name":"King Vegeta, Invasion's Command","number":"BT15-063","subtitle":"Super Rare","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/251308_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn