ption","number":"BT14-078","subtitle":"Uncommon","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/246147_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/246147_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Cross Spirits Pre-Release Cards"],["number","BT14-078"],["rarity","Uncommon"],["type","Battle"],["color","Green"],["Energy(Color Cost)","4 (G)"],["Special Trait","Majin"],["power","15000"],["Combo Power","5000"],["Combo Energy","0"],["Era","Majin Buu Saga"],["Character","Majin Buu"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Evolve]1: \"Gotenks\".\r\n\n[Permanent] If this card would be removed from your Battle Area by an opponent's skill, you may remove 1 of your Majin Tokens from the game instead.\r\n\n[Auto] When this card is played, add up to 1 green Unison Card with 1000 power from your deck to your hand, then shuffle your deck; if you added a card to your hand, choose 1 card in your hand and discard it.\r\n\n[Activate: Main] [Limit 1] (You can only activate this skill once per turn across all copies of this card.) [Spirit Boost 1] (You must remove a marker from your Unison Card to activate this skill.) Play 1 Majin Token, then add up to 1 card from your life to your hand. (Majin Tokens have 15000 power, 0 combo cost, and 5000 combo power.)"}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"normal","value":0.91,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"normal","value":0.45,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":0.91,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/246147/dragon-ball-super-ccg-cross-spirits-pre-release-cards-majin-buu-mighty-absorption"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/246147/dragon-ball-super-ccg-cross-spirits-pre-release-cards-majin-buu-mighty-absorption"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Majin%20Buu%2C%20Mighty%20Absorption"}]},{"id":"246145","name":"Majin Buu, Brilliant Absorption","number":"BT14