] Choose 1 black \"Shadow Dragon\" card in your hand and discard it : when this card attacks, draw 1 card, then switch this card to Active Mode at the end of the turn.\r\n\n[Awaken] When your life is at 4 or less or 7 or more black \"Shadow Dragon\" cards are in your Drop Area : You may draw 1 card, switch up to 1 of your energy to Active Mode, and flip this card over.\r\n\n\r\n\nSyn Shenron, Resonance of Shadow\r\n\n[Blocker]\r\n\n[Auto] When you activate a \"Shadow Dragon\" Extra Card from your hand, your opponent places the top card of their deck in their Drop Area.\r\n\n[Auto] When this card attacks, draw 1 card, and this card gets +5000 power for the turn. At the end of the turn, switch this card to Active Mode.\r\n\n[Activate:Main/Battle] [Once per turn] [Spirit Boost 1] (You must remove a marker from your Unison Card to activate this skill.) Choose up to 1 \"Shadow Dragon\" Extra Card in your hand and activate its [Activate Main/Battle] skill without its energy cost."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"normal","value":1.78,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"normal","value":1.45,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":1.78,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/246159/dragon-ball-super-ccg-cross-spirits-pre-release-cards-syn-shenron-syn-shenron-resonance-of-shadow"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/246159/dragon-ball-super-ccg-cross-spirits-pre-release-cards-syn-shenron-syn-shenron-resonance-of-shadow"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Syn%20Shenron%20%2F%2F%20Syn%20Shenron%2C%20Resonance%20of%20Shadow"}]},{"id":"246163","name":"Towa, Resonance of Shadow","number":"BT14-123","subtitle":"Uncommon","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/246163_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/246163_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Cross Spirits Pre-Release Cards"]