Rejuvenation Pre-Release Cards"],["number","BT12-054"],["rarity","Common"],["type","Extra"],["color","Blue"],["Energy(Color Cost)","1(B)"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Field]\r\n\n[Auto] If your Leader Card is an \"Evil Incarnate\" card : When one of your \"Evil Incarnate\" or \"Demon\" cards is played, place the top card of your deck under this card.\r\n\n[Activate:Main] If there are 4 or more cards under this card and you place this card in its owner's Drop Area : Play up to 1 blue skill-less \"Evil Incarnate\" card with an energy cost of 3 or less from your deck or Drop Area, then shuffle your deck if you looked through it."}],"prices":[{"source":"Cardmarket","items":[{"label":"trend","value":0.02,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg","value":0.03,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"low","value":0.02,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg7","value":0.03,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg30","value":0.04,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"trend","variant":"foil","value":0.02,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":0.1,"currency":"EUR"}],"ref":{"value":0.03,"currency":"EUR"},"url":null}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/231078/dragon-ball-super-ccg-vicious-rejuvenation-pre-release-cards-soul-cleansing-machine"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Soul%20Cleansing%20Machine"}]},{"id":"231079","name":"Lord Slug // Lord Slug, Rejuvenated Invader","number":"BT12-055","subtitle":"Common","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/231079_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/231079_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Vicious Rejuvenation Pre-Release Cards"],["number","BT12-055"],["rarity","Common"],["type","Leader"],["color","Green"],["Special Trait","Namekian/Slug's Army"],["power","10000/20000"],["Era","Lord Slug Saga"],["Character","Lord Slug"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Auto] When this card attacks, you and your opponent draw 1 card.\r\n\n[Auto] If you have 3 or more green energy : When you activate a [Rejuvenate] skill, draw 2 cards, then flip this card over.\r\n\n[Awaken] When your life is at 4 or less : You and your opponent may draw 1 card, then you switch up to 2 of your energy to Active Mode and flip this card over.\r\n\n\r\n\nLord Slug, Rejuvenated Invader\r\n\n[Permanent] If your opponent has 7 or fewer cards in your hand, this card gets -5000 power during battles on your opponent's turn.\r\n\n[Auto] When this card attacks, you and your opponent draw 1 card.\r\n\n[Activate:Main] [Once per turn] If your opponent has 10 or more cards in their hand : Play up to 1 mono-green \"Slug's Army\" card with an energy cost of 2 or less from your Drop Area."}],"prices":[{"source":"Cardmarket","items":[{"label":"trend","value":0.02,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg","value":0.02,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"low","value":0.02,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg7","value":0.03,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg30","value":0.03,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"trend","variant":"foil","value":0.18,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":0.19,"currency":"EUR"}],"ref":{"value":0.03,"currency":"EUR"},"url":null}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/231079/dragon-ball-super-ccg-vicious-rejuvenation-pre-release-cards-lord-slug-lord-slug-rejuvenated-invader"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Lord%20Slug%20%2F%2F%20Lord%20Slug%2C%20Rejuvenated%20Invader"}]},{"id":"231132","name":"Turles // Turles, Fiendish Force","number":"BT12-056","subtitle":"Uncommon","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/231132_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/231132_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Vicious Rejuvenation Pre-Release Cards"],["number","BT12-056"],["rarity","Uncommon"],["type","Leader"],["color","Green"],["Special Trait","Saiyan/Turles Crusher Corps"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","Turles Saga"],["Character","Turles"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Permanent] If a \"Turles Crusher Corps\" card in your Battle Area would be placed in its owner's Drop Area by one of your skills, it's sent to its owner's Warp instead.\r\n\n[Auto] When you place this card in your Leader Area, palce up to 1 {The Tree of Might} from your deck in your opponent's Battle Area.\r\n\n[Auto] When this card attacks, add up to 1 card from your life to your hand, look at up to 5 cards from the top of your deck, add up to 1 \"Turles Crusher Corps\" card among them to your hand, then shuffle your deck.\r\n\n[Awaken] When your life is at 4 or less or your opponent has 3 or more life face up : You may draw 1 card, switch up to 1 of your energy to Active Mode, and flip this card over.\r\n\n\r\n\nTurles, Fiendish Force\r\n\n[Permanent] If a \"Turles Crusher Corps\" card in your Battle Area would be placed in its owner's Drop Area by one of your skills, it's sent to its owner's Warp instead.\r\n\n[Permanent] When this card deals damage, you choose the card your opponent loses from their life.\r\n\n[Activate:Main] [Once per turn] Choose 1 card in your hand and place it at the bottom of your deck : Add 1 {Fruit of the Tree of Might} from your Drop Area to your hand."}],"prices":[{"source":"Cardmarket","items":[{"label":"trend","value":0.07,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg","value":0.05,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"low","value":0.02,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg7","value":0.05,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg30","value":0.05,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"trend","variant":"foil","value":0.44,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg","variant":"foil","value":0.58,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":0.59,"currency":"EUR"}],"ref":{"value":0.05,"currency":"EUR"},"url":null},{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"low","variant":"normal","value":2.99,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":null,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/231132/dragon-ball-sup