p : You may switch up to 1 of your energy to Active Mode, have this card get +5000 power for the turn, and flip this card over.\r\n\n\r\n\nSon Goku, Destined Confrontation\r\n\n[Auto] When this card attacks, draw 1 card.\r\n\n[Activate:Main] Send 4 \"King Kai's Training\" from under a \"King Kai's Planet\" in your Battle Area to their owner's Warps : This card gets +45000 power for the turn, and -15000 power during the next turn.\r\n\n[Activate:Battle] [Once per turn] Place 1 \"King Kai's Training\" from under a \"King Kai's Planet\" in your Battle Area into its owner's Drop Area : This card gets +10000 power for the battle, and -10000 power during the next turn."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"normal","value":7.18,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"normal","value":49.99,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":7.18,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/255079/dragon-ball-super-ccg-saiyan-showdown-pre-release-cards-son-goku-son-goku-destined-confrontation"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/255079/dragon-ball-super-ccg-saiyan-showdown-pre-release-cards-son-goku-son-goku-destined-confrontation"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Son%20Goku%20%2F%2F%20Son%20Goku%2C%20Destined%20Confrontation"}]},{"id":"255081","name":"Vegeta // Vegeta, Destined Confrontation","number":"BT15-062","subtitle":"Uncommon","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/255081_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/255081_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Saiyan Showdown Pre-Release Cards"],["number","BT15-062"],["rarity","Uncommon"],["type","Leader"],["color","Green"],["Special Trait","Saiyan"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","Saiyan Saga"],["Character","Vegeta"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Auto] [Once per turn] If it's your opponent's turn : When one of your Battle Cards is rem