ou can't flip your Leader Card to its back for the turn. If it's your opponent's turn, switch up to 1 of your yellow energy to Active Mode, and this card gets +5000 power for the turn."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"normal","value":1.07,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"normal","value":5.77,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":1.07,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/255116/dragon-ball-super-ccg-saiyan-showdown-pre-release-cards-son-gohan-great-ape-son-gohan-saiyan-impulse"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/255116/dragon-ball-super-ccg-saiyan-showdown-pre-release-cards-son-gohan-great-ape-son-gohan-saiyan-impulse"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Son%20Gohan%20%2F%2F%20Great%20Ape%20Son%20Gohan%2C%20Saiyan%20Impulse"}]},{"id":"255117","name":"Turles // Turles, Accursed Power","number":"BT15-092","subtitle":"Uncommon","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/255117_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/255117_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Saiyan Showdown Pre-Release Cards"],["number","BT15-092"],["rarity","Uncommon"],["type","Leader"],["color","Yellow"],["Special Trait","Saiyan/Turles Crusher Corps"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","Turles Saga"],["Character","Turles"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Permanent] If a \"Turles Crusher Corps\" card in your Battle Area would be placed in its owner's Drop Area by one of your skills, it's sent to its owner's Warp instead.\r\n\n[Auto] When this card is placed in your Leader Area, play up to 1 \"Tree of Might, Divine Roots\" from your deck with 2 markers on it.\r\n\n[Auto] When this card attacks, draw 1 card.\r\n\n[Awaken] When your life is at 4 or less or you have 3 or more life face up : You may draw 2 cards and flip this card over.\r\n\n\r\n\nTurles, Accursed Power\r\n\n[Permanent] If a \"Tur