gonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Scout"}]},{"id":"255159","name":"Fin // Fin, Apocalyptic Absorption","number":"BT15-121","subtitle":"Uncommon","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/255159_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/255159_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Saiyan Showdown Pre-Release Cards"],["number","BT15-121"],["rarity","Uncommon"],["type","Leader"],["color","Black"],["Special Trait","Android"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","Dark Empire Saga"],["Character","Fin"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Auto] When this card attacks, draw 1 card.\r\n\n[Auto] When a card is placed under this card, draw 1 card, add cards from your life to your hand until you have 6 life left, and flip this card over.\r\n\n[Activate:Main] [Once per turn] If all of your energy is black : Choose up to 1 of your opponent's Battle Cards and place it under this card.\r\n\n[Awaken] When your life is at 4 or less : You may draw 2 cards and flip this card over.\r\n\n\r\n\nFin, Apocalyptic Absorption\r\n\n[Permanent] This card gets +5000 power for each card placed under it.\r\n\n[Auto] At the end of your turn, play all of the Battle Cards under this card in your opponent's Battle Area with their skills negated for the game, then place all of the cards under this card in their owner's Drop Areas.\r\n\n[Activate:Main] [Once per turn] If all of your energy is black : Choose up to 1 of your opponent's Battle Cards and place it under this card. Choose up to 1 keyword skill on a card under this card, and this card gains that skill for the turn."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"normal","value":0.42,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"normal","value":0.38,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":0.42,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/255159/dragon-ball-super-ccg-saiyan-showdown-pre-release-cards-fin-fin-apocalyptic-absorption"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/255159/dragon-ball-super-ccg-saiyan-showdown-pre-release-cards-fin-fin-apocalyptic-absorption"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Fin%20%2F%2F%20Fin%2C%20Apocalyptic%20Absorption"}]},{"id":"255160","name":"Skill Hunter Majin Buu","number":"BT15-122","subtitle":"Uncommon","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/255160_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/255160_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Saiyan Showdown Pre-Release Cards"],["number","BT15-122"],["rarity","Uncommon"],["type","Unison"],["color","Black"],["Energy(Color Cost)","X(-)(-)(-)"],["power","15000"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Permanent] Your opponent's skill-less cards can't attack this card.\r\n\n[Auto] [Once per turn] If it's your turn : When a skill-less Battle Card or Unison Card is played in your opponent's Battle Area or Unison Area, draw 1 card.\r\n\n[+1] [Activate:Main] This card gets +5000 power for the turn.\r\n\n[-1] [Activate:Main] If your Leader Card is a black \"Fin\" card : Choose up to 1 of your opponent's Battle Cards and place it under your Leader Card."}],"prices":[{"source":"Cardmarket","items":[{"label":"trend","value":0.1,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg","value":0.04,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"low","value":0.02,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg7","value":0.1,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg30","value":0.08,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"trend","variant":"foil","value":0.09,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg","variant":"foil","value":0.05,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":0.02,"currency":"EUR"}],"ref":{"value":0.09,"currency":"EUR"},"url":null},{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"normal","value":0.22,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"normal","value":0.2,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":0.22,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/255160/dragon-ball-super-ccg-saiyan-sh