 all black multicolor Battle Cards with \"SS4\" in their card names in all of your areas.\r\n\n[Auto] When this card attacks, resolve the effects below according to the number of non-black colors present among black multicolor cards in your Battle Area and Energy Area.\r\n\n• 2+ colors : This card gets +5000 power for the battle, then choose up to 1 of your opponent's Battle Cards and switch it to Rest Mode.\r\n\n• 3+ colors : At the end of the turn, switch up to 1 of your black multicolor energy to Active Mode.\r\n\n• 4+ colors : Draw 1 card, then choose up to 1 of your opponent's Unison Cards and remove a marker from it."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"normal","value":1.5,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"normal","value":1.5,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":1.5,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/247191/dragon-ball-super-ccg-special-anniversary-set-2021-bardock-ss4-bardock-prismatic-striker"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/247191/dragon-ball-super-ccg-special-anniversary-set-2021-bardock-ss4-bardock-prismatic-striker"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Bardock%20%2F%2F%20SS4%20Bardock%2C%20Prismatic%20Striker"}]},{"id":"247192","name":"SS4 Broly, Prismatic Burst","number":"EX19-21","subtitle":"Expansion Rare","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/247192_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/247192_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Special Anniversary Set 2021"],["number","EX19-21"],["rarity","Expansion Rare"],["type","Unison"],["color","Black"],["Energy(Color Cost)","X(-)"],["power","10000"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Permanent] For each marker on this card, it gets +5000 power during your turn.\r\n\n[Auto] [Limit 1] If this card has 1 marker : When this card is played, add a marker to it for every 2 multicolor cards in your e