/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Source%20of%20Power"}]},{"id":"242926","name":"Trunks // Trunks, the Hero's Successor","number":"BT14-031","subtitle":"Uncommon","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/242926_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/242926_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Cross Spirits"],["number","BT14-031"],["rarity","Uncommon"],["type","Leader"],["color","Blue"],["Special Trait","Saiyan/Earthling"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","Hirudegarn Saga"],["Character","Trunks: Youth"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Auto] When this card is placed in your Leader Area, activate up to 1 \"Foreboding Music Box\" from your deck.\r\n\n[Auto] When this card attacks, draw 1 card.\r\n\n[Awaken] When your life is at 4 or less : You may draw 1 card, switch up to 1 of your energy to Active Mode, then flip this card over.\r\n\n\r\n\nTrunks, the Hero's Successor\r\n\n[Auto] When this card attacks, draw 1 card.\r\n\n[Auto] If it's your opponent's turn : When one of your blue Unison Cards with a specified cost of 3 or more is removed from your Unison Area, you may add 1 \"Tapion's Sword\" from your Drop Area to your hand. If you do, choose 1 card in your hand and discard it.\r\n\n[Active:Main] [Once per turn] [Spirit Boost 1] (You must remove a marker from your Unison Card to activate this skill.) This card gets +5000 power for the turn; if you have a blue Unison Card with a specified cost of 3 or more in play, this card gains [Double Strike]."}],"prices":[{"source":"Cardmarket","items":[{"label":"trend","value":0.09,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg","value":0.15,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"low","value":0.02,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg7","value":0.11,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg30","value":0.06,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"trend","variant":"foil","value":0.32,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg","variant":"foil","value":0.99,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":0.02,"currency":"EUR"}],"