: You may draw 2 card, add cards from your life to your hand until you have 6 life left, then flip this card over.\r\n\n\n\r\nSupreme Kai of Time, the Chronokeeper\r\n\n[Auto] [Once per turn] When you play a Battle Card using [Over Realm], draw 1 card, then place up to 3 black Battle Cards from your Warp in your Drop Area.\r\n\n[Activate:Main] [Once per turn] (-), Choose 1 card in your hand and discard it : If you don't have a Unison Card in play, play 1 black Unison Card with no specified cost and 9000 power from your Drop Area or Warp with a marker on it.\r\n\n[Activate:Main] [Once per turn] Place 1 card from your life in your Drop Area : Place up to 2 black Battle Cards from your Warp in your Drop Area; Battle Cards you play using [Over Realm] aren't sent to your Warp at the end of the turn."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":0.59,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"market","variant":"normal","value":0.24,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"normal","value":0.03,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":0.24,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/234958/dragon-ball-super-ccg-supreme-rivalry-supreme-kai-of-time-supreme-kai-of-time-the-chronokeeper"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/234958/dragon-ball-super-ccg-supreme-rivalry-supreme-kai-of-time-supreme-kai-of-time-the-chronokeeper"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Supreme%20Kai%20of%20Time%20%2F%2F%20Supreme%20Kai%20of%20Time%2C%20the%20Chronokeeper"}]},{"id":"234962","name":"Mechikabura // Dark King Mechikabura, Restored to the Throne","number":"BT13-122","subtitle":"Uncommon","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/234962_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/234962_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Supreme Rivalry"],["number","BT13-122"],["rarity","Uncommon"],["type","Leader"],["color","Black"],["power