 your hand, then draw 1 card.\r\n\n[Awaken] When your life is at 4 or less : You may draw 1 card, then switch up to 1 of your energy to Active Mode and flip this card over.\r\n\n\n\r\nTowa & Mechikabura, Dark Conjurers\r\n\n[Permanent] Treat \"Dark Broly\" cards with original energy costs of 9 or less in your hand and non-black Battle Cards with \"Xeno\" in their character names and original energy costs of 9 or less in your hand as if they have no specified cost and reduce their energy costs by 1.\r\n\n[Auto] When this card attacks, draw 1 card, and this card gets +5000 power for the battle.\r\n\n[Auto] [Once per turn] When one of your \"Dark Broly\" cards or non-black Battle Cards with \"Xeno\" in its character name is removed from your Battle Area by an opponent's skill, draw 1 card."}],"prices":[{"source":"Cardmarket","items":[{"label":"trend","variant":"foil","value":0.25,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg","variant":"foil","value":0.49,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":0.05,"currency":"EUR"}],"ref":{"value":0.3,"currency":"EUR"},"url":null},{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"normal","value":0.13,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"normal","value":0.1,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":0.13,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/228893/dragon-ball-super-ccg-expansion-deck-box-set-16-ultimate-deck-towa-towa-and-mechikabura-dark-conjurers"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/228893/dragon-ball-super-ccg-expansion-deck-box-set-16-ultimate-deck-towa-towa-and-mechikabura-dark-conjurers"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Towa%20%2F%2F%20Towa%20%26%20Mechikabura%2C%20Dark%20Conjurers"}]},{"id":"228894","name":"Dark Shenron, Tyrannical Savior","number":"EX16-02","subtitle":"Expansion Rare","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/228894_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplaye