ccolo\" with an energy cost of 3 or less.\r\n\n[Auto] When a card evolves into this card, add up to 1 red \"Namekian\" or \"Demon Clan\" card with an energy cost of 4 or less other than copies of this card, or 1 red Unison Card with a specified cost of 2 from your deck to your hand, then shuffle your deck.\r\n\n[Auto] [Once per turn] When this card is played or attacks, choose up to 1 red \"Demon Clan\" card in your Battle Area and it gets +20000 power for the turn."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"normal","value":0.49,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"normal","value":0.17,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"market","variant":"foil","value":0.12,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":0.12,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":0.49,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/228851/dragon-ball-super-ccg-vicious-rejuvenation-king-piccolo-time-to-fight"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/228851/dragon-ball-super-ccg-vicious-rejuvenation-king-piccolo-time-to-fight"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=King%20Piccolo%2C%20Time%20to%20Fight"}]},{"id":"228852","name":"King Piccolo, Dragon Ball Obsession","number":"BT12-019","subtitle":"Uncommon","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/228852_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/228852_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Vicious Rejuvenation"],["number","BT12-019"],["rarity","Uncommon"],["type","Battle"],["color","Red"],["Energy(Color Cost)","1(R)"],["Special Trait","Namekian"],["power","4000"],["Combo Power","5000"],["Combo Energy","0"],["Era","King Piccolo Saga"],["Character","King Piccolo"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Auto] When this card is played, look at up to 5 cards from the top of your deck, add up to 1 red \"Namekian\" or \"Demon Clan\" card with an energy cost of 4 or less, or 1 red Unis