t] If your life is at 4 or less, this card gets +5000 power during your opponent's turn.\r\n\n[Auto] When this card attacks, draw 1 card.\r\n\n[Activate:Main] If you have 4 or more energy : Choose up to 1 blue \"Son Goku\" and 1 yellow \"Vegeta\" card in your hand with energy costs of 2 or less and play them, you can only play \"Trunks: Future\" and \"Vegito\" cards for the duration of the turn, and you can't activate this skill for the duration of the game.\r\n\n[Awaken] When your life is at 4 or less : You may draw 1 card and flip this card over.\r\n\n\r\n\nSSB Vegito, Energy Eruption\r\n\n[Auto] When this card attacks, draw 1 card.\r\n\n[Auto] [Once per turn] When you combo with 1 or more Battle Cards with a combo cost of 1 in your Energy Area using a skill, choose up to 1 of those Battle Cards, and when the battle ends the chosen card is returned to its owner's hand instead of being placed in its owner's Drop Area."}],"prices":[{"source":"Cardmarket","items":[{"label":"trend","value":0.12,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg","value":0.11,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"low","value":0.02,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg7","value":0.13,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg30","value":0.07,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"trend","variant":"foil","value":45.33,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":60,"currency":"EUR"}],"ref":{"value":0.12,"currency":"EUR"},"url":null},{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"normal","value":0.31,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"normal","value":0.02,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"market","variant":"foil","value":10.2,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":19,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":0.31,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/194089/dragon-ball-super-ccg-assault-of-the-saiyans-son-goku-and-vegeta-ssb-vegito-energy-eruption"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/194089/dragon-ball-super-ccg-assault-of-the-saiyans-son-goku-and-