rgy-Exhaust] (If this card is placed in an Energy Area from any area, it must be placed there in Rest Mode.)\r\n\n[Auto] When this card is placed in your Battle Area and your Leader Card is a \"King Vegeta\" card, choose up to 1 \"Saiyan\" card with an energy cost of 2 or less in your hand, and play it with its skills negated for the duration of the turn. If you played a card, draw 2 cards.\r\n\n[Auto] When your opponent attacks with a card, you may choose 1 red card in your Energy Area, switch it to Rest Mode, and place this card in its owner's Drop Area. If you do, negate the attack."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"normal","value":0.09,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"normal","value":0.09,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"market","variant":"foil","value":0.2,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":0.05,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":0.09,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/194365/dragon-ball-super-ccg-assault-of-the-saiyans-king-vegetas-dynasty"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/194365/dragon-ball-super-ccg-assault-of-the-saiyans-king-vegetas-dynasty"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=King%20Vegeta's%20Dynasty"}]},{"id":"194366","name":"Cabba // Vegeta & Cabba, Master & Pupil","number":"XD1-01","subtitle":"Starter Rare","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/194366_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/194366_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Assault of the Saiyans"],["number","XD1-01"],["rarity","Starter Rare"],["type","Leader"],["color","Yellow"],["Energy(Color Cost)","2(RG)"],["Special Trait","Saiyan/Alien/Universe 6/Universe 7"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","Universe Survival Saga"],["Character","Cabba/Vegeta"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Permanent] You can't include non-\"Universe 6\" Battle Cards in your deck, except for \"Vegeta\" cards.\r\n\n[Auto] When a blue or yellow \"Universe 6\" card is played in your Battle Area, that card gets +5000 power for the duration of the turn, then choose up to 1 card in your life and add it to your hand.\r\n\n[Awaken] When your life is at 4 or less : You may choose up to 2 of your energy, switch them to Active Mode, and flip this card over.\r\n\n\r\n\nVegeta & Cabba, Master & Pupil\r\n\n[Permanent] This card gets +5000 power when all of your opponent's energy is in Rest Mode.\r\n\n[Auto] When this card attacks, draw 1 card.\r\n\n[Auto] When your opponent's Leader Card attacks, if all of your opponent's energy is in Rest Mode, choose up to 2 of your opponent's energy. Cards chosen with this card's skill can't be switched to Active Mode during your opponent's next Charge Phase.\r\n\n[Auto] [Once per turn] When one of your card skills switches an opponent's Battle Card or energy to Rest Mode, draw 1 card."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"normal","value":0.32,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"normal","value":0.17,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":0.32,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/194366/dragon-ball-super-ccg-assault-of-the-saiyans-cabba-vegeta-and-cabba-master-and-pupil"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/194366/dragon-ball-super-ccg-assault-of-the-saiyans-cabba-vegeta-and-cabba-master-and-pupil"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Cabba%20%2F%2F%20Vegeta%20%26%20Cabba%2C%20Master%20%26%20Pupil"}]},{"id":"194367","name":"Vegeta, Saiyan of Universe 7","number":"XD1-02","subtitle":"Starter Rare","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/194367_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/194367_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Assault of the Saiyans"],["number","XD1-02"],["rarity","Starter Rare"],["type","Battle"],["color"