alue":7.52,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":6.99,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"market","variant":"normal","value":0.3,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"normal","value":0.15,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":0.3,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/184376/dragon-ball-super-ccg-destroyer-kings-dende-son-goku-energy-restored"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/184376/dragon-ball-super-ccg-destroyer-kings-dende-son-goku-energy-restored"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Dende%20%2F%2F%20Son%20Goku%2C%20Energy%20Restored"}]},{"id":"184377","name":"Majin Buu // Majin Buu, Ability Absorber","number":"BT6-028","subtitle":"Uncommon","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/184377_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/184377_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Destroyer Kings"],["number","BT6-028"],["rarity","Uncommon"],["type","Leader"],["color","Blue"],["Special Trait","Majin"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","Majin Buu Saga"],["Character","Majin Buu"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Permanent] You can't send cards from Drop Areas to Warps.\r\n\n[Auto] When this card attacks, draw 1 card.\r\n\n[Activate: Main] [Once per turn] [Burst 3] (You must place the top 3 cards of your deck in your Drop Area to activate this skill.) Choose 1 of your energy : You may place the chosen energy in your Drop Area. If you do, choose up to 1 \"Majin Buu\" card in your Drop Area and add it to your energy in Rest Mode.\r\n\n[Awaken] When your life is at 4 or less : You may draw 1 card, then choose up to 1 of your energy, switch it to Active Mode, and flip this card over.\r\n\n\nMajin Buu, Ability Absorber\r\n\n[Permanent] You can't send cards from Drop Areas to Warps.\r\n\n[Auto] [Sparking 7] (This skill takes effect when you have 7 or more cards in your Drop Area.) When this card attacks,