.84,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":0.36,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/184087/dragon-ball-super-ccg-destroyer-kings-son-goku-bonds-of-friendship-son-goku"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/184087/dragon-ball-super-ccg-destroyer-kings-son-goku-bonds-of-friendship-son-goku"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Son%20Goku%20%2F%2F%20Bonds%20of%20Friendship%20Son%20Goku"}]},{"id":"184088","name":"Super Dragon Balls // Super Shenron, the Almighty","number":"BT6-106","subtitle":"Uncommon","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/184088_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/184088_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Destroyer Kings"],["number","BT6-106"],["rarity","Uncommon"],["type","Leader"],["color","Black"],["Special Trait","Shenron"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","Universe Survival Saga"],["Character","Super Dragon Ball/Super Shenron"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Permanent] This card can't attack.\r\n\n[Activate: Main] Switch this card to Rest Mode : Choose up to 2 \r\n\n[Dragon Ball] cards from your deck or life and add them to your hand. Then shuffle any areas you looked through.\r\n\n[Wish] When there are 7 [Dragon Ball] cards in your Drop Area : Choose up to 1 [Dragon Ball] card from your Drop Area, add it to your hand, and flip this card over.\r\n\nSuper Shenron, the Almighty\r\n\n[Permanent[] This card can't attack.\r\n\n[Activate: Main] [Once per turn] Choose one-\r\n\n• Draw 1 card.\r\n\n• Choose 1 \"Desire\" card from your hand with an energy cost less than or equal to your current energy and activate its \r\n\n[Activate: Main] skill.\r\n\n• Remove 7 [Dragon Ball] cards in your Drop Area from the game and choose 20 cards from your Drop Area then shuffle them into your deck. If you do, flip this card over at the end of the turn and take another turn after this one."}],"price