) When this card attacks, draw 1 card, and this card gets +5000 power for the duration of the turn, then choose up to 1 of your opponent's Battle Cards and switch it to Rest Mode.\r\n\n\nThis Giant Card is 11.7\" x 16.3\"."}],"prices":[],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/202292/dragon-ball-super-ccg-oversized-cards-master-roshi-max-power-master-roshi-giant-card"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Master%20Roshi%20%2F%2F%20Max%20Power%20Master%20Roshi%20(Giant%20Card)"}]},{"id":"202290","name":"Black Masked Saiyan // Powerthirst Black Masked Saiyan (Giant Card)","number":"BT5-105","subtitle":"Uncommon","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/202290_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/202290_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Oversized Cards"],["number","BT5-105"],["rarity","Uncommon"],["type","Leader"],["color","Black"],["Special Trait","Saiyan"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","Dark Demon Realm Saga"],["Character","Black Masked Saiyan"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Auto] [Burst 3] (You must place the top 3 cards of your deck in your Drop Area to activate this skill.) When this card attacks, draw 1 card.\r\n\n[Awaken] When your life is at 4 or less : You may choose up to 2 of your energy, switch them to Active Mode, and flip this card over.\r\n\n\r\n\nPowerthirst Black Masked Saiyan \r\n\n[Activate:Main] [Once per turn] [Burst 3] (You must place the top 3 cards of your deck in your Drop Area to activate this skill.) Choose up to 1 black Battle Card with an energy cost of 3 or more in your Drop Area and add it to your hand, and this card gets +5000 power for the duration of the turn.\r\n\n\nThis Giant Card is 11.7\" x 16.3\"."}],"prices":[],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/202290/dragon-ball-super-ccg-oversized-cards-black-masked-saiyan-powerthirst-black-masked-saiyan-giant-card"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Black%20Masked%20Saiyan%20%2F%2F%20Powerthirst%20Black%20Masked%20Saiyan%20(Giant%20Card)"}]},{"id":"533796","name":"SS Vegito // Son Goku & Vegeta, Path to Victory (Giant Card)","number":"BT20-084","subtitle":"Promo","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/533796_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/533796_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Oversized Cards"],["number","BT20-084"],["rarity","Promo"],["type","Leader"],["color","Yellow"],["Special Trait","Saiyan"],["power","20000/15000"],["Era","Majin Buu Saga"],["Character","Vegito/Son Goku/Vegeta"],["BANDAI Disclaimer","This promotional card is marked “Not For Sale” by BANDAI, as the manufacturer prefers that Stores do not sell these cards."]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"SS Vegito\r\n\n[Auto] When this card attacks, draw 1 card.\r\n\n[Auto] If you have 2 or more energy : At the start of any Main Phase, draw 2 cards, add card's from your life to your hand until you have 6 life left, and flip this card to its back.\r\n\n\n\r\nSon Goku & Vegeta, Path to Victory\r\n\n[Auto] When this card attacks, draw 1 card.\r\n\n[Auto] [Once per turn] When a card is placed under a \"Spirit Bomb\" in your Battle Area, choose up to 1 of your opponent's Battle Cards and switch it to Rest Mode.\r\n\n[Activate:Main] Activate up to 1 \"Spirit Bomb\" from your deck, shuffle your deck, and negate this skill for the game."}],"prices":[],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/533796/dragon-ball-super-ccg-oversized-cards-ss-vegito-son-goku-and-vegeta-path-to-victory-giant-card"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=SS%20Vegito%20%2F%2F%20Son%20Goku%20%26%20Vegeta%2C%20Path%20to%20Victory%20(Giant%20Card)"}]},{"id":"533797","name":"Baby // Baby, Awakening With a Grudge (Giant Card)","number":"BT21-035","subtitle":"Promo","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/533797_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/533797_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Oversized Cards"],["number","BT21-035"],["rarity","Promo"],["type","Leader"],["color","Blue"],["Special Trait","Machine Mutant/Saiyan"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","Baby Saga"],["Character","Baby/Vegeta: GT"],["BANDAI Disclaimer","This promotional card is marked “Not For Sale” by BANDAI, as the manufacturer prefers that Stores do not sell these cards."]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"Baby\r\n\n[Auto] When you place this card in your Leader Area, activate up to 1 \"Universal Tuffleization Plan\" from your deck.\r\n\n[Auto] Place 1 mono-blue \"Vegeta : GT\" with an energy cost of 1 or 1 mono-blue \"Brainwashed\" from your hand under a \"Universal Tuffleization Plan\" in your Battle Area : When this card attacks, draw 2 cards.\r\n\n[Awaken] When your life is at 4 or less or there are 4 or more cards under a \"Universal Tuffleization Plan\" in your Battle Area : Draw 1 card, switch up to 1 of your energy to Active Mode, then add cards from your life to your hand until you have 6 life left.\r\n\n\nBaby, Awakening With a Grudge\r\n\n[Overlord] [Once per turn]\r\n\n[Auto] When this card attacks, choose one—\r\n\n• Look at up to 5 cards from the top of your deck, place up to 1 blue \"Brainwashed\" card under a \"Universal Tuffleization Plan\" in your Battle Area, then shuffle your deck.\r\n\n• Place up to 1 of your opponent's Battle Cards that does not include \"Son Goku: GT\" from their Drop under a \"Universal Tuffleization Plan\" in your Battle Area.\r\n\n[Activate:Main] [Once per turn] Add up to 1 card from your life to your hand, choose up to 1 of your blue \"Brainwashed\" cards, and that card gets +5000 power for the turn."}],"prices":[],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/533797/dragon-ball-super-ccg-oversized-cards-baby-baby-awakening-with-a-grudge-giant-card"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Baby%20%2F%2F%20Baby%2C%20Awakening%20With%20a%20Grudge%20(Giant%20Card)"}]},{"id":"170448","name":"Piccolo Jr. // Piccolo Jr., Evil Reborn","number":"SD4-01","subtitle":"Starter Rare","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/170448_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/170448_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Oversized Cards"],["number","SD4-01"],["rarity","Starter Rare"],["type","Leader"],["color","Green"],["Special Trait","Namekian"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","World Martial Arts Tournament Saga"],["Character","Piccolo Jr."]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Auto] When this card attacks a Leader Card, draw 1 card.\r\n\n[Awaken] When your life is at 4 or less : You may choose up to 2 \r\n\nof your energy, switch them to Active Mode, and flip this card over.\r\n\n\nPiccolo Jr., Evil Reborn\r\n\n[Auto] When this card attacks, draw 1 card.\r\n\n[Activate: Main] [Once per turn] G : Choose 1 of your opponent's Battle Cards with an energy cost of 5 or less and KO it, then this card gains +5000 power for the duration of the turn."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"low","variant":"normal","value":0.56,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":null,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/170448/dragon-ball-super-ccg-oversized-cards-piccolo-jr-piccolo-jr-evil-reborn"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/170448/dragon-ball-super-ccg-oversized-cards-piccolo-jr-piccolo-jr-evil-reborn"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Piccolo%20Jr.%20%2F%2F%20Piccolo%20Jr.%2C%20Evil%20Reborn"}]},{"id":"170449","name":"Golden Great Ape Son Goku // Long Odds SS4 Son Goku","number":"SD5-01","subtitle":"Starter Rare","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/170449_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/170449_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Oversized Cards"],["number","SD5-01"],["rarity","Starter Rare"],["type","Leader"],["color","Yellow"],["Special Trait","Saiyan/Goku's Lineage"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","Baby Saga"],["Character","Son Goku: GT"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Auto] When this card attacks a Leader Card, draw 1 card.\r\n\n[Awaken] When your life is at 4 or less : You may choose up to 2 of your energy, switch them to Active Mode, and flip this card over.\r\n\n\nLong Odds SS4 Son Goku\r\n\n[Auto] When this card attacks, draw 1 card.\r\n\n[Permanent] When your life is less than or equal to your opponent's life, this card gains +5000 power and [Critical] (When this card inflicts damage to your opponent's life, they place that many cards in their Drop Area instead of their hand) during your turn."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"normal","value":2.58,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"normal","value":2.58,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":2.58,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/170449/dragon-ball-super-ccg-oversized-cards-golden-great-ape-son-goku-long-odds-ss4-son-goku"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/170449/dragon-ball-super-ccg-oversized-cards-golden-great-ape-son-goku-long-odds-ss4-son-goku"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Golden%20Great%20Ape%20Son%20Goku%20%2F%2F%20Long%20Odds%20SS4%20Son%20Goku"}]},{"id":"202289","name":"Bardock // Bardock, Hope of the Saiyans (Giant Card)","number":"TB3-018","subtitle":"Uncommon","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/202289_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/202289_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Oversized Cards"],["number","TB3-018"],["rarity","Uncommon"],["type","Leader"],["color","Blue"],["Special Trait","Saiyan/Bardock's 