ku // SS Son Goku, Beginning of a Legend","number":"BT24-055","subtitle":"Uncommon","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/564100_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/564100_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Promotion Cards"],["number","BT24-055"],["rarity","Uncommon"],["type","Leader"],["color","Green"],["Special Trait","Saiyan"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","Frieza Saga"],["Character","Son Goku"],["BANDAI Disclaimer","This promotional card is marked “Not For Sale” by BANDAI, as the manufacturer prefers that Stores do not sell these cards."]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Auto] When this card attacks, look at up to 5 cards from the top of your deck, add up to 1 \"Saiyan\", \"Earthling\", or \"Namekian\" card?all green and with an energy cost of 4 or less?to your hand, then shuffle your deck.\r\n\n[Awaken] When your life is at 4 or less or you have a green Z-Unison with a specified cost of 2 in play : Draw 1 card, switch up to 1 of your energy to Active Mode, and add cards from your life to your hand until you have 6 life left.\r\n\n\nSS Son Goku, Beginning of a Legend\r\n\n[Auto] When this card attacks, this card gets +5000 power for the battle.\r\n\n[Auto] [Once per turn] When one of your Battle Cards gains [Blocker] by the skill of a green Z-Unison, add up to 1 green Battle Card from your Drop to your Z-Energy with its skills negated for the turn.\r\n\n[Activate:Battle] [Once per turn] Draw 1 card, then choose up to 1 of your cards and it gets +5000 power for the battle."}],"prices":[],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/564100/dragon-ball-super-ccg-promotion-cards-son-goku-ss-son-goku-beginning-of-a-legend"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Son%20Goku%20%2F%2F%20SS%20Son%20Goku%2C%20Beginning%20of%20a%20Legend"}]},{"id":"620171","name":"Bardock, Father's Help (Premium Alt-Art Set 2025 Vol.1)","number":"BT24-058","subtitle":"Promo","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/620171_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/620171_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Promotion Cards"],["number","BT24-058"],["rarity","Promo"],["type","Z-Unison"],["color","Green"],["Energy(Color Cost)","X(GG)"],["Z-Energy Cost","1"],["power","15000"],["BANDAI Disclaimer","This promotional card is marked “Not For Sale” by BANDAI, as the manufacturer prefers that Stores do not sell these cards."]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Auto] [Once per turn] When your Battle Card with [Blocker] is removed from your Battle Area by an opponent's skill, add 1 marker to this card.\r\n\n[+/-0] [Activate:Main] If your Leader is green : Draw 1 card, then choose up to 1 of your green \"Saiyan\", \"Earthling\", or \"Namekian\" Battle Cards and it gains [Blocker] until the end of your opponent's turn.\r\n\n[+/-0] [Activate:Main] Place 1 of your Z-Energy in its owner's Drop : Your opponent discards 1 card from their hand."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"foil","value":9.77,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":9,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":9.77,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/620171/dragon-ball-super-ccg-promotion-cards-bardock-fathers-help-premium-alt-art-set-2025-vol1"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/620171/dragon-ball-super-ccg-promotion-cards-bardock-fathers-help-premium-alt-art-set-2025-vol1"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Bardock%2C%20Father's%20Help%20(Premium%20Alt-Art%20Set%202025%20Vol.1)"}]},{"id":"641161","name":"Son Goku, Face-Off With an Emperor (Premium Alt-Art Set 2025 Vol.2)","number":"BT24-063","subtitle":"Super Rare","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/641161_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/64