 per turn] When you play a \"Gogeta: Br\" card, draw 1 card, then switch up to 1 of your Red/Blue multicolor energy to Active Mode at the end of the turn."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"foil","value":25.4,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":30,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":25.4,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/257731/dragon-ball-super-ccg-promotion-cards-vegeta-ssg-vegeta-crimson-warrior-gold-stamped"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/257731/dragon-ball-super-ccg-promotion-cards-vegeta-ssg-vegeta-crimson-warrior-gold-stamped"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Vegeta%20%2F%2F%20SSG%20Vegeta%2C%20Crimson%20Warrior%20(Gold%20Stamped)"}]},{"id":"257738","name":"Vegeta // SSG Vegeta, Crimson Warrior","number":"P-360 PR","subtitle":"Promo","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/257738_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/257738_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Promotion Cards"],["number","P-360 PR"],["rarity","Promo"],["type","Leader"],["color","Blue"],["Special Trait","Saiyan"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","DBS: Broly Saga"],["Character","Vegeta: Br"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Auto] When this card attacks, draw 1 card.\r\n\n[Activate: Battle] [Once per turn] Choose up to 1 red or blue \"Saiyan\" card in your hand and discard it : Look at up to 3 cards from the top of your deck, add up to 1 \"Son Goku: Br\", \"Vegeta: Br\" or \"Gogeta: Br\" card among them to your hand, then place the remaining cards on top of your deck in any order.\r\n\n[Awaken] When your life is at 4 or less or your have 4 or more energy : You may draw 1 card, switch up to 1 of your energy to Active Mode, and flip this card over.\r\n\n\nSSG Vegeta, Crimson Warrior\r\n\n[Permanent] Red \"Gogeta: Br\" cards in your hand gain the following skill:\r\n\n• [Union-Fusion] RB2: \"Son Goku: Br\" and \"Vegeta: Br\"\r\n\n[Auto] When this card attacks, draw 1 card.\r\n\n[Auto] [Once per turn] When you play a \"Gogeta: Br\" card, draw 1 card, then switch up to 1 of your Red/Blue multicolor energy to Active Mode at the end of the turn."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"foil","value":3.24,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":3.01,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":3.24,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/257738/dragon-ball-super-ccg-promotion-cards-vegeta-ssg-vegeta-crimson-warrior"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/257738/dragon-ball-super-ccg-promotion-cards-vegeta-ssg-vegeta-crimson-warrior"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Vegeta%20%2F%2F%20SSG%20Vegeta%2C%20Crimson%20Warrior"}]},{"id":"257732","name":"SSG Trunks, Spirit Empowered (Gold Stamped)","number":"P-361 PR","subtitle":"Promo","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/257732_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/257732_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Promotion Cards"],["number","P-361 PR"],["rarity","Promo"],["type","Unison"],["color","Blue"],["Energy(Color Cost)","X (BB)"],["power","15000"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Auto] When this card is placed in a Drop Area from your Unison Area, choose up to 1 of your Unison Cards with [Empower Blue 3] and Add a marker to it.\r\n\n [+1] [Activate: Battle] [Burst 1] Choose up to 1 of your blue cards and it gets +5000 power for the battle.\r\n\n[-1] [Auto] When a marker is removed from this card by an opponent's attack, this card gets +10000 power for the turn."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"foil","value":6.86,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":6.52,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":6.86,"currency":"USD"},"url":"