es do not sell these cards."]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Unique] [Barrier]\r\n\n[Union-Fusion] [Limit 1] \"Son Goten: GT\" card and \"Trunks: GT\" card, both yellow.\r\n\n[Permanent] If your Leader is a yellow \"Gotenks : Adolescence\" and you choose cards to use with this card's [Union] skill from a hand, you may choose the specified Battle Card in your Drop. If you do, place the chosen cards at the bottom of your deck in any order.\r\n\n[Permanent] If this card is in Rest Mode, only your opponent's Leader can attack Unisons."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"foil","value":0.29,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":0.18,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":0.29,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/506537/dragon-ball-super-ccg-promotion-cards-ss3-gotenks-flying-fists"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/506537/dragon-ball-super-ccg-promotion-cards-ss3-gotenks-flying-fists"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=SS3%20Gotenks%2C%20Flying%20Fists"}]},{"id":"528389","name":"Nappa // Vegeta & Nappa, Saiyan Invasion","number":"P-551","subtitle":"Promo","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/528389_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/528389_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Promotion Cards"],["number","P-551"],["rarity","Promo"],["type","Leader"],["color","Blue"],["Special Trait","Saiyan"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","Saiyan Saga"],["Character","Vegeta/Nappa"],["BANDAI Disclaimer","This promotional card is marked “Not For Sale” by BANDAI, as the manufacturer prefers that Stores do not sell these cards."]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"Nappa\r\n\n[Auto] When this card attacks, add up to 1 card from your life to your hand, look at up to 5 cards from the top of your deck, add up to 1 blue \"Saiyan\" card to your hand, then shuffle your deck.\r\n\n[Awaken] When your life is at 4 or less : Draw 1 card and switch up to 1 of your energy to Active Mode.\r\n\nVegeta & Nappa, Saiyan Invasion\r\n\n[Auto] When this card attacks, draw 1 card.\r\n\n[Activate:Main] [Once per turn] If you have a \"Saibaiman\" Z-Battle Card in play : Play 1 Saibaiman Token (5000 power, 0 combo cost, and 5000 combo power).\r\n\n[Activate:Battle] [Once per turn] KO 1 of your blue \"Nappa\" cards : Choose up to 1 of your blue \"Vegeta\" cards and it gets +5000 power and [Double Strike] for the battle."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"foil","value":2,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":1.2,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":2,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/528389/dragon-ball-super-ccg-promotion-cards-nappa-vegeta-and-nappa-saiyan-invasion"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/528389/dragon-ball-super-ccg-promotion-cards-nappa-vegeta-and-nappa-saiyan-invasion"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Nappa%20%2F%2F%20Vegeta%20%26%20Nappa%2C%20Saiyan%20Invasion"}]},{"id":"528388","name":"Saibaimen, Living Bombs","number":"P-552","subtitle":"Promo","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/528388_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/528388_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Promotion Cards"],["number","P-552"],["rarity","Promo"],["type","Z-Battle"],["color","Blue"],["Energy(Color Cost)","1(B)"],["Z-Energy Cost","1"],["Special Trait","Alien"],["power","5000"],["Era","Saiyan Saga"],["Character","Saibaiman"],["BANDAI Disclaimer","This promotional card is marked “Not For Sale” by BANDAI, as the manufacturer prefers that Stores do not sell these cards."]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Auto] If your Leader is a \"Nappa\" card : When this card or one of your Saibaiman Tokens attacks, choose up to 1 of your opponent's Battle Cards, return it to its owner's hand, and remove the attacking card from the game.\r\n\n[Auto] When this card is KO'd by a \"Vegeta\" card's skill, draw 1 card."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"foil","value":0.33,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":0.2,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":0.33,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/528388/dragon-ball-super-ccg-promotion-cards-saibaimen-living-bombs"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/528388/dragon-ball-super-ccg-promotion-cards-saibaimen-living-bombs"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Saibaimen%2C%20Living%20Bombs"}]},{"id":"528967","name":"SS Son Goku & SS Vegeta & SS Trunks, United","number":"P-553","subtitle":"Promo","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/528967_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/528967_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Promotion Cards"],["number","P-553"],["rarity","Promo"],["type","Battle"],["color","Red"],["Energy(Color Cost)","4(R)"],["Special Trait","Saiyan/Earthling"],["power","15000"],["Combo Power","5000"],["Combo Energy","0"],["Era","Android 13 Saga"],["Character","Son Goku/Vegeta/Trunks: Future"],["BANDAI Disclaimer","This promotional card is marked “Not For Sale” by BANDAI, as the manufacturer prefers that Stores do not sell these cards."]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Auto] [Once per turn] If you have 3 or more energy : When this card attacks, use up to 1 mono-red card with 5000 combo power from under this card in a combo with its skills negated for the turn. Additionally, if the card used in the combo is a \"Son Goku\", \"Vegeta\", or \"Trunks : Future\" card, switch this card to Active Mode, then choose up to 1 of your opponent’s Battle Cards with 25000 power or less and KO it.\r\n\n[Activate:Main] [Limit 1], if your Leader is a red \"Son Goku\" card and you choose 1 of your red \"Saiyan\" Battle Cards : Play this card from your hand, then place the chosen card under this card."}],"prices":[{"source":"Cardmarket","items":[{"label":"trend","variant":"foil","value":0.3,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"avg","variant":"foil","value":0.23,"currency":"EUR"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":0.1,"currency":"EUR"}],"ref":{"value":0.26,"currency":"EUR"},"url":null},{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"market","variant":"foil","value":0.48,"currency":"USD"},{"label":"low","variant":"foil","value":0.32,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":{"value":0.48,"currency":"USD"},"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/528967/dragon-ball-super-ccg-promotion-cards-ss-son-goku-and-ss-vegeta-and-ss-trunks-united"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/528967/dragon-ball-super-ccg-promotion-cards-ss-son-goku-and-ss-vegeta-and-ss-trunks-united"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=SS%20Son%20Goku%20%26%20SS%20Vegeta%20%26%20SS%20Trunks%2C%20United"}]},{"id":"639854","name":"SS3 Vegito, Ultimate Battle Form (Premium Anniversary Box 2025)","number":"P-560","subtitle":"Promo","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/639854_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/639854_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Promotion Cards"],["number","P-560"],["rarity","Promo"],["type","Battle"],["color","Blue"],["Energy(Color Cost)","4(BB)"],["Special Trait","Saiyan"],["power","20000"],["Combo Power","5000"],["Combo Energy","0"],["Era","Special"],["Character","Vegito"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Auto] When this card is played, choose up to 1 of your opponent's Battle Cards and return it to its owner's hand. Then at the start of your opponent's turn, add up to 1 non-[Super Combo] card from your energy to your hand, and add the same amount of cards from your hand to your energy.\r\n\n[Acti