s%20(2018%20Big%20Card%20Pack)"}]},{"id":"181148","name":"Gogeta // Knockout Strike Gogeta (2018 Big Card Pack)","number":"SD6-01","subtitle":"Promo","image":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/181148_in_1000x1000.jpg","thumb":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/181148_400w.jpg","details":[["set","Promotion Cards"],["number","SD6-01"],["rarity","Promo"],["type","Leader"],["color","Blue"],["Special Trait","Saiyan"],["power","10000/15000"],["Era","Janemba Saga"],["Character","Gogeta"]],"texts":[{"titleKey":"effect","body":"[Auto] [Burst 2] (You must place the top 2 cards of your deck in your Drop Area to activate this skill.) When this card attacks, draw 1 card.\r\n\n[Awaken] When your life is at 4 or less : You may choose up to 2 of your energy, switch them to Active Mode, and flip this card over.\r\n\n\r\n\nKnockout Strike Gogeta\r\n\n[Auto] [Sparking 5] (This skill takes effect when you have 5 or more cards in your Drop Area.) When this card attacks, draw 1 card. If you have 3 or more energy, this card gets +5000 power for the duration of the turn, and if you have 5 or more energy, this card also gains [Double Strike] for the duration of the turn.\r\n\n[Activate:Main] Choose 1 card from your hand and place it in your Drop Area : Your opponent can only activate [Counter] skills once for the duration of the turn."}],"prices":[{"source":"TCGplayer","items":[{"label":"low","variant":"normal","value":66.01,"currency":"USD"}],"ref":null,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/181148/dragon-ball-super-ccg-promotion-cards-gogeta-knockout-strike-gogeta-2018-big-card-pack"}],"links":[{"label":"TCGplayer","url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/181148/dragon-ball-super-ccg-promotion-cards-gogeta-knockout-strike-gogeta-2018-big-card-pack"},{"label":"Cardmarket","url":"https://www.cardmarket.com/fr/DragonBallSuper/Products/Search?searchString=Gogeta%20%2F%2F%20Knockout%20Strike%20Gogeta%20(2018%20Big%20Card%20Pack)"}]},{"id":"543023","name":"Supreme Kai of T